# libretranslate
msgid "**\"Created its own account\"** = the git-forge identity from Decision #13; the PR is authored by the agent, not a shared bot."
msgstr "**\"Cruthaíodh a chuntas féin\"** = an chéannacht git-forge ó Chinneadh #13; an PR údar ag an ngníomhaire, ní bot roinnte."

# libretranslate
msgid "**\"Spins up local containers\"** happens inside the agent's isolated sandbox, which MUST therefore be able to run compose workloads (nested Docker inside the isolated runtime). This is a real capability constraint the agent role MUST declare; it is exactly the kind of host-near need Decision #4's runtime selection has to accommodate."
msgstr "**\"Spins suas coimeádáin áitiúla\"** a tharlaíonn taobh istigh de bhosca gainimh iargúlta an ghníomhaire, a MUST dá bhrí sin, in ann a reáchtáil ualaí oibre a chumadh (Docker neadaithe taobh istigh den runtime iargúlta). Is é seo an cumas fíor srian ar an ról gníomhaire MUST dhearbhú; tá sé go díreach ar an chineál de riachtanas óstach-near Cinneadh #4'Tá rogha runtime chun freastal ar."

# libretranslate
msgid "**\"Waits for feedback\"** = the agent polls the PR through the git-forge MCP server (025); the human review gate stays human."
msgstr "**\"Fanann le haghaidh aiseolas\"** = na vótaíochtaí gníomhaire na PR tríd an bhfreastalaí MCP git-forge (025); Fanann an geata athbhreithnithe daonna an duine."

# libretranslate
