# libretranslate
msgid "**A `svc-ai-litellm` gateway is the single model entrypoint.** It exposes one OpenAI-compatible `/v1` endpoint and routes to backends via its `model_list`. No consumer addresses a provider directly."
msgstr "**Amharc ar gach eolas `svc-ai-litellm` Is geata an iontráil samhail amháin.** Nochtadh sé amháin OpenAI-compatible `/v1` endpoint agus bealaí chun cúltaca trína `model_list`. Ní thugann aon tomhaltóir aghaidh ar sholáthraí go díreach."

# libretranslate
msgid "**A `svc-ai-lmstudio` role is added as a routable backend, x86/GPU node only.** It deploys LM Studio in headless server mode (`lms server`, OpenAI-compatible API) and registers behind the gateway. LM Studio has no arm64 Linux server build, so it MUST be pinned to an x86 (typically GPU) node via placement constraint and MUST NOT be scheduled onto the Raspberry Pi / arm64 agent nodes of [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md). LM Studio ships primarily as a desktop GUI; the role MUST use its headless/server mode, and the README MUST document the container caveat (GPU passthrough, licensing/model-download constraints)."
msgstr "**Amharc ar gach eolas `svc-ai-lmstudio` Tá ról seo a leanas mar backend routable, x86/ GPU nód amháin.** imscaradh sé LM Stiúideo i mód freastalaí headless (`lms server`, OpenAI-comhoiriúnach API) agus cláir taobh thiar den tairseach. LM Studio Tá aon lámh64 freastalaí Linux thógáil, mar sin MUST sé a pinned le x86 (de ghnáth GPU) nód trí srianta socrúcháin agus NÍ MÓR a sceidealta ar an Pi / lámh Sú craobh64 nóid gníomhaire de [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md). longa Stiúideo LM go príomha mar GUI deisce; an ról MUST úsáid a mód headless / freastalaí, agus an MUST README doiciméad an caveat coimeádán (GPU passthrough, ceadúnaithe / srianta múnla-íoslódáil)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**A blocked mode is NEVER a reason to silently switch to another.** If a mode cannot run (the swarm NFS wedge below, a wedged daemon, a missing host capability), STOP the whole sweep, report the blocker together with the exact recovery command, and wait for it to be cleared. You MUST NOT fall back to a `modes=compose`-only (or any reduced) sweep to look productive: it hides the unmet swarm parity and never satisfies the compose-AND-swarm gate. Resume the full sweep only once the blocker is gone."
msgstr "**Tá modh bac NEVER chúis a aistriú go ciúin go ceann eile.** Más rud é nach féidir modh reáchtáil (an ding NFS swarm thíos, daemon ding, cumas óstach ar iarraidh), STOP an scuab iomlán, tuairisc a thabhairt ar an blocker mar aon leis an ordú a ghnóthú cruinn, agus fanacht chun é a ghlanadh. NÍ MÓR duit titim ar ais go dtí `modes=compose`Go raibh maith agat (nó aon laghdú) scuabadh chun breathnú táirgiúil: seithí sé an parity swarm unmet agus ní shásaíonn sé an geata-AND-swarm. Glac leis an scuab iomlán ach amháin nuair a bhíonn an blocker imithe."

# libretranslate
msgid "**A change in `services.hugo.source_version`** invalidates the clone, which invalidates `COPY ./services/repository/` in the Dockerfile, which triggers a fresh `hugo` build on the next deploy."
msgstr "**Athrú ar `services.hugo.source_version`** neamhbhailí an Clón, a chuireann ó bhail `COPY ./services/repository/` sa Dockerfile, a chuireann tús úr `hugo` thógáil ar an chéad imscaradh eile."

# libretranslate
msgid "**A dump needs a running engine.** It is replayed through ``docker exec``, so unlike a file tree it cannot be restored onto a bare host. After a total loss the order is: deploy the stack, stop the consumers, replay, start them again. The step names which of the two states is missing — a stopped container that only needs starting, or no container at all."
msgstr "**Ní mór dhumpáil inneall ag rith.** Tá sé replayed tríd ``docker exec``, mar sin murab ionann agus crann comhaid ní féidir é a chur ar ais ar óstach lom. Tar éis caillteanas iomlán is é an t-ordú: imscaradh an chairn, stop a chur leis na tomhaltóirí, replay, iad a thosú arís. Na hainmneacha céim a bhfuil an dá stát ar iarraidh - coimeádán stop a riachtanais ach ag tosú, nó aon choimeádán ar chor ar bith."

# libretranslate
msgid "**A dump needs a running engine.** It is replayed through `docker exec`, so unlike a file tree it cannot be restored onto a bare host. After a total loss the order is: deploy the stack, stop the consumers, replay, start them again. The step names which of the two states is missing — a stopped container that only needs starting, or no container at all."
msgstr "**Ní mór dhumpáil inneall ag rith.** Tá sé replayed tríd `docker exec`, mar sin murab ionann agus crann comhaid ní féidir é a chur ar ais ar óstach lom. Tar éis caillteanas iomlán is é an t-ordú: imscaradh an chairn, stop a chur leis na tomhaltóirí, replay, iad a thosú arís. Na hainmneacha céim a bhfuil an dá stát ar iarraidh - coimeádán stop a riachtanais ach ag tosú, nó aon choimeádán ar chor ar bith."

