msgstr "**A atógáil fórsa** gan athrú foinse-leagan is féidir a spreagadh ag imréitigh an ról ar taisce íomhá:"

# libretranslate
msgid "**A generation holding a cluster dump fails the drill.** `baudolo-restore` has no subcommand that replays one, so that database cannot be proven restorable — the honest verdict is a red, not a silent skip."
msgstr "**Teipeann ar ghlúin a bhfuil dumpl braisle aige an druil.** `baudolo-restore` Níl aon fho-ordaithe go replays amháin, ionas nach féidir bunachar sonraí a chruthú restorable - Is é an fíorasc macánta dearg, ní skip adh."

# libretranslate
msgid "**A probe for every container.** Health checks are composed from prefixes and are mandatory: every declared image either carries a probe or states why it cannot have one, enforced from both sides. Probes hit the port the container actually binds, no longer derive an HTTP Host from a kernel hostname, and are defined once instead of per proxy. Rescue diagnostics pin the dnsmasq listener loss to its moment, sample what the resolver answers rather than just its socket, probe the daemon.json upstreams, and record the whole boot instead of the last 10 000 lines."
msgstr "**A probe do gach coimeádán.** Tá seiceálacha sláinte comhdhéanta ó réimeanna agus tá siad éigeantach: déanann gach íomhá dearbhaithe probe nó deir cén fáth nach féidir leis ceann amháin a bheith aige, a chur i bhfeidhm ón dá thaobh. Probes bhuail an calafort ceangalann an coimeádán i ndáiríre, a thuilleadh a dhíorthú ó óstach HTTP ó hostname eithne, agus tá siad sainithe uair amháin in ionad in aghaidh an seachfhreastalaí. Tarrthála diagnóisic bioráin an caillteanas éisteachta dnsmasq go dtí a nóiméad, sampla cad freagraí an réiteora seachas díreach a soicéad, probe an daemon.json upstreams, agus taifead ar an tosaithe ar fad in ionad an deireanach 10 000 línte."

# libretranslate
msgid "**A role may narrow the pool.** `meta/services.yml.<primary_entity> .architectures` lists what the role can run on, next to `modes`, because both state a capability rather than a testing preference. The row draws from the intersection of the run's pool with the declarations of the role and of every role the deploy planner brings up for that variant, because the deploy pulls those in too; an empty intersection aborts the matrix."
msgstr "**D'fhéadfadh ról caol an linn snámha.** `meta/services.yml.<primary_entity> .architectures` liostaí cad is féidir leis an ról a reáchtáil ar, in aice le `modes`, mar gheall ar an dá stát cumas seachas rogha tástála. Tarraingíonn an tsraith as crosbhealach chomhthiomsú an rúid le dearbhuithe an róil agus gach ról a thugann an pleanálaí imscaradh suas le haghaidh an athraithe sin, mar gheall ar pulls an imscaradh iad siúd i freisin; aborts crosbhealach folamh an maitrís."

