# libretranslate
msgid "**Adapter in front of the sidecar:** The ``gitea-mcp`` sidecar runs as compose service ``giteamcpupstream`` on the role’s own network only, so nothing but the adapter reaches it. It answers ``initialize`` and ``tools/list`` to any caller because it holds no credential of its own and expects each client to supply a Gitea token per request, which makes it unsafe to expose directly. The adapter is what authenticates: a client presents the ``mcp_bearer`` credential and is refused with 401 otherwise, and the adapter presents the minted Gitea token upstream via ``ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY``."
msgstr "**Adapter os comhair an sidecar:** An bhfuil ``gitea-mcp`` Ritheann sidecar mar sheirbhís a chumadh ``giteamcpupstream`` ar an ról líonra féin amháin, mar sin aon rud ach sroicheann an adapter é. Freagraí sé ``initialize`` agus ``tools/list`` d'aon ghlaoiteoir toisc nach bhfuil aon chreidiúnacht dá chuid féin aige agus go bhfuil súil ag gach cliant chun chomhartha Gitea a sholáthar in aghaidh na hiarrata, rud a fhágann nach bhfuil sé sábháilte a nochtadh go díreach. Is é an adapter cad fíordheimhnithe: cuireann cliant na ``mcp_bearer`` credential agus diúltaíodh leis 401 ar shlí eile, agus cuireann an cuibheoir an Gitea chomhartha suas srutha minted trí ``ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY``."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Adapter in front of the sidecar:** The `gitea-mcp` sidecar runs as compose service `giteamcpupstream` on the role's own network only, so nothing but the adapter reaches it. It answers `initialize` and `tools/list` to any caller because it holds no credential of its own and expects each client to supply a Gitea token per request, which makes it unsafe to expose directly. The adapter is what authenticates: a client presents the `mcp_bearer` credential and is refused with 401 otherwise, and the adapter presents the minted Gitea token upstream via `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY`."
msgstr "**Adapter os comhair an sidecar:** An bhfuil `gitea-mcp` Ritheann sidecar mar sheirbhís a chumadh `giteamcpupstream` ar an ról líonra féin amháin, mar sin aon rud ach sroicheann an adapter é. Freagraí sé `initialize` agus `tools/list` d'aon ghlaoiteoir toisc nach bhfuil aon chreidiúnacht dá chuid féin aige agus go bhfuil súil ag gach cliant chun chomhartha Gitea a sholáthar in aghaidh na hiarrata, rud a fhágann nach bhfuil sé sábháilte a nochtadh go díreach. Is é an adapter cad fíordheimhnithe: cuireann cliant na `mcp_bearer` credential agus diúltaíodh leis 401 ar shlí eile, agus cuireann an cuibheoir an Gitea chomhartha suas srutha minted trí `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY`."

