# libretranslate
msgid "**Advanced Security Options:** Benefit from multi-factor authentication, configurable password policies, and secure session management."
msgstr "**Roghanna Slándála Casta:** Sochar ó fhíordheimhniú ilfhachtóir, beartais phasfhocal configurable, agus bainistíocht seisiúin slán."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Advanced Security:** Incorporates TLS encryption, DKIM, and SPF to secure your communications and prevent spoofing."
msgstr "**Ard Slándáil:** Corpraithe criptithe TLS, DKIM, agus SPF a dhaingniú do chumarsáid agus spoofing chosc."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Advanced openresty load-balancing strategies.** v1 uses default round-robin in the per-app `upstream` block. Weighted distribution, least-connections, sticky sessions (`ip_hash` / cookie-based), and active HTTP healthchecks are out of scope. Adding them is a follow-up requirement and only becomes load-bearing once a service is regularly run with replicas > 1, which itself depends on shared storage being NFS-backed for that service."
msgstr "**Casta straitéisí ualach-chothromú openresty.** v v v v v v1 úsáidí réamhshocraithe bhabhta-robin in aghaidh an-app `upstream` bloc. Dáileadh ualaithe, lú-naisc, seisiúin greamaitheacha (`ip_hash` / bunaithe ar fhianán), agus tá gníomhach HTTP healthchecks as raon feidhme. Is iad a chur le ceanglas leantach agus a thiocfaidh chun bheith ach ualach-tionchar uair amháin go bhfuil seirbhís ar siúl go rialta le macasamhailí × 1, a bhraitheann féin ar stóráil roinnte a bheith NFS-aiseolas don tseirbhís sin."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Agent dashboards are public behind proxy + Keycloak OIDC.** `web-app-hermes` and `web-app-openclaw` follow the standard `web-app-*` contract: own canonical domain, reverse-proxy routing, SSO enforced via [`web-app-keycloak`](../../roles/web-app-keycloak/). Hermes uses its native self-hosted OIDC support. OpenClaw's native OIDC is unverified upstream: if absent, the dashboard sits behind the platform's standard auth-proxy pattern (SSO enforced at the proxy, OpenClaw's own token auth staying internal-only). No unauthenticated public surface either way."
msgstr "**Tá Painéal na nIonstraimí Gníomhaire poiblí taobh thiar de seachfhreastalaí + Keycloak OIDC.** `web-app-hermes` agus `web-app-openclaw` lean an caighdeán `web-app-*` conradh: fearainn Canonical féin, ródú droim ar ais, SSO i bhfeidhm trí [`web-app-keycloak`](../../roles/web-app-keycloak/). Úsáideann Hermes a tacaíocht OIDC dúchais féin-óstáil. OpenClaw OIDC dúchais unverified upstream: más rud é as láthair, suíonn an Painéal na nIonstraimí taobh thiar de na ardán patrún auth-proxy caighdeánach (SSO i bhfeidhm ag an seachfhreastalaí, dearbhán OpenClaw féin ag fanacht go hinmheánach-amháin). Níl dromchla poiblí admhaithe ar bhealach."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Agent gateway:** The container runs the OpenClaw gateway bound to the LAN interface on port 18789, with an HTTP health check against `/healthz`."
msgstr "**geata Gníomhaire:** Ritheann an coimeádán an geata OpenClaw ceangailte leis an comhéadan LAN ar port 18789, le seiceáil sláinte HTTP i gcoinne `/healthz`."

# libretranslate
