# libretranslate
msgid "**Assignment is deterministic, never random.** It follows the row's index in the global discovery order and the sweep number, so re-running a sweep reproduces the run. Discovery order itself is stabilised by `INFINITO_DISCOVERY_SEED`, which CI sets to the run id, so the plan table, the discover job and every chunk block of one run agree without passing state between them."
msgstr "**Tá Sannadh cinntitheach, riamh randamach.** Leanann sé an tsraith ar innéacs san ord fionnachtana domhanda agus an líon sweep, mar sin ath-reáchtáil sweep atáirgeadh an rith. Tá ord Discovery féin chobhsaithe ag `INFINITO_DISCOVERY_SEED`, a leagann CI ar an id reáchtáil, mar sin an tábla plean, an post a fháil amach agus gach bloc smután de reáchtáil amháin aontú gan dul stáit eatarthu."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Assignment reads the row's position like an odometer.** The distro is the low digit and the filesystem the high one, so consecutive rows walk every pairing instead of a diagonal through it. Turning both on the position directly covers only `n` of the `n x m` pairs whenever the two pools are the same length, and the sweep number does not unlock it, because it shifts both by the same amount."
msgstr "**Léann Sannadh seasamh an tsraith ar nós odometer.** Is é an distro an dhigit íseal agus an córas comhaid an ceann ard, mar sin sraitheanna as a chéile ag siúl gach pairing in ionad trasnánach tríd. Ag casadh an dá ar an seasamh Clúdaíonn díreach ach amháin `n` de na `n x m` péirí aon uair a bhfuil an dá linnte ar an fad céanna, agus nach bhfuil an líon sweep dhíghlasáil é, toisc go shifts sé araon ag an méid céanna."

