# libretranslate
msgid "**Avoid Root Logins & Plaintext Passwords** Infinito.Nexus MUST NOT allow logging in via the root user or using simple passwords. Instead, an SSH key MUST be generated and transferred during system initialization. When executing commands as root, always use `sudo` (or, if necessary, `sudo su`, but only if you understand the risks). (More information on [SSH](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell) and [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) is available on Wikipedia.)"
msgstr "**Seachain Logins Root & Pasfhocail Plaintext** Infinito.Nexus NÍ MÓR cead logáil isteach tríd an úsáideoir fréimhe nó ag baint úsáide as focal faire simplí. Ina áit sin, MUST eochair SSH a ghiniúint agus a aistriú le linn thúsú córas. Nuair orduithe fhorghníomhú mar fhréamh, i gcónaí a úsáid `sudo` (nó, más gá, `sudo su`, ach amháin má thuigeann tú na rioscaí). (Tuilleadh eolais faoi [SSH S](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell) agus [taiseachas aeir: fliuch](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) Tá sé ar fáil ar Vicipéid.)"

