msgstr "**Bunaithe ar imscaradh**: rathúil `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=<role> full_cycle=true` reáchtáil mar a shainmhínítear i [Naisc ábhartha eile](compose.md)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Baudolo-compatible layout:** snapshots land in the same `<machine-hash>/<repo>/<generation>` tree as the container backups, so pull and cleanup tooling applies unchanged."
msgstr "**Baudolo-compatible leagan amach:** snapshots talamh sa chéanna `<machine-hash>/<repo>/<generation>` crann mar na cúltacaí coimeádán, mar sin tarraingt agus glanadh tooling feidhm gan athrú."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Baudolo-compatible layout:** snapshots land in the same ``<machine-hash>/<repo>/<generation>`` tree as the container backups, so pull and cleanup tooling applies unchanged."
