# libretranslate
msgid "**Be Collaborative:** Foster an environment where everyone can contribute freely. Offer help and constructive feedback, and work together towards common goals."
msgstr "**Bí Comhoibritheach:** Timpeallacht a chothú inar féidir le gach duine cur faoi shaoirse. Cabhrú Tairiscint agus aiseolas cuiditheach, agus obair le chéile i dtreo spriocanna coitianta."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Be Inclusive:** Welcome contributions from all backgrounds and experiences. Encourage diverse perspectives and engage in constructive dialogue."
msgstr "**Bí cuimsitheach:** Ranníocaíochtaí Fáilte ó gach cúlra agus taithí. Peirspictíochtaí éagsúla a spreagadh agus dul i mbun idirphlé cuiditheach."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Be Respectful:** Communicate and collaborate with courtesy, empathy, and respect. Listen to others’ opinions and value their input."
msgstr "**Bí Measach:** Cumarsáid agus comhoibriú le cúirtéis, comhbhá, agus meas. Éist le daoine eile’ tuairimí agus luach a n-ionchur."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Bearer-key API server:** The API server is gated by a generated `API_SERVER_KEY`, and calls to `/v1/models` without that key are rejected."
msgstr "**freastalaí API Bearer-eochair:** Tá an freastalaí API gated ag a ghintear `API_SERVER_KEY`, agus glaonna chuig `/v1/models` gan an eochair a dhiúltú."

