# libretranslate
msgid "**Best practices compliant** with modern SSH usage"
msgstr "**Na cleachtais is fearr comhlíontach** le úsáid SSH nua-aimseartha"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Better cross-distro stability:** sys-pip-install now resolves the correct pip executable dynamically and uses ansible.builtin.pip, reducing interpreter/PATH mismatches; plus CoreDNS is a compose dependency and yay auto-rebuilds if the binary is broken after libalpm ABI changes."
msgstr "**Cobhsaíocht trasteorann níos fearr:** steals-pip-shuiteáil réitíonn anois an pip ceart executable dinimiciúil agus úsáideann ansible.builtin.pip, ag laghdú mismatches ateangaire / PATH; móide CoreDNS Is spleáchas a chumadh agus yay uathoibríoch-tógálacha má tá an dénártha briste tar éis athruithe libalpm ABI."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Beware of Phishing and Social Engineering** You MUST verify email senders, avoid clicking on unknown links, and MUST NEVER share your passwords or 2FA codes with anyone. (Learn more about [Phishing](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phishing) and [Social Engineering](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Social_engineering_(security)) on Wikipedia.)"
msgstr "**Beware Phishing agus Innealtóireacht Shóisialta** MUST tú a fhíorú seoltóirí ríomhphoist, a sheachaint cliceáil ar naisc anaithnid, agus MUST NEVER roinnt do phasfhocal nó 2cóid FA le duine ar bith. (Foghlaim tuilleadh faoi [Ag smaoineamh](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phishing) agus [Innealtóireachta sóisialta](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Social_engineering_(security)) ar Vicipéid.)"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Bind Mount Robustness:** Fixed CI-specific bind mount issues, ensured /tmp/gh-action visibility, prevented file-vs-directory conflicts, and asserted OpenResty/NGINX mount sources before startup."
msgstr "**Dé Mount Robustness:** Saincheisteanna ceangail CI-shonrach Seasta, infheictheacht cinnte / cnáib / g-gníomh, coinbhleachtaí comhad-vs-eolaire chosc, agus a dhearbhaigh foinsí OpenResty / NGINX mount roimh thús."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Book Cataloging:** Add, search, and organize books; import/export libraries."
msgstr "**Leabhar Catalógáil:** Cuir, cuardach, agus leabhair a eagrú; allmhairiú / leabharlanna a onnmhairiú."

# libretranslate
msgid "**BookWyrm** is a self-hosted social reading platform where users can share books, post reviews, follow each other, and join federated conversations across the Fediverse. It is a community-driven alternative to proprietary platforms like Goodreads. Readers can catalog their library, track reading progress, and discover new books through friends and federated timelines."
msgstr "**Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí** Is ardán léitheoireachta sóisialta féin-óstáil áit ar féidir le húsáideoirí leabhair a roinnt, athbhreithnithe post, leanúint ar a chéile, agus comhráite cónasctha ar fud na Fediverse. Is rogha eile pobail-tiomáinte d'ardáin dílseánaigh cosúil le Goodreads. Is féidir le léitheoirí a gcuid leabharlainne a chatalógú, dul chun cinn léitheoireachta a rianú, agus leabhair nua a fháil trí chairde agus amlínte chothaithe."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Bootstrap Volume Exclusion:** Ignores known bootstrap volumes (e.g., `/var/www/bootstrap`)."
msgstr "**Eisiamh Imleabhar Buataisítrap:** Ignores ar a dtugtar buataisítrap imleabhair (e.g., `/var/www/bootstrap`)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Bootstrap Volume Exclusion:** Ignores known bootstrap volumes (e.g., ``/var/www/bootstrap``)."
msgstr "**Eisiamh Imleabhar Buataisítrap:** Ignores ar a dtugtar buataisítrap imleabhair (e.g., ``/var/www/bootstrap``)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Bootstrap leaves no stored root token.** The first deploy holds it in memory, pins both AppRole halves to inventory values, then revokes it. Tokens reach the CLI through stdin and the container token helper, never through process arguments, and the helper file is removed at the end of the run."
msgstr "**Fágann Buataisítrap aon dearbhán fréimhe stóráilte.** Tá an chéad imscaradh i gcuimhne, bioráin araon halves AppRole le luachanna fardal, ansin é a chúlghairm. Tokens teacht ar an CLI trí stdin agus an cúntóir token coimeádán, riamh trí argóintí phróiseas, agus tá an comhad cúntóir a bhaint ag deireadh an reáchtáil."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Bootstrap-styled interface**: clean, minimalistic, and responsive layout."
msgstr "**Buataisítrap-styled comhéadan**: glan, íostach, agus leagan amach sofhreagrach."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Both deployment modes are supported** (`modes.compose.enabled: true`, `modes.swarm.enabled: true`), with swarm running a single node pinned to the manager."
msgstr "**Tacaíonn an dá mhodh imscaradh** (`modes.compose.enabled: true`, `modes.swarm.enabled: true`), le swarm reáchtáil nód amháin pinned leis an mbainisteoir."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Both** auth plugins: `jellyfin-plugin-ldapauth` (central OpenLDAP, all clients) **and** `9p4/jellyfin-plugin-sso` (Keycloak OIDC, web one-click)."
msgstr "**An dá rud** auth plugins: `jellyfin-plugin-ldapauth` (OpenLDAP lárnach, gach cliant) **agus** `9p4/jellyfin-plugin-sso` (Keycloak OIDC, gréasáin amháin cliceáil)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Bounded ranges:** A tool whose schema declares ``start``, ``end`` and ``step`` has its point count checked against ``result_items`` and is refused with the smallest step that fits, so the upstream never scans a range whose result the adapter would discard."
msgstr "**Raon teoranta:** A uirlis a ndearbhaíonn scéimre ``start``, ``end`` agus ``step`` Tá a chomhaireamh pointe sheiceáil i gcoinne ``result_items`` agus diúltaítear leis an gcéim is lú a oireann, mar sin ní scanann an sruth cothrom le raon a mbeadh an cuibheoir ag caitheamh le hábhar."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Bounded ranges:** A tool whose schema declares `start`, `end` and `step` has its point count checked against `result_items` and is refused with the smallest step that fits, so the upstream never scans a range whose result the adapter would discard."
msgstr "**Raon teoranta:** A uirlis a ndearbhaíonn scéimre `start`, `end` agus `step` Tá a chomhaireamh pointe sheiceáil i gcoinne `result_items` agus diúltaítear leis an gcéim is lú a oireann, mar sin ní scanann an sruth cothrom le raon a mbeadh an cuibheoir ag caitheamh le hábhar."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Bounded resources:** The container is capped at 4 CPUs, 8 GB of memory and 2048 processes, and the role declares a minimum of 4 GB free storage for building the image; downloaded models grow the volume beyond that."
msgstr "**Acmhainní teoranta:** Tá an coimeádán capped ag 4 LAPanna, 8 GB de chuimhne agus 2048 próisis, agus dearbhaíonn an ról ar a laghad 4 stóráil saor in aisce GB chun an íomhá a thógáil; fásann samhlacha íoslódáil an toirt níos faide ná sin."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Break-glass ``cmkadmin``:** Seeded on first run via ``CMK_PASSWORD`` and re-converged onto the running site on every deploy; reachable via the local login form only when the SSO gate is absent."
msgstr "**Briseadh gloine ``cmkadmin``:** Seeded ar an gcéad reáchtáil trí ``CMK_PASSWORD`` agus ath-chomhchuibhithe isteach ar an suíomh ag rith ar gach imscaradh; reachable tríd an bhfoirm logála áitiúil ach amháin nuair a bhíonn geata SSO as láthair."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Break-glass `cmkadmin`:** Seeded on first run via `CMK_PASSWORD` and re-converged onto the running site on every deploy; reachable via the local login form only when the SSO gate is absent."
msgstr "**Briseadh gloine `cmkadmin`:** Seeded ar an gcéad reáchtáil trí `CMK_PASSWORD` agus ath-chomhchuibhithe isteach ar an suíomh ag rith ar gach imscaradh; reachable tríd an bhfoirm logála áitiúil ach amháin nuair a bhíonn geata SSO as láthair."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Break-glass admin** - a local administrator seeded via the first-run wizard (`/Startup`), independent of SSO/LDAP."
msgstr "**Break-glass admin** - riarthóir áitiúil síol tríd an draoi chéad-reáchtáil (`/Startup`), neamhspleách ar SSO/LDAP."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Break-glass admin** - a local administrator seeded via the first-run wizard (``/Startup``), independent of SSO/LDAP."
msgstr "**Break-glass admin** - riarthóir áitiúil síol tríd an draoi chéad-reáchtáil (``/Startup``), neamhspleách ar SSO/LDAP."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Break-glass local admin:** `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN*` seeds a local admin from the `web-app-semaphore-breakglass` user in every variant, reachable through the login form only when LDAP is disabled."
msgstr "**Briseadh-gloine admin áitiúil:** `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN*` síolta admin áitiúil as an `web-app-semaphore-breakglass` úsáideoir i ngach leagan, reachable tríd an bhfoirm logáil isteach ach amháin nuair a bhíonn LDAP faoi mhíchumas."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Break-glass local admin:** ``SEMAPHORE_ADMIN*`` seeds a local admin from the ``web-app-semaphore-breakglass`` user in every variant, reachable through the login form only when LDAP is disabled."
