# libretranslate
msgid "**Breaking Changes**"
msgstr "**Ag briseadh Athruithe**"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Breaking Changes:** Migration from *util-* to bundle inventories under *inventories/bundles/*; deployments must migrate to new bundle and role names. Central package and AUR model via *SYS_PACKAGES* and *SYS_AUR_PACKAGES*; new roles *sys-aur* and *sys-aur-install*; renames including *util-desk-dev-core* to *dev-core*, *util-desk-dev-python* to *dev-python*, *util-desk-dev-arduino* to *dev-arduino*; *util-srv-corporate-identity* removed."
msgstr "**Briseadh Athruithe:** Imirce ó *Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí* a fardail bundle faoi *fardail/bundles/*; Ní mór imscaradh imirce go dtí bundle nua agus ainmneacha ról. pacáiste Lárnach agus múnla AUR trí *SYS_PACKAGES* agus *SYS_AUR_PACKAGES*; róil nua *taiseachas aeir: fliuch* agus *Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí*; athainmneacha lena n-áirítear *riachtanais uisce: measartha* go dtí *dev-lárnach*, *cliceáil grianghraf a mhéadú* go dtí *cliceáil grianghraf a mhéadú*, *cliceáil grianghraf a mhéadú* go dtí *taiseachas aeir: fliuch*; *fóntais-ionchorpraithe* as oifig."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Bridges are explicit and validated.** When an addon itself integrates with another role, it MUST list the bridged service key under `bridges:`. Each listed key MUST resolve to a service block already declared in the same role's `meta/services.yml`. Lint fails otherwise. Front-door auth gates such as oauth2-proxy are not addon bridges unless the addon itself talks to that service. **Two distinct meanings of \"bridge\" exist and MUST NOT be conflated:** the `bridges:` *field* names an in-repo cross-role service dependency (e.g. an addon that talks to `svc-db-openldap`), whereas `mechanism: bridge` marks an addon that *is* a network/appservice bridge to an external system (e.g. a Matrix mautrix bridge to WhatsApp/Telegram). A single addon MAY be both: a `mechanism: bridge` addon MAY also declare a `bridges:` dependency on an in-repo service it relies on."
msgstr "**Tá droichid follasach agus bailíochtaithe.** Nuair a chomhtháthaíonn addon féin le ról eile, liostaíonn sé an eochair seirbhíse droichead faoi `bridges:`. Gach MUST eochair liostaithe réiteach le bloc seirbhíse atá dearbhaithe cheana féin sa ról céanna `meta/services.yml`. Leint theipeann ar a mhalairt. Tosaigh-door auth geataí ar nós oauth2-Ní droichid bhreiseáin iad -proxy mura gcabhraíonn an breiseán féin leis an tseirbhís sin. **Dhá bríonna ar leith de \"bridge\" ann agus NACH MÓR a conflated:** an `bridges:` *réimse réimse réimse* ainmneacha spleáchas seirbhíse in-repo tras-ról (e.g. addon a labhraíonn le `svc-db-openldap`), whereas `mechanism: bridge` marcanna addon go *Is maith liom* droichead líonra / seirbhísí chuig córas seachtrach (e.g. droichead mautrix Maitrís go WhatsApp / Teileagram). A MAY addon amháin a bheith araon: a `mechanism: bridge` addon MAY dhearbhú freisin `bridges:` spleáchas ar sheirbhís in-repo braitheann sé ar."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Browser Cache:** Browsers cache responses based on HTTP headers like `Cache-Control` or `Expires`."
msgstr "**Brabhsálaí Cache:** Brabhsálaithe freagraí taisce bunaithe ar headers HTTP mhaith `Cache-Control` nó `Expires`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Browser:** Clear the browser cache or use a private window."
msgstr "**Brabhsálaí:** Glan an taisce bhrabhsálaí nó fuinneog phríobháideach a úsáid."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Builder stage:** pinned ``hugomods/hugo:exts-<version>`` (extended Hugo) clones the configured content repository and runs ``hugo --minify -e <env> -b <baseURL>`` to render the site to ``/public``."
msgstr "**Céim tógála:** bláthanna cumhra: cumhráin ``hugomods/hugo:exts-<version>`` (síneadh Hugo) clones an stór ábhar cumraithe agus ritheann ``hugo --minify -e <env> -b <baseURL>`` a dhéanamh ar an suíomh a ``/public``."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Builder stage:** pinned `hugomods/hugo:exts-<version>` (extended Hugo) clones the configured content repository and runs `hugo --minify -e <env> -b <baseURL>` to render the site to `/public`."
msgstr "**Céim tógála:** bláthanna cumhra: cumhráin `hugomods/hugo:exts-<version>` (síneadh Hugo) clones an stór ábhar cumraithe agus ritheann `hugo --minify -e <env> -b <baseURL>` a dhéanamh ar an suíomh a `/public`."

