# libretranslate
msgid "**Chain-native:** the generation lands in the standard backup tree, so ``svc-bkp-remote-2-local`` pulls it and ``svc-bkp-local-2-device`` mirrors it onto the encrypted device without extra wiring."
msgstr "**Slabhra-native:** na tailte a ghiniúint sa chrann cúltaca caighdeánach, mar sin ``svc-bkp-remote-2-local`` Tarraingíonn sé agus ``svc-bkp-local-2-device`` scátháin sé ar an gléas criptithe gan sreangú breise."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Chain-native:** the generation lands in the standard backup tree, so `svc-bkp-remote-2-local` pulls it and `svc-bkp-local-2-device` mirrors it onto the encrypted device without extra wiring."
msgstr "**Slabhra-native:** na tailte a ghiniúint sa chrann cúltaca caighdeánach, mar sin `svc-bkp-remote-2-local` Tarraingíonn sé agus `svc-bkp-local-2-device` scátháin sé ar an gléas criptithe gan sreangú breise."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Changed**"
msgstr "**Athrú**"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Changed:** Default distribution switched to *Debian* and CI image handling aligned. Python baseline raised: *dev-python* installs Python 3.11+ by default; *requires-python* raised to *>=3.11*. Cross distro Python interpreter and pip handling unified via *sys-pip-install*. Dashboard deployment uses fixed image *ghcr.io/kevinveenbirkenbach/port-ui:1.0.0* and mounts generated *config.yaml* read only. Alerting hardened with explicit timeouts for compose and email, plus portable mailer and systemd instance fallbacks."
msgstr "**Athrú:** Dáileadh réamhshocraithe aistrigh chuig *De réir a chéile* agus láimhseáil íomhá CI ailínithe. Python baseline ardaithe: *cliceáil grianghraf a mhéadú* Uirlisí ilchuspóireacha 3.11+ de réir réamhshocraithe; *riachtanais-python* ardaíodh go *× =3.11*. Cross distro Ateangaire Python agus láimhseáil pip aontaithe trí *Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí*. Úsáideann imscaradh Dashboard íomhá seasta *ghcr.io/kevinveenbirkenbach/port-ui:1.0.0* agus mounts ghintear *config.yaml* léamh ach amháin. Alerting cruaite le timeouts follasach do chumadh agus r-phost, móide mailer iniompartha agus fallbacks shampla systemd."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Changing a password changes it everywhere.** A user declares how its password must be generated, the inventory pins one for every declared user, a new generator produces API-key shapes, the deploy rotates credentials between its two passes, and a reset command exists. Applications that persist an administrator password at install now realign it when the declared one changes: Nextcloud, Moodle, EspoCRM, Jellyfin, Listmonk, Discourse, Checkmk, xWiki, n8n, Matrix and the dedicated MariaDB and Postgres engines. Checkmk keeps a 401 fatal so a wrong password cannot lock the account out."
msgstr "**Athrú focal faire athruithe sé i ngach áit.** Dearbhaíonn úsáideoir conas ní mór a phasfhocal a ghiniúint, na bioráin fardal amháin do gach úsáideoir dearbhaithe, táirgeann gineadóir nua cruthanna API-eochair, rothlaíonn an imscaradh dintiúir idir a dhá Gabhann, agus tá ordú athshocrú ann. Iarratais a leanann focal faire riarthóir ag a shuiteáil anois fíorign sé nuair a bheidh na hathruithe dearbhaithe amháin: Nextcloud, Moodle, EspoCRM, Jellyfin, Listmonk, Discourse, Checkmk, xWiki, n8n, Maitrís agus an MariaDB tiomanta agus Iargres innill. Coinníonn Checkmk 401 marfach mar sin ní féidir le focal faire mícheart glas an cuntas amach."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Checks precede the grant:** The admission checks run inside the agent role before it deploys, so a refusal prevents the embodied container rather than following it."
msgstr "**Seiceálacha roimh an deontas:** Ritheann na seiceálacha iontrála taobh istigh de ról an ghníomhaire sula n-imíonn sé, mar sin cuireann diúltú cosc ar an gcoimeádán corpraithe seachas é a leanúint."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Clean up** any stale vHost files under ``sys-svc-cln-domains``."
msgstr "**Glan suas** aon stale vHost comhaid faoi ``sys-svc-cln-domains``."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Clean up** any stale vHost files under `sys-svc-cln-domains`."
msgstr "**Glan suas** aon stale vHost comhaid faoi `sys-svc-cln-domains`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Clean up** leftover configs when running in cleanup mode 🧹"
msgstr "**Glan suas** Cóipeáil nasc leis an tweet Leabaigh an Tweet ."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Cleaner Docker environments:** Removing implicit cgroup volumes prevents unwanted anonymous volumes and makes container behavior more predictable."
msgstr "**Timpeallachtaí Docker níos glaine:** A bhaint toirt cgroup intuigthe cosc toirteanna gan ainm gan iarraidh agus a dhéanann iompar coimeádán níos intuartha."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Cleanup & Reset Modes**"
msgstr "**Glanadh agus Athshocraigh Modhanna**"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Cleanup Mode**: Removes the wildcard config file when `CERTBOT_FLAVOR` is set to `dedicated` and `MODE_CLEANUP` is enabled. 🗑️"
msgstr "**Glanadh Mód**: Bain an comhad config cárta fiáin nuair a `CERTBOT_FLAVOR` Tá sé leagtha síos `dedicated` agus `MODE_CLEANUP` Tá cumasaithe."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Cleanup Mode**: Removes the wildcard config file when ``CERTBOT_FLAVOR`` is set to ``dedicated`` and ``MODE_CLEANUP`` is enabled. 🗑️"
msgstr "**Glanadh Mód**: Bain an comhad config cárta fiáin nuair a ``CERTBOT_FLAVOR`` Tá sé leagtha síos ``dedicated`` agus ``MODE_CLEANUP`` Tá cumasaithe."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Cleanup between rounds.** Before each non-first iteration the wrapper runs [entity.sh](../../../scripts/tests/deploy/local/purge/entity.sh) for **every** app in the previous round's include set. The next round therefore boots from an empty host, which guarantees cross-round state coherence: nothing the previous round deployed (whether it stays in the current round's closure or falls out) can leak into round R, so variants are free to disagree on which deps they pull in. The final round is followed by no purge so the last state remains available for inspection or follow-up specs."
msgstr "**Glanadh idir babhtaí.** Roimh gach atriall neamh-chéad dul síos ritheann an fillteán [entity.sh](../../../scripts/tests/deploy/local/purge/entity.sh) le haghaidh **gach rud** Áirítear app sa bhabhta roimhe leagtha. An chéad bhabhta eile dá bhrí sin buataisí ó óstach folamh, a ráthaíonn comhleanúnachas stáit tras-timthriall: aon rud an bhabhta roimhe imscaradh (cibé an bhfanann sé i dúnadh an bhabhta reatha nó an dtagann sé amach) Is féidir le sceitheadh isteach R bhabhta, mar sin tá leaganacha saor in aisce a n-aontaíonn ar a deps siad tarraingt isteach. Tá an babhta deiridh ina dhiaidh sin ag aon purge mar sin tá an stát deireanach ar fáil le haghaidh iniúchadh nó specs leantach."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Client-facing authentication:** The adapter issues its own bearer. The upstream credential authenticates the adapter to the provider and says nothing about who called the adapter, which is the gap the project-owned MCP sidecars leave open."
msgstr "**Fíordheimhniú Cliant-facing:** Eisíonn an adapter a iompróir féin. Déanann an dintiúir réamhtheachtach an cuibheoir a fhíordheimhniú chuig an soláthraí agus deir sé aon rud faoi a d'iarr an cuibheoir, arb é an bhearna é an taobhcharr MCP atá faoi úinéireacht an tionscadail a fhágáil ar oscailt."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Clones a remote SSH config repository** into ``~/.ssh`` using the ``desk-git`` role."
msgstr "**Clones iargúlta SSH stór config** isteach i ``~/.ssh`` ag baint úsáide as an ``desk-git`` ról."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Clones a remote SSH config repository** into `~/.ssh` using the `desk-git` role."
