# libretranslate
msgid "**Consolidated object storage:** artifacts, LFS, uploads, packages, external diffs, dependency proxy, terraform state, CI secure files and pages buckets on any S3-compatible endpoint; named volumes (``gitlab_shared``, ``gitlab_uploads``, ``gitlab_builds``) carry the data when object storage is disabled."
msgstr "**Stóráil réad Comhdhlúite:** artifacts, LFS, uaslódáil, pacáistí, diffs seachtracha, seachfhreastalaí spleáchas, stát terraform, CI comhaid slán agus buicéid leathanaigh ar aon S3-compatible endpoint; méideanna ainmnithe (``gitlab_shared``, ``gitlab_uploads``, ``gitlab_builds``) a dhéanamh ar na sonraí nuair a stóráil réad faoi mhíchumas."

