# libretranslate
msgid "**Control is raw device access plus agent code execution; no robotics middleware is mandated.** Hermes drives the hardware by executing code directly against the granted devices (GPIO/I2C/SPI/serial/video libraries), consistent with its self-exploration. This is the deliberate choice over a ROS2/middleware abstraction: the embodied device is already the trust boundary (there is no microVM here), so the agent runs code on the device itself. A middleware layer MAY be added later per robot but is not required by this role."
msgstr "**Is rialú rochtain gléas amh móide forghníomhú cód gníomhaire; aon robotics lár-earraí sainordaithe.** Hermes thiomáineann na crua-earraí trí fhorghníomhú cód go díreach i gcoinne na feistí a deonaíodh (GPIO/I2C/SPI/serial/video leabharlanna agus leabharlanna), ag teacht lena féin-pléascadh. Is é seo an rogha d’aon ghnó ar ROS2/ teibí middleware: Is é an gléas chorpraithe cheana féin ar an teorainn iontaobhais (Níl aon microVM anseo), mar sin ritheann an gníomhaire cód ar an bhfeiste féin. A ciseal lár-earraí MAY a chur leis níos déanaí in aghaidh an robot ach nach bhfuil ag teastáil ag an ról seo."

# libretranslate
