msgstr "**Suíomh Gréasáin:** Thabhairt isteach an * marcóir il-sonraí Bunachar le haghaidh síolú braislí-aware, ar chumas glan IargreSQL dumpaí braislí agus séantaí níos soiléire síolta."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Database-aware:** consumer apps seed their connection metadata into a central ``databases.csv``, so the same run can dump SQL state alongside the file payload."
msgstr "**Bunachar Sonraí:** apps tomhaltóirí síol a gcuid meiteashonraí nasc isteach i lárnach ``databases.csv``, mar sin is féidir leis an reáchtáil chéanna Dumpáil SQL stáit taobh leis an pálasta comhad."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Database-aware:** consumer apps seed their connection metadata into a central `databases.csv`, so the same run can dump SQL state alongside the file payload."
msgstr "**Bunachar Sonraí:** apps tomhaltóirí síol a gcuid meiteashonraí nasc isteach i lárnach `databases.csv`, mar sin is féidir leis an reáchtáil chéanna Dumpáil SQL stáit taobh leis an pálasta comhad."

# libretranslate
msgid "**De-dup / loop prevention.** With any future bidirectional bridge, an event mirrored A→B must not echo back B→A. v1 (one-way) sidesteps this, but the record↔event id mapping table introduced in v1 MUST be designed so a future reverse path can detect \"already mirrored\"."
msgstr "**De-dup / cosc lúb.** Le haon droichead déthreoch sa todhchaí, ní mór d'imeacht atá scáthaithe ag A→A ar ais. v1 (aon bhealach) sidesteps seo, ach an tábla mapála comhad a tugadh isteach i v1 MUST a dhearadh ionas gur féidir cosán a athrú sa todhchaí a bhrath \"scátháin cheana féin\"."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Debug Mode**"
msgstr "**Mód Deaglán**"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Debug Mode**   Supports an `MODE_DEBUG` flag that appends optional `console.log` statements for easier troubleshooting in staging or development."
msgstr "**Mód Deaglán** Tacaíochtaí ar `MODE_DEBUG` bratach a ghabhann roghnach `console.log` ráitis le haghaidh fabhtcheartú níos éasca i staging nó forbairt."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Debug Output**: Optional `MODE_DEBUG` gives detailed variable dumps for troubleshooting. 🐛"
msgstr "**Déan Teagmháil Linn**: Rogha `MODE_DEBUG` Tugann sé dumpaí athróg mionsonraithe le haghaidh fabhtcheartú."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Debug Output**: Optional ``MODE_DEBUG`` gives detailed variable dumps for troubleshooting. 🐛"
msgstr "**Déan Teagmháil Linn**: Rogha ``MODE_DEBUG`` Tugann sé dumpaí athróg mionsonraithe le haghaidh fabhtcheartú."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Debugging helpers**: log formats and instructions for general and detailed troubleshooting."
msgstr "**Debugging Cúntóirí**: formáidí logáil agus treoracha le haghaidh fabhtcheartú ginearálta agus mionsonraithe."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Decentralized Content Sharing:** Empower users to share photos and visual content across an interoperable, federated network with enhanced privacy controls."
msgstr "**Roinnt Ábhar díláraithe:** Úsáideoirí Empower grianghraif agus ábhar amhairc a roinnt ar fud líonra idir-inoibritheach, chothaithe le rialuithe príobháideachais feabhsaithe."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Decentralized Network:** Connect with users across multiple instances in a federated social media ecosystem."
msgstr "**Líonra díláraithe:** Ceangail le húsáideoirí ar fud cásanna éagsúla i éiceachóras meáin shóisialta chothaithe."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Decentralized Social Networking:** Facilitate a distributed network for seamless peer-to-peer communication."
msgstr "**Líonraithe Sóisialta díláraithe:** Facilitate líonra a dháileadh le haghaidh cumarsáid piaraí-le-peer gan uaim."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Decentralized Video Hosting:** Distribute video hosting across multiple instances to enhance resilience and avoid single-point control."
msgstr "**Óstáil Video díláraithe:** Dáil a óstáil físeán ar fud cásanna éagsúla chun feabhas a chur ar athléimneacht agus rialú aon phointe a sheachaint."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Decentralized and Federated:** Connect with a global network of Matrix homeservers, ensuring there is no single point of failure."
msgstr "**Díláraithe agus Federated:** Ceangail le líonra domhanda de bhaileoirí Maitrís, ag cinntiú nach bhfuil aon phointe teip amháin."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Decentralized social networking:** Self-host the AT Protocol PDS and serve user data under your own domain."
msgstr "**Líonrú sóisialta díláraithe:** Féin-óstach an PDS Prótacal AT agus freastal ar shonraí úsáideora faoi do bhfearann féin."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Declared hardware access:** Every device the agent may drive is listed by the operator and bound into the container; an empty list is refused rather than silently treated as deny-all-but-deployable."
msgstr "**Rochtain crua-earraí dearbhaithe:** Tá gach gléas is féidir leis an ngníomhaire tiomáint liostaithe ag an oibreoir agus faoi cheangal isteach sa choimeádán; Tá liosta folamh diúltaíodh seachas go ciúin cóireáilte mar deny-all-but-deployable."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Dedicated device only.** Full access is permitted solely on a node whose only tenant is this agent. Forbidden on any shared cluster node (Decision #12)."
msgstr "**Gléas Tiomnaithe amháin.** Ceadaítear rochtain iomlán ach amháin ar nód arb é an t-aon tionónta an gníomhaire seo. Toirmiscthe ar aon nód braisle roinnte (Cinneadh #12)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Dedicated domain:** The admin UI is reachable on its own canonical hostname under the primary domain."
msgstr "**Fearainn Tiomnaithe:** Tá an Chomhéadain admin insroichte ar a ghobhainm Canonical féin faoin bhfearann bunscoile."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Dedicated, single-tenant, segmented node only.** The role MUST refuse to deploy on a node that carries any shared-workload label or hosts other tenants, and the node MUST be network-segmented from shared infrastructure. This is enforced, not just documented: a placement/preflight guard hard-fails on a shared node."
msgstr "**Tiomnaithe, singil-tionónta, nód deighilte amháin.** An ról MUST dhiúltú a imscaradh ar nód a iompraíonn aon lipéad comh-ualach oibre nó ina hóstach tionóntaí eile, agus an nód MUST a bheith líonra-segmented ó bhonneagar roinnte. Tá sé seo i bhfeidhm, ní hamháin doiciméadaithe: socrúchán / garda réamheitil crua-fails ar nód roinnte."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Dedicated-device guard:** Deployment aborts when another application shares the host or when the device is part of a multi-node swarm, naming the offender."
msgstr "**Tiomnaithe-gléas garda:** Aborts imscaradh nuair a scaireanna iarratas eile an ósta nó nuair a bhíonn an gléas mar chuid de swarm il-node, ainmniú an ciontóir."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Default Sudoers Configuration:** Deploys a default sudoers file with best-practice settings."
msgstr "**Réamhshocrú Cumraíocht:** Déan iniúchadh ar comhad sudoers réamhshocraithe le socruithe is fearr-chleachtais."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Default behaviour (variable not set or set to any value other than `true`):** Artefacts are retained only when a test fails."
msgstr "**Iompar réamhshocraithe (athróg nach bhfuil leagtha nó a leagtar ar aon luach seachas `true`):** Ní choinnítear déantáin ach amháin nuair a theipeann ar thástáil."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Default behaviour (variable not set or set to any value other than `true`):** Pushes to `main` are gated out at the `run-policy` job and CI is skipped."
msgstr "**Iompar réamhshocraithe (athróg nach bhfuil leagtha nó a leagtar ar aon luach seachas `true`):** Brúigh chun `main` gated amach ag an `run-policy` Tá post agus CI skipped."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Default behaviour (variable not set or set to any value other than `true`):** The `update-docker-image-versions` job is skipped. Dependabot PRs are auto-closed on open with a comment pointing to this variable."
msgstr "**Iompar réamhshocraithe (athróg nach bhfuil leagtha nó a leagtar ar aon luach seachas `true`):** An bhfuil `update-docker-image-versions` Tá post skipped. Ag brath ar PRanna tá auto-iamh ar oscailt le trácht dírithe ar an athróg."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Default behaviour (variable not set):** The workflow uses `infinito-nexus/core` as the source repository. When the current repository is already `infinito-nexus/core`, the same-repository skip applies."
msgstr "**Iompar réamhshocraithe (athraitheach leagtha):** Úsáideann an sreabhadh oibre `infinito-nexus/core` mar an stór foinse. Nuair atá an stór reatha cheana féin `infinito-nexus/core`, tá feidhm ag an scipe céanna."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Default:** `\"utf8mb4\"`"
msgstr "**Réamhshocrú:** `\"utf8mb4\"`"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Default:** `\"utf8mb4_unicode_ci\"`"
msgstr "**Réamhshocrú:** `\"utf8mb4_unicode_ci\"`"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Defaults** discovered from each role's per-topic meta files: `roles/*/meta/server.yml`, `roles/*/meta/rbac.yml`, `roles/*/meta/services.yml`, `roles/*/meta/volumes.yml`, plus `roles/*/meta/secrets.yml` (post-`apply_schema()`). Variants from `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` deep-merge over the assembled per-role payload. See [layout.md](../../../../design/role/services/layout.md)."
msgstr "**Réamhshocrú** fuair sé amach ó gach ról in aghaidh an-topic meta comhaid: `roles/*/meta/server.yml`, `roles/*/meta/rbac.yml`, `roles/*/meta/services.yml`, `roles/*/meta/volumes.yml`, móide `roles/*/meta/secrets.yml` (post-`apply_schema()`). Athraigh ó `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` domhain-cumasc thar an pálasta per-role chéile. Féach ar [layout.md](../../../../design/role/services/layout.md)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Defaults** discovered from every `roles/*/meta/users.yml` in the repository (file root IS the users map; no `users:` wrapper)."
msgstr "**Réamhshocrú** fuair sé amach ó gach `roles/*/meta/users.yml` sa stór (comhad fhréamh IS an léarscáil úsáideoirí; aon `users:` fillteán)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Delete a User:**"
msgstr "**Scrios Úsáideoir:**"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Delete all emails in the queue**:"
msgstr "**Scrios gach ríomhphost sa scuaine**:"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Dependencies**"
msgstr "**Ag brath ar**"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Dependencies** — the central services and sibling roles it consumes (the `enabled: \"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"` service flags, plus `run_after` and any `meta/main.yml` `dependencies`)."
msgstr "**Ag brath ar** — na seirbhísí lárnacha agus na róil deartháireacha ídíonn sé (an `enabled: \"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"` bratacha seirbhíse, móide `run_after` agus aon `meta/main.yml` `dependencies`)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Dependency Integration:** Works in conjunction with related roles for comprehensive backup management."
msgstr "**Comhtháthú Spleáchas:** Oibreacha i gcomhar le róil ghaolmhara le haghaidh bainistíochta cúltaca cuimsitheach."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Dependency Integration:** Works seamlessly with the [sys-ctl-alm-telegram](../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md) and [sys-ctl-alm-email](../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md) roles."
msgstr "**Comhtháthú Spleáchas:** Oibreacha seamlessly leis an [Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí](../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md) agus [Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí](../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md) róil."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Dependency Integration:** Works seamlessly with the `sys-ctl-alm-telegram <../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md>`__ and `sys-ctl-alm-email <../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md>`__ roles."
msgstr "**Comhtháthú Spleáchas:** Oibreacha seamlessly leis an `sys-ctl-alm-telegram <../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md>`__ agus `sys-ctl-alm-email <../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md>`__ róil."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy iteration.** [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) re-derives the same plan via `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` (the planner is a pure function shared between init and deploy) and runs one deploy per folder. **Every round deploys its full variant-aware include set.** Round R starts from a clean host (the previous round's include is purged before round R begins, see point 5), so every dep that round R needs MUST be redeployed."
msgstr "**Imlonnú.** [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) athdhearbhú an plean céanna trí `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` (is feidhm íon é an pleanálaí a roinntear idir init agus imscaradh) agus ritheann imscaradh amháin in aghaidh an fillteán. **I measc gach babhta a leagan-aware iomlán a leagtar.** Babhta R Tosaíonn ó óstach glan (san áireamh an bhabhta roimhe íonaithe sula dtosaíonn R cruinn, féach pointe 5), mar sin gach dep go cruinn R riachtanais MUST a ath-imlonnú."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy on an Encrypted Server** You SHOULD install Infinito.Nexus on an encrypted server to prevent hosting providers from accessing end-user data. For a practical guide on setting up an encrypted server, refer to the [Hetzner Arch LUKS repository](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/hetzner-arch-luks) 🔐. (Learn more about [disk encryption](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) on Wikipedia.)"
msgstr "**Déan iniúchadh ar Freastalaí Criptithe** tú SHOULD shuiteáil Infinito.Nexus ar fhreastalaí criptithe chun cosc a chur soláthraithe óstáil ó rochtain sonraí úsáideora deiridh. Le haghaidh treoir phraiticiúil maidir le freastalaí criptithe a bhunú, féach ar an [Hetzner Arch stór LUKS](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/hetzner-arch-luks) Oifig na Gaeilge (Foghlaim tuilleadh faoi [criptithe diosca](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) ar Vicipéid.)"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy** the Let’s Encrypt challenge-and-redirect snippet from ``sys-svc-letsencrypt``."
msgstr "**Inis dúinn, le do thoil...** an A ligean ar Criptithe dúshlán-agus-atreorú snippet ó ``sys-svc-letsencrypt``."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy** the Let’s Encrypt challenge-and-redirect snippet from `sys-svc-letsencrypt`."
msgstr "**Inis dúinn, le do thoil...** an A ligean ar Criptithe dúshlán-agus-atreorú snippet ó `sys-svc-letsencrypt`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Deployment and packaging foundations.** A host deployment mode joins Compose and Swarm in the deployment tooling. The former *sys-package*, *sys-aur* and *sys-aur-install* roles were replaced by a distribution-independent package registry. Volume metadata now uses one canonical schema, single-file mounts become Swarm configs, and service placement, replica counts, dependencies, addresses and health probes resolve through deployment-aware lookups."
msgstr "**fondúireachtaí imscaradh agus pacáistiú.** Tagann modh imscaradh óstáil isteach i Múiríniú agus Swarm san uirlis imlonnaithe. An t-iar *Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí*, *taiseachas aeir: fliuch* agus *Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí* cuireadh in ionad róil le dáileadh-neamhspleách clárlann pacáiste. Úsáideann meiteashonraí Imleabhar anois scéimre Canonical amháin, mounts aon-comhaid bheith Swarm configs, agus socrúchán seirbhíse, comhaireamh macasamhail, dependencies, seoltaí agus probes sláinte réiteach trí imscaradh-aware lookups."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Deploys and enables a systemd user service** for ``ssh-agent``."
msgstr "**Deploys agus ar chumas seirbhís úsáideora córasach** le haghaidh ``ssh-agent``."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Deploys and enables a systemd user service** for `ssh-agent`."
msgstr "**Deploys agus ar chumas seirbhís úsáideora córasach** le haghaidh `ssh-agent`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** ACME client for automated Let's Encrypt SSL/TLS certificate issuance and renewal via webroot or DNS-01 challenges"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** cliant ACME le haghaidh uathoibrithe A ligean ar Criptiú SSL / TLS deimhniú eisiúint agus athnuachan trí webroot nó DNS-01 dúshláin"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Aggregate NGINX sub-filter injector adding Matomo tracking, global theming, iFrame and JS snippets by feature flag"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Comhiomlán NGINX fo-scagaire instealladh ag cur Matomo rianú, ainmniú domhanda, iFrame agus JS snippets de réir gné bratach"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Aggregate desktop environment bundling caffeine, shell extensions, and terminal into a complete GNOME setup on Linux"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Comhiomlán timpeallacht deisce bundling Caiféin, síntí sliogáin, agus críochfort i thus GNOME iomlán ar Linux"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Ansible helper role for idempotent persistence and lookup of per-user application tokens in a local YAML store"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ról cúntóir do mharthanacht idempotent agus lookup de tokens iarratas in aghaidh an-úsáideoir i siopa áitiúil YAML"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Arch Linux driver bundle for Epson multifunction printing and scanning via escpr and imagescan"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Arch Linux bundle tiománaí do Epson priontáil multifunction agus scanadh trí escpr agus imagecan"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Automated recovery service restarting exited or unhealthy Docker Compose stacks and resolving port conflicts"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Seirbhís a ghnóthú Uathoibrithe atosú scoir nó unhealthy Docker Compose stacks agus coinbhleachtaí calafoirt a réiteach"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Automation role for reverse DNS (PTR) records on Hetzner Cloud servers, primary IPs, floating IPs, and load balancers"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ról Uathoibriú do DNS droim ar ais (PTR) taifid ar fhreastalaithe Hetzner Cloud, IPanna bunscoile, IPanna snámh, agus iarmhéideoirí ualach"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Base development environment for software engineers on Linux, with core editors and language-agnostic tooling"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Timpeallacht forbartha bonn d'innealtóirí bogearraí ar Linux, le heagarthóirí lárnacha agus tooling teanga-agnostic"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Base role for systemd manager configuration via drop-ins, default settings, and unit validation"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ról bonn le haghaidh cumraíocht bainisteoir córasach trí titim-orlach, socruithe réamhshocraithe, agus bailíochtú aonad"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Browser-based spinning wheel app for decision making, random selection, and gamification"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Brabhsálaí-bhunaithe aip roth sníomh le haghaidh cinnteoireachta, roghnú randamach, agus gamification"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Browser-facing admin interface for the shared LLM gateway, published on its own domain behind the front proxy"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Brabhsálaí-facing comhéadan admin don gheata LLM roinnte, a foilsíodh ar a bhfearann féin taobh thiar den seachfhreastalaí tosaigh"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Build-time tool for simulating root-owned file operations without elevated privileges during package builds"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Tógáil-am uirlis chun insamhladh oibríochtaí comhad fréamh-úinéireacht gan pribhléidí ardaithe le linn tógála pacáiste"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central Dockerized search engine shared by multiple apps with per-consumer scoped API keys"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Lár inneall cuardaigh Dockerized roinnte ag apps il le per-tomhaltóir raon feidhme eochracha API"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central in-memory caching engine with per-consumer key-prefix isolation, usable centrally or as an embedded sidecar"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Lár in-seomra inneall caching le in aghaidh an-tomhaltóir eochair-prefix aonrú, inúsáidte go lárnach nó mar sidecar leabaithe"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central loader role for ordered shared-service preloading and queued post-load role inclusions across the deployment"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ról lódála lárnach le haghaidh réamhluchtú seirbhíse comhroinnte ordaithe agus cuimsithe ról iar-ualach scuaine ar fud an imscaradh"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central logout proxy for single-action sign-out across all OIDC-connected apps, with Nginx snippets and a live status UI"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** seachfhreastalaí logála lárnach le haghaidh comharthaí aon-gníomh ar fud gach apps OIDC-nasctha, le snippets Nginx agus UI stádas beo"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central mail orchestration layer routing host mail through Mailu, msmtp, or an optional local SMTP relay"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ríomhphost lárnach ciseal orchestration ródú phost óstach trí Mailu, msmtp, nó sealaíochta áitiúil roghnach SMTP"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central recursive/forwarding DNSSEC resolver on a static IP for consumer stacks to target as their DNS"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Lár Athchúrsach / aghaidh réiteoir DNSSEC ar IP statach do chairn tomhaltóra chun díriú mar a n- DNS"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central search and analytics engine with per-consumer index namespaces isolating tenants in a shared Docker deployment"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** inneall cuardaigh agus Analytics le gach-tomhaltóir innéacs namespaces isolating tionóntaí in imscaradh Docker roinnte"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central vector database engine for storing and searching per-consumer embeddings shared across the stack"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** inneall bunachar sonraí veicteoir lárnach a stóráil agus a chuardach in aghaidh an-tomhaltóir embeddings roinnte ar fud an chairn"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Centralized MariaDB or PostgreSQL database service shared across applications via Docker Compose"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Lárnaigh MariaDB nó IargreSQL seirbhís bunachar sonraí roinnte ar fud na n-iarratas via Docker Compose"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Certbot-driven ACME service for Let's Encrypt single-domain and wildcard TLS certificates on NGINX domains"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Seirbhís ACME Certbot-tiomáinte do A ligean ar Criptithe aonair-domain agus wildcard teastais TLS ar fearainn NGINX"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Cleanup routine for deprecated domains, removing Nginx configs and revoking their Certbot certificates"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Glanadh gnáthamh le haghaidh réimsí dímheasta, a bhaint Nginx configs agus a chúlghairm a gcuid deimhnithe Certbot"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Cleanup routine for reclaiming disk space from temp files, package caches, optional Docker data and old backups"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Cleanup ghnáthamh do reclaiming spás diosca ó chomhaid teocht, taisce pacáiste, sonraí Docker roghnach agus cúltacaí d'aois"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Client-side NFS setup for mounting a remote server export on every swarm node, with a deploy-time reachability probe"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Cliant-taobh thus NFS le haghaidh gléasta onnmhairithe freastalaí iargúlta ar gach nód swarm, le probe inrochtaineacht imscaradh-am"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Client-side WireGuard VPN role for stable connectivity with a systemd service and script that tune interface MTU"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Cliant-taobh WireGuard VPN ról le haghaidh nascacht cobhsaí le seirbhís córasach agus script go comhéadan tune MTU"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Clipboard manager with editable history, custom actions, and scripting support"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Clipboard bainisteoir le stair eagarthóireachta, gníomhaíochtaí saincheaptha, agus tacaíocht script"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Cloudflare DNS bootstrap role for apex and wildcard A/AAAA records (and optional CAA) across a web stack's base domains"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Cloudflare buataisítrap DNS ról do apex agus taifid cárta fiáin A / AAAA (agus CAA roghnach) ar fud an Stack gréasáin fearainn bonn"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Cluster-local container image registry for serving custom-built images to Docker Swarm worker nodes"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Cluster-áit áitiúil coimeádán íomhá clár le haghaidh freastal ar íomhánna saincheaptha a tógadh go Docker Swarm oibrí nóid"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Cluster-local pull-through cache for shared Docker Hub base-image pulls, cutting duplicate transfers and rate limits"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Cluster-áitiúil taisce tarraingt-trí do pulls bonn Docker Hub roinnte, a ghearradh aistrithe dúblach agus teorainneacha ráta"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Collaborative wiki platform for user-driven documentation with an extensible extension ecosystem and content management"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** ardán wiki comhoibritheach le haghaidh doiciméadú úsáideora-tiomáinte le héiceachórais síneadh extensible agus bainistíocht ábhar"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Command-line journal application for creating and managing personal diary entries from the terminal"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Iarratas irisleabhar Ordú-líne chun iontrálacha dialann pearsanta a chruthú agus a bhainistiú ón gcríochfort"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Composite stack role bundling a containerized database backend with an HTTP reverse-proxy frontend for web access"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Comhdhéanta Stack ról bundling cúltaca bunachar coimeádán le HTTP droim ar ais-proxy tosaigh le haghaidh rochtain gréasáin"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Container engine runtime with Compose for building and running application containers on Linux hosts"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** runtime inneall coimeádán le múirín le haghaidh tógála agus coimeádáin iarratais ag rith ar hóstach Linux"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Container orchestration cluster for scheduling services across pooled manager and worker nodes"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Cnuasach orchestration coimeádán le haghaidh seirbhísí sceidealaithe ar fud an bainisteoir linnte agus nóid oibrí"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Containerized Reveal.js slide deck for presenting the platform to admins, developers, users, and investors"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** coimeádán Reveal.js deic sleamhnán chun an t-ardán a chur i láthair do admins, forbróirí, úsáideoirí, agus infheisteoirí"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Containerized icon server for hosting the Simple Icons brand SVG and PNG collection for web and documentation use"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** freastalaí deilbhín coimeádán le haghaidh óstáil an SVG branda Simplí agus bailiúchán PNG le haghaidh úsáid gréasáin agus doiciméadú"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Containerized relational database with automated database, user, and privilege provisioning"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** bunachar sonraí ndáil coimeádán le bunachar sonraí uathoibrithe, úsáideoir, agus soláthar pribhléide"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Content management system for building and managing websites, blogs, and multisite networks with themes and plugins"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Córas bainistíochta Ábhar le haghaidh tógála agus láithreáin ghréasáin a bhainistiú, a blogs, agus líonraí multisite le téamaí agus plugins"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Core NGINX webserver with HTTP and TCP/UDP stream support and performance-tuned defaults"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Core webserver NGINX le HTTP agus tacaíocht sruth TCP / UDP agus réamhshocraithe feidhmíochta-tuned"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Cross-distribution installer for the Nix package manager with checksum-verified, reproducible multi-user setup"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** suiteálaí tras-dáileadh le haghaidh an bainisteoir pacáiste Nix le checkum-verified, thus il-úsáideoir in-athnuaite"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Cross-distribution maintenance routine for disk reclamation across CI, container, and build environments"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Gnáthamh cothabhála tras-dáileadh do mhíntíriú diosca ar fud CI, coimeádán, agus timpeallachtaí a thógáil"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Data-driven role for managing Cloudflare DNS records (A/AAAA, CNAME, MX, TXT, SRV) across apps and environments"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ról sonraí-tiomáinte chun taifid DNS Cloudflare a bhainistiú (A/AAAA, CNAME, MX, TXT, SRV) thar apps agus timpeallachtaí"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Decentralized, federated platform for peer-to-peer video hosting, streaming, and live broadcasting"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ardán díláraithe, cónasctha le haghaidh óstáil físe piaraí, sruthú, agus craoladh beo"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Decentralized, federated platform for photo sharing and image feeds across the fediverse"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ardán díláraithe, chothaithe le haghaidh fothaí grianghraf agus íomhá ar fud an fhéichiú"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Decentralized, federated social-networking platform for peer-to-peer communication and community building"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ardán líonraithe sóisialta díláraithe, chothaithe le haghaidh cumarsáide piaraí agus tógála pobail"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Dedicated administrator account with SSH key access and password-authenticated sudo for secure privilege escalation"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Cuntas riarthóir tiomnaithe le rochtain eochair SSH agus sudo phasfhocal-authenticated le haghaidh escalation phribhléid slán"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Dedicated system account with SSH-restricted commands and passwordless rsync sudo for secure backup access"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Cuntas córas tiomnaithe le orduithe SSH-restricted agus sudo rsync gan focal faire le haghaidh rochtain cúltaca slán"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Deferred-start orchestrator for enabling and starting collected systemd services once a play completes"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ceolfhoireann iarchurtha-túsach chun seirbhísí córasacha a chumasú agus a thosú nuair a chríochnaíonn súgradh"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Desktop client for streaming music, playlists, and podcasts"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** cliant Deasc do shruthú ceol, seinmliostaí, agus podchraoltaí"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Desktop client setup linking home folders into the cloud-synced directory for integrated file synchronization"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Deisce thus cliant nasc fillteáin bhaile isteach an eolaire scamall-sineite le haghaidh sioncrónaithe comhad comhtháite"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Desktop config role for activating GNOME Shell extensions and installing a CLI tool to manage them"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Desktop config ról do activating GNOME Shell síntí agus a shuiteáil uirlis CLI chun iad a bhainistiú"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Desktop media-player setup with VLC and AACS/BD+ libraries for Blu-ray disc decryption and playback on Arch Linux"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Desktop meáin-imreoir thus le VLC agus AACS / BD + leabharlanna do decryption diosca Blu-ray agus athsheinm ar Arch Linux"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Desktop office suite for documents, spreadsheets, and presentations with Liberation fonts and language packs"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Sraith oifige deisce do dhoiciméid, scarbhileoga, agus cur i láthair le clónna Liberation agus pacáistí teanga"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Desktop utility for inhibiting screen blanking and sleep, autostarted on the GNOME desktop"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Deisce fóntais chun cosc a chur ar fholmhú scáileán agus codladh, autostarted ar an deasc GNOME"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Desktop video conferencing client for online meetings, webinars, and screen sharing"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Deasc físe a thabhairt do chliaint le haghaidh cruinnithe ar líne, webinars, agus roinnt scáileán"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Distributed S3-compatible object store for shared, per-consumer bucket provisioning across web-app roles"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Dáileadh S3-compatible siopa réad do roinnte, buicéad in aghaidh an-tomhaltóir ar fáil ar fud róil gréasáin-app"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Distributed version control system for tracking source code changes and coordinating development work"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Córas rialaithe leagan Dáilte do rianú athruithe cód foinse agus obair forbartha comhordaithe"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Distro-specific base build toolchain (compilers, linkers, make) for compiling software from source"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Distro-sonrach bonn thógáil toolchain (compilers, nascóirí, dhéanamh) le haghaidh bogearraí a thiomsú ó fhoinse"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Docker Compose stack for containerized relational databases with backup, user, and permission management"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Docker Compose Stack do bhunachair shonraí i ndáil coimeádán le cúltaca, úsáideoir, agus bainistíocht cead"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Document server backend for real-time in-browser editing of documents, spreadsheets, and presentations"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** backend freastalaí doiciméad le haghaidh fíor-ama in-browser eagarthóireacht ar dhoiciméid, scarbhileoga, agus cur i láthair"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Driver integration for dynamic keyboard color and RGB lighting control on MSI laptops"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Comhtháthú Tiománaí le haghaidh dath méarchlár dinimiciúil agus rialú soilsithe RGB ar ríomhairí glúine MSI"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Embodied robot platform for Hermes on a dedicated, network-segmented single-tenant device"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** ardán robot corpraithe do Hermes ar gléas tiomnaithe, líonra-segmented singil-tionónta"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** End-of-play convergence of every deployed MCP client against the complete provider set"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Cóineasú deireadh-imirt de gach cliant MCP imscaradh i gcoinne an soláthraí iomlán atá leagtha"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Engine-agnostic wiring layer for shared cache, queue, search, and vector engines with per-consumer provisioning"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Inneall-agnostic sreangú ciseal do taisce roinnte, scuaine, cuardaigh, agus innill veicteoir le soláthar per-tomhaltóir"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Enterprise wiki and team collaboration platform for creating, organizing, and sharing content"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Fiontraíocht wiki agus ardán comhoibriú foirne a chruthú, eagrú, agus ábhar a roinnt"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Extensible Vim-based command-line text editor for terminal-driven code and configuration editing"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Dian-bhunaithe eagarthóir téacs ordú-líne le haghaidh cód críochfort-tiomáinte agus eagarthóireacht chumraíocht"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Federated chess server for playing and following rule-validated games over ActivityPub across the Fediverse"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Freastalaí fichille Federated le haghaidh imirt agus a leanas cluichí riail-validated thar ActionPub ar fud na Fediverse"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Federated, end-to-end-encrypted messaging platform with a web client and protocol bridges to external chat networks"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ardán teachtaireachtaí le cliant gréasáin agus droichid phrótacail le líonraí comhrá seachtracha a ríomh, a chríochnú-le-deireadh."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Federated, self-hosted platform for organizing events and building communities and groups"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ardán Federated, féin-óstáil le haghaidh imeachtaí a eagrú agus pobail tógála agus grúpaí"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Federation bridge connecting ActivityPub (Fediverse), the AT Protocol (Bluesky), and the IndieWeb"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** droichead Cónaidhme ag nascadh GníomhaíochtPub (Feicsean), Prótacal AT (taiseachas aeir: fliuch), agus an IndieWeb"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Free and open-source TURN/STUN relay server for NAT traversal in WebRTC and real-time communication"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Freastalaí Relay TURN / STUN saor in aisce agus oscailte do thréithe NAT i WebRTC agus cumarsáid fíor-ama"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Free and open-source desktop application for live video streaming and screen recording"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Feidhmchlár deisce saor in aisce agus oscailte le haghaidh sruthú físe beo agus taifeadadh scáileáin"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Free and open-source desktop application for personal and small-business accounting and financial management"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** iarratas deisce saor in aisce agus foinse oscailte le haghaidh cuntasaíochta pearsanta agus beag-ghnó agus bainistíocht airgeadais"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Front-end JS injection notifying parent windows of iframe location changes and forcing external links into new tabs"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Tosaigh JS instealladh fógra fuinneoga tuismitheoir na n-athruithe suíomh iframe agus forcing naisc sheachtracha i tabs nua"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Front-layer base for web apps: HTTPS foundation, optional Cloudflare setup, and reverse-proxy handler wiring"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Tosaigh-ciseal bonn le haghaidh apps gréasáin: HTTPS bunús, roghnach Cloudflare thus, agus droim ar ais-proxy láimhseálaí sreangú"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Generic end-to-end test runner executing role-provided Playwright specs in Docker against deployed applications"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Cineálach rádala tástála deireadh-le-deireadh forghníomhaitheach ról-sholáthar specs Playwright i Docker i gcoinne iarratais imscaradh"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Generic role installing the doli CLI and applying dotfile symlink mappings passed in by other roles"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ról cineálach a shuiteáil an doli CLI agus a chur i bhfeidhm mapaí siompóisearach dotfile rith i rólanna eile"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Global JavaScript injection layer for NGINX HTML responses via sub_filter, with CSP hashing"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Sraith instealladh Domhanda JavaScript le haghaidh freagraí NGINX HTML trí sub_filter, le hashing CSP"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Global stylesheet injection for NGINX-served apps, unifying light and dark theming from a dynamic colorscheme"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Instealladh stílbhileog domhanda le haghaidh apps NGINX-choimeád, unifying solas agus dorcha a ainmniú ó colorscheme dinimiciúil"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Hardened OpenSSH daemon configuration for key-based remote access with root login and password authentication disabled"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Hardened OpenSSH cumraíocht daemon do rochtain iargúlta eochair-bhunaithe le logáil isteach fréimhe agus fíordheimhnithe phasfhocal faoi mhíchumas"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Hardened desktop web browser with enforced privacy and password-manager extensions via Enterprise Policies"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** bhrabhsálaí gréasáin Hardened deisce le príobháideachais agus pasfhocal-bainis sí síntí via Fiontar Polasaithe"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Headless local model server for open LLMs with an OpenAI-compatible API on the container network"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Freastalaí múnla áitiúil gan sreang do LLManna oscailte le API OpenAI-comhoiriúnach ar an líonra coimeádán"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Health check for orphaned anonymous Docker volumes unbound to containers, with whitelist and alerting"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Seiceáil sláinte le haghaidh líon Docker gan ainm dílleachta gan ainm gan cheangal le coimeádáin, le whitelist agus foláirimh"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Helper role installing CA-trust injection assets for Docker Compose stacks and validating the project CA certificate"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ról Helper a shuiteáil sócmhainní instealladh CA-iontaobh do chairn Docker Compose agus a bhailíochtú an deimhniú CA tionscadail"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Host-level WireGuard VPN service with wg-quick config, package install, and IP-forwarding sysctl for secure tunnels"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Host-leibhéal WireGuard VPN seirbhíse le wg-quick config, pacáiste shuiteáil, agus IP-forwarding steall do tholláin slán"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Host-level configuration for the systemd-journald logging daemon with retention limits and live log streaming"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** chumraíocht leibhéal óstáil don daemon logáil córasach-iris le teorainneacha coinneála agus sruthú logáil beo"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Host-level configuration linking Bash and Zsh login shells to a shared .profile for consistent environment loading"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** cumraíocht Host-leibhéal nascadh sliogáin Bash agus Zsh logáil isteach le .profile roinnte do luchtú timpeallacht comhsheasmhach"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Host-level provisioning for exposing the project's pyproject.toml version system-wide via /etc/environment"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Soláthar leibhéal óstála chun an tionscadal a nochtadh pyproject.toml leagan ar fud an chórais trí / srl / comhshaoil"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Host-level role provisioning a root RSA 4096-bit SSH key pair for secure automated administrative access"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ról leibhéal na hóstála ag soláthar fréamh RSA 4096-bit eochair péire SSH le haghaidh rochtain riaracháin uathoibrithe"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Identity-based secrets, PKI and encryption manager with OIDC login, group-mapped policies and static-seal auto-unseal"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Rúin aitheantais-bhunaithe, PKI agus bainisteoir criptithe le logáil isteach OIDC, beartais grúpa-tábáilte agus uathoibríoch-neamhseal statach"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** In-memory key-value cache and store, shared centrally with per-consumer ACL isolation or embedded as a sidecar"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** In-meamory eochair-luach taisce agus a stóráil, roinnte go lárnach le per-tomhaltóir ACL leithlisiú nó leabaithe mar sidecar"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Infinito.Nexus documentation for the latest commit and every release, built on demand with Sphinx"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Infinito.Nexus doiciméadú don tiomantas is déanaí agus gach scaoileadh, tógtha ar éileamh le Sphinx"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Infrastructure role for managing containerized-application project structures, .env files, and lifecycle handlers"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ról bonneagair chun struchtúir tionscadail i bhfeidhm coimeádán a bhainistiú, .env comhaid, agus láimhseálaithe saolré"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Infrastructure role for managing systemd service units: cleanup, deployment, timers, and shared failure diagnostics"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ról bonneagair chun aonaid seirbhíse córasaithe a bhainistiú: glanadh, imscaradh, amchláir, agus diagnóisí teipe comhroinnte"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Intel VA-API media driver for hardware-accelerated video decode and encode across Linux distributions"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Intel VA-API tiománaí meáin le haghaidh crua-earraí-ceiliúradh dhíchódú físeán agus ionchódú ar fud dáiltí Linux"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Interactive graph visualization of all Infinito.Nexus roles and their dependencies for architecture transparency"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Amharcléiriú graf Idirghníomhach ar fad Infinito.Nexus róil agus a spleáchas le haghaidh trédhearcacht ailtireacht"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Issue and project tracking platform for software teams, with agile boards, workflows, and optional OIDC SSO"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Eisiúint agus ardán rianaithe tionscadail le haghaidh foirne bogearraí, le boird agile, sreabhadh oibre, agus OIDC roghnach SSO"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** JavaScript runtime for building and running server-side applications and developer tooling"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** JavaScript runtime le haghaidh tógála agus ag rith iarratais freastalaí-taobh agus forbróir tooling"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Kernel-isolated agent runtime serving an OpenAI-compatible API, routed to models through the shared LLM gateway"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Gníomhaire bunaithe ar Kernel ag freastal ar API OpenAI-comhoiriúnach, ar bhealach chuig samhlacha tríd an tairseach LLM roinnte"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Kernel-isolating container runtimes that sandbox untrusted workloads in a microVM or a userspace kernel"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** runtimes coimeádán Kernel-isolating go bosca gainimh untrusted ualaí oibre i microVM nó eithne úsáideoraspace"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Kernel-level NFS server for exporting a shared directory tree with IP-restricted access for swarm-node hosts"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** freastalaí NFS leibhéal Kernel le haghaidh onnmhairiú crann eolaire roinnte le rochtain IP-restricted do hóstach swarm-node"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Let's Encrypt provider for the front-facing TLS layer ensuring automated certificate issuance and presence"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Déanaimis soláthraí Criptithe don chiseal TLS tosaigh lena n-áirithítear deimhniú uathoibrithe agus láithreacht"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Libretro-based frontend for emulators, game engines, and media players, with XMB and Ozone menu styles"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Libretro-bhunaithe tosaigh do emulators, innill cluiche, agus imreoirí meáin, le stíleanna roghchlár XMB agus Ozone"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Lightweight SMTP client and sendmail replacement for delivering mail through an external SMTP server"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Lightweight SMTP cliant agus a sheoladh ríomhphoist athsholáthair le haghaidh seachadadh phost trí fhreastalaí SMTP seachtrach"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Lightweight self-hosted Git service for code collaboration, version control, and repository management"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Seirbhís Git féin-óstáil Lightweight do chomhoibriú cód, rialú leagan, agus bainistíocht stór"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Local name resolution for the domains the target serves, via the myhostname NSS module"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Rún ainm áitiúil do na fearainn feidhmíonn an sprioc, tríd an modúl myhostname NSS"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Local self-signed Root CA for issuing trust so containers accept internal TLS endpoints"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Fréimhe féin-sínithe áitiúil CA chun muinín a eisiúint mar sin glacann coimeádáin le foircinn inmheánacha TLS"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Local-first cross-platform desktop password manager storing credentials in an encrypted KeePass-format database"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Local-chéad tras-ardán bainisteoir phasfhocal deisce a stóráil dintiúir i bunachar sonraí criptithe KeePass-format"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Locking mechanism for gating maintenance tasks until critical services stop, with configurable retry and timeout"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Meicníocht glasála le haghaidh tascanna cothabhála a ithe go dtí go stopann seirbhísí criticiúla, le retry configurable agus timeout"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Loopback-only Postfix relay for lightweight outbound mail delivery via localhost when no central mail stack runs"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Loopback-amháin Postfix Relay haghaidh seachadadh ríomhphoist lightweight outbound trí localhost nuair a ritheann aon Stack phost lárnach"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Low-code visual builder for creating, testing, and publishing LLM and RAG workflows as HTTP endpoints"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** tógálaí amhairc íseal-chód le haghaidh LLM agus RAG a chruthú, a thástáil, agus a fhoilsiú mar chríochphointí HTTP"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Marker role tagging a host as the Docker Swarm manager node, with the init logic delegated to svc-swarm-node"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ról Marker clibeáil óstach mar an nod bainisteoir Swarm Docker, leis an loighic init tarmligthe a svc-swarm-node"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Multi-language spell checker with configurable dictionary packs for desktop and office text editing"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Seiceáil litrithe il-teanga le pacáistí foclóir configurable le haghaidh eagarthóireacht téacs deisce agus oifige"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** NGINX glue role for 301 redirects from source to target domains with automatic SSL for the source hosts"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Ról gliú NGINX le haghaidh 301 atreoruithe ó fhoinse chun sprioc fearainn le SSL uathoibríoch do na hóstach foinse"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** NGINX layer for HTTPS with Let's Encrypt ACME challenge handling, port 80 to 443 redirect, and stale vHost cleanup"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** NGINX ciseal do HTTPS le A ligean ar Criptithe ACME dúshlán láimhseáil, port 80 go dtí 443 atreorú, agus stale vHost cleanup"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** NGINX server blocks that permanently redirect www subdomains to their non-www apex domains"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** Bloic freastalaí NGINX a atreorú go buan www subdomains chuig a n-fearainn neamh-www apex"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** NGINX subfilter injector adding Matomo analytics script and noscript image tracker to served HTML pages"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** NGINX subfilter injector chur script anailísíochta Matomo agus rianaitheoir íomhá noscript a sheirbheáil leathanaigh HTML"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** NGINX vhost for serving static HTML websites over HTTPS with automatic Let's Encrypt certificates"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** vhost NGINX chun freastal ar láithreáin ghréasáin HTML statach thar HTTPS le deimhnithe uathoibríoch A ligean ar Criptithe"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** NGINX-based web platform and reverse proxy with validated config reloads and Let's Encrypt integration"
msgstr "**Cur síos:** ardán gréasáin NGINX-bhunaithe agus seachfhreastalaí droim ar ais le athluchtuithe config bailíochtaithe agus A ligean ar Comhtháthú Criptithe"

# libretranslate
