# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Do not alert on ``vault_core_unsealed``.** OpenBao keeps Vault’s metric namespace, and a healthy unsealed node emits ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, so an alert on ``== 0`` fires permanently. Use ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 while sealed); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` corroborates."
msgstr "**Ná airdeall ar ``vault_core_unsealed``.** Coinníonn OpenBao ainm-spás méadrach Vault, agus astaíonn nód neamhshéalaithe sláintiúil ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, mar sin airdeall ar ``== 0`` dóiteáin go buan. Úsáid Úsáid Úsáidte ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 le linn séalaithe); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` comhthacaíocht."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Do not alert on `vault_core_unsealed`.** OpenBao keeps Vault's metric namespace, and a healthy unsealed node emits `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, so an alert on `== 0` fires permanently. Use `/v1/sys/health` (503 while sealed); `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` corroborates."
msgstr "**Ná airdeall ar `vault_core_unsealed`.** Coinníonn OpenBao ainm-spás méadrach Vault, agus astaíonn nód neamhshéalaithe sláintiúil `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, mar sin airdeall ar `== 0` dóiteáin go buan. Úsáid Úsáid Úsáidte `/v1/sys/health` (503 le linn séalaithe); `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` comhthacaíocht."

