# libretranslate
msgid "**Enable state defaults to off; deliberately-wired integrations auto-enable with their partner.** `enabled` is optional and defaults to `false` unless `required: true` is set. An addon that bridges a service MUST derive its effective enablement from that service's `enabled` flag (never a duplicated group-membership expression), so a deliberately-wired cross-role integration activates automatically whenever its partner role is co-deployed (`services.<target>.enabled` is true) and stays off otherwise. Any credential an addon needs is declared in `meta/secrets.yml` `credentials:` and read via `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')` (Decision 4): auto-generated where possible, or supplied through the same credentials mechanism's manual-entry path where the operator must enter the secret. There is no separate opt-in exception: auto-enable-with-partner holds, and an operator-entered credential resolves through `credentials` like any other. This auto-enable-with-partner rule is distinct from update-automation-discovered addons (Decision 10), which are added hard-off."
msgstr "**D'fhéadfadh teipeanna stáit a bheith in ann a bhaint amach; comhtháthú a shreangú d'aon ghnó uathoibríoch le n-chomhpháirtí.** `enabled` Tá roghnach agus mainneachtainí a `false` mura rud é— `required: true` Tá leagtha. An addon go droichid MUST seirbhíse a chumas éifeachtach ó na seirbhíse sin `enabled` bratach bratach (riamh léiriú grúpa dhúbailte), mar sin cuireann comhtháthú tras-ról d'aon ghnó i ngníomh go huathoibríoch nuair a bhíonn a ról comhpháirtíochta comhthiomsaithe (`services.<target>.enabled` Is fíor) agus fanann sé ar shlí eile. Tá aon dintiúir riachtanais addon dhearbhú i `meta/secrets.yml` `credentials:` agus a léamh trí `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')` (Cinneadh an Chinnidh 4): auto-generated nuair is féidir, nó a sholáthraítear tríd an meicníocht dintiúir céanna ar cosán láimhe isteach i gcás nach mór don oibreoir dul isteach ar an rún. Níl aon eisceacht opt-i ar leith: Tá auto-in-inúsáidte-le-partner, agus réitíonn dintiúr oibreora isteach trí `credentials` cosúil le haon eile. Tá an riail uathoibríoch-chumasaithe-le-rannpháirtí seo ar leith ó bhreiseáin nuashonraithe-uathoibríoch-aisghabhála (Cinneadh an Chinnidh 10), a chuirtear crua-uaire."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Enabled by this:** The allow list uses the broad wildcard `Bash(*)` without maintaining narrow path lists. The single source of truth for writable paths is `sandbox.filesystem.allowWrite` in [sandbox.md](sandbox.md)."
msgstr "**Cumasaithe seo:** Úsáideann an liosta ceadúcháin an cárta fiáin leathan `Bash(*)` gan liostaí cosán caol a chothabháil. Is é an fhoinse amháin na fírinne le haghaidh cosáin inscríofa `sandbox.filesystem.allowWrite` i [sandbox.md](sandbox.md)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Encrypted app-password cache:** Keep the synthesised PDS app-password in a process-local map only as AES-256-GCM ciphertext, with the key sourced from the project's credentials vault."
msgstr "**Criptithe app-pasfhocal taisce:** Coinnigh an app-password sintéisithe PDS i léarscáil próiseas-áitiúil ach amháin mar AES-256-GCM ciphertext, leis an eochair a fháil ó cruinneachán dintiúir an tionscadail."

