# libretranslate
msgid "**Encrypted attribute decrypt failure:** indicates a key mismatch between the SPI and the broker. The broker rejects the request with HTTP 500 rather than risk silently re-provisioning a fresh PDS account that loses the user's existing posts. Recovery: rotate the key and clear the attribute (manual op for now, key rotation is in the doc 013 Future Hardening section)."
msgstr "**Criptithe tréith teip decrypt:** Léiríonn mismatch eochair idir an SPI agus an bróicéir. Diúltaíonn an bróicéir an t-iarratas le HTTP 500 seachas riosca go ciúin ath-sholáthar cuntas PDS úr a chailleann an úsáideora poist atá ann cheana. Aisghabháil: rothlú an eochair agus soiléir an tréith (op láimhe le haghaidh anois, tá príomh-uainíocht sa doc 013 Cuid chruaidh sa todhchaí)."

