# libretranslate
msgid "**Every MCP implementation ships a Playwright test.** Each role that gains an MCP surface MUST add a matching Playwright spec under `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` that exercises its MCP surface (a server role's authenticated endpoint, a client role's configured-server list). No MCP role is considered implemented until its Playwright test is present and green."
msgstr "**Gach longa cur i bhfeidhm MCP tástáil Playwright.** Gach ról a ghnóthaíonn MST dromchla MCP cuir spec Playwright meaitseála faoi `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` a fheidhmíonn a dhromchla MCP (Ról freastalaí ar endpoint fíordheimhnithe, ról cliaint ar configured-freastalaí liosta). Níl aon ról MCP i bhfeidhm go dtí go bhfuil a thástáil Playwright i láthair agus glas."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Every addon ships a Playwright test.** Each addon with a user-facing surface MUST add a matching Playwright spec under `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` that exercises that addon's behaviour (e.g. an `ldapauth`/`sociallogin` login path, a `wp-discourse` round-trip, an enabled Odoo module's UI entry point). Desktop roles (`desk-*`) drive no web surface a Playwright test could exercise and therefore NEVER ship addon specs — the lint forbids spec files under `desk-*` roles. For every web-facing role there is no per-addon exemption: an addon is considered migrated only once its Playwright spec is present and green. Cross-role integration specs (proving two roles are actually connected) run under a dedicated **integration-pair deploy variant** that co-deploys both partner roles, and are added incrementally as each ✅ pair is wired rather than all upfront."
msgstr "**Gach long addon tástáil Playwright.** Gach addon le MUST dromchla úsáideoir-facing chur le spec Playwright meaitseáil faoi `roles/<role>/files/playwright/` a fheidhmíonn a iompar addon (e.g. `ldapauth`/ Baile`sociallogin` cosán logáil isteach, a `wp-discourse` bhabhta-turas, ar chumas Odoo modúl ar pointe iontrála Chomhéadain). Róil deisce (`desk-*`) tiomáint d'fhéadfadh aon dromchla gréasáin tástáil Playwright a fheidhmiú agus dá bhrí sin NEVER long specs addon - an lint cosc comhaid spec faoi `desk-*` róil. I gcás gach ról gréasáin-facing nach bhfuil aon díolúine in aghaidh an-addon: Tá addon mheas imirce ach amháin nuair a bhíonn a spec Playwright láthair agus glas. Tras-ról specs comhtháthú (a chruthú dhá ról atá ceangailte iarbhír) reáchtáil faoi tiomanta **comhtháthú-péire leagan imscaradh** go bhfuil comh-imlonnú an dá ról comhpháirtíochta, agus iad a chur incriminteach mar go bhfuil gach péire RC sreang seachas gach upfront."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Every deploy rotates the AppRole.** The ``role_id``/``secret_id`` a run is handed are not the ones the running instance holds. ``tasks/01_init.yml`` tries the inventory pair, falls back to the pair recorded in ``.applied.json``, then ``tasks/06_rotate.yml`` re-pins to this run’s values and destroys the old SecretID. The record is written last, so a run that dies partway leaves the previous generation intact. ``custom-secret-id`` is **not** idempotent — re-writing a held SecretID answers ``500`` — so the swap is gated on the value having changed."
msgstr "**Gach imscaradh rothlaíonn an AppRole.** An bhfuil ``role_id``/ Baile``secret_id`` nach bhfuil a reáchtáil ar láimh na cinn atá ag rith mar shampla. ``tasks/01_init.yml`` iarracht an péire fardal, titim ar ais go dtí an péire a thaifeadadh i ``.applied.json``, ansin ``tasks/06_rotate.yml`` ath-pins leis an rith ar luachanna agus milleann an Rúin sean. Scríobhtar an taifead seo caite, mar sin fágann rith a fhaigheann bás go bhfuil an ghlúin roimhe seo slán. ``custom-secret-id`` Is maith liom **bláthanna cumhra: aon cumhráin** idempotent - athscríobh freagraí Rúnda ``500`` — mar sin tá an swap gated ar an luach tar éis athrú."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Every deploy rotates the AppRole.** The `role_id`/`secret_id` a run is handed are not the ones the running instance holds. `tasks/01_init.yml` tries the inventory pair, falls back to the pair recorded in `.applied.json`, then `tasks/06_rotate.yml` re-pins to this run's values and destroys the old SecretID. The record is written last, so a run that dies partway leaves the previous generation intact. `custom-secret-id` is **not** idempotent — re-writing a held SecretID answers `500` — so the swap is gated on the value having changed."
msgstr "**Gach imscaradh rothlaíonn an AppRole.** An bhfuil `role_id`/ Baile`secret_id` nach bhfuil a reáchtáil ar láimh na cinn atá ag rith mar shampla. `tasks/01_init.yml` iarracht an péire fardal, titim ar ais go dtí an péire a thaifeadadh i `.applied.json`, ansin `tasks/06_rotate.yml` ath-pins leis an rith ar luachanna agus milleann an sean Rúin. Scríobhtar an taifead seo caite, mar sin fágann rith a fhaigheann bás go bhfuil an ghlúin roimhe seo slán. `custom-secret-id` Is maith liom **bláthanna cumhra: aon cumhráin** idempotent - athscríobh freagraí Rúnda `500` — mar sin tá an swap gated ar an luach tar éis athrú."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Every mounted volume is discarded**, not only the backed-up ones. A volume declared `backup: false` claims to be disposable; a drill that spares it never tests the claim. If its service cannot rebuild it, the health gate goes red — that is the finding, not a false alarm. The single exception is the data directory of an engine whose dump is about to be replayed: it carries the database and its role, which the deploy creates and the container does not, so wiping it would leave `baudolo-restore --empty -d <db>` with nothing to connect to and the drill would fail at itself instead of at a defect."
msgstr "**Tá gach toirt suite i leataobh**, ní hamháin na cinn tacaíocht-suas. Toirt dhearbhaithe `backup: false` éilimh a bheith indiúscartha; druil a spárálann sé riamh tástálacha an t-éileamh. Más rud é nach féidir a sheirbhís a atógáil, téann an geata sláinte dearg - is é sin an aimsiú, ní aláram bréagach. Is é an eisceacht amháin an eolaire sonraí ar inneall a bhfuil a dumpáil ar tí a replayed: déanann sé an bunachar sonraí agus a ról, a chruthaíonn an imscaradh agus nach bhfuil an coimeádán, mar sin wiping bheadh sé a fhágáil `baudolo-restore --empty -d <db>` le rud ar bith a nascadh leis agus go mbeadh an druil theipeann air féin in ionad ar locht."

