msgid "**Fixed:** OpenProject migrations stabilized (simplified migration step; preload *CustomFieldContext* before *db:migrate*). Nextcloud LDAP config hardened and incompatible apps disabled in production. XWiki extension install hardened and one time seed ensures *Main.WebHome* exists. Matomo bootstrap fails fast on root cause. TLS and CA improvements (unified self signed CA env for health services, retries for CA trust override generation, Nix TLS CA trust fix). *msmtp* improved on Fedora. OpenLDAP *python-ldap* build prerequisites and header fallback refactored; per user *password_update* policy added. Backup and ops fixes (OnlyOffice no restart during backups; backup home and ACL tasks more reliable). Container setup hardened (Fedora Docker CE CLI, dnf5 repo add, Debian buildx conflict fix, Docker readiness and SSH restart improvements)."
msgstr "**Seasta:** imircí OpenProject chobhsaithe (céim imirce simplithe; réamhlódáil *Comhthéacs an Chustaim* roimh *db: imirce*). Nextcloud LDAP config cruaite agus apps neamh-chomhoiriúnach faoi mhíchumas i dtáirgeadh. XWiki síneadh a shuiteáil cruaite agus Cinntíonn síol am amháin *Main.WebHome* ann. Buaileann buataisí Matomo go tapa ar chúis fhréamh. Feabhsuithe TLS agus CA (unified féin sínithe env CA le haghaidh seirbhísí sláinte, retries do giniúint override iontaobhais CA, Nix TLS CA). *Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí* feabhsaithe ar Fedora. Amharc ar gach eolas *cliceáil grianghraf a mhéadú* prerequisites a thógáil agus fallback header refactored; in aghaidh an úsáideora *password_update* Chuir policy leis. Cúltaca agus ops fixes (AchOffice aon atosú le linn cúltacaí; bhaile cúltaca agus tascanna ACL níos iontaofa). Socrú coimeádán cruaite (Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí5 repo chur leis, Debian buildx coimhlint shocrú, ullmhacht Docker agus feabhsúcháin SSH atosú)."

