# libretranslate
msgid "**Git over SSH:** gitlab-sshd on the public SSH port with role-generated host keys under `<instance>/config/hostkeys/`. Back up that directory: it is not part of any named volume, and a host rebuild or instance purge regenerates the keys, so every git client then sees a host-key-changed warning until it re-trusts the new key."
msgstr "**Git thar SSH:** gitlab-sshd ar an gcalafort SSH poiblí le heochracha óstach ról-ghinithe faoi `<instance>/config/hostkeys/`. Ar ais suas go eolaire: nach bhfuil sé mar chuid d'aon toirt ainmnithe, agus atógáil óstach nó mar shampla purge regenerates na heochracha, mar sin feiceann gach cliant git rabhadh ósta-eochair-athrú go dtí go re-iontaobhas sé an eochair nua."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Git over SSH:** gitlab-sshd on the public SSH port with role-generated host keys under ``<instance>/config/hostkeys/``. Back up that directory: it is not part of any named volume, and a host rebuild or instance purge regenerates the keys, so every git client then sees a host-key-changed warning until it re-trusts the new key."
