# libretranslate
msgid "**HTTP on the onion side** (TLS forced off for `.onion`), vhosts on `:80`, upstream gets `X-Forwarded-Proto: https`."
msgstr "**HTTP ar an taobh oinniún** (TLS éigean as `.onion`), vhosts ar `:80`, faigheann upstream `X-Forwarded-Proto: https`."

