msgid "**HTTP on the onion side:** TLS is forced off for `.onion` (no Let's Encrypt possible); onion v3 crypto is the transport auth."
msgstr "**HTTP ar an taobh oinniún:** TLS Tá iachall as do `.onion` (aon A ligean ar Criptiú féidir); oinniún v3 Is criptithe an t-iompar auth."

