# libretranslate
msgid "**In-container configuration** follows [`svc-db-elasticsearch/tasks/01_init.yml`](../../roles/svc-db-elasticsearch/tasks/01_init.yml): a shell exec into the container where the credential arrives through a container env var, never through Ansible's process arguments, guarded by `no_log: \"{{ MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS | bool }}\"`."
msgstr "**chumraíocht inmheánach** seo a leanas: [`svc-db-elasticsearch/tasks/01_init.yml`](../../roles/svc-db-elasticsearch/tasks/01_init.yml): exec bhlaosc isteach sa choimeádán ina dtagann an dintiúir trí coimeádán env var, riamh trí argóintí phróiseas Ansible ar, cosanta ag `no_log: \"{{ MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS | bool }}\"`."

