# libretranslate
msgid "**Insecure HTTP (v1):** No TLS for the initial implementation; the registry runs on the manager's host network and binds only the address the manager hostname resolves to, so no other interface listens. Each swarm node trusts the manager's `<host>:5000` via `daemon.json.insecure-registries`."
msgstr "**Insecration HTTP (v v v v v v1):** No TLS don chur i bhfeidhm tosaigh; Ritheann an clár ar líonra óstach an bhainisteora agus ceangal ach an seoladh réitíonn an hostname bainisteoir a, mar sin ní éisteann comhéadan eile. Gach nód swarm iontaobhais an bainisteoir `<host>:5000` via via via via `daemon.json.insecure-registries`."

