msgid "**Isolated development worktrees.** Parallel branches can use independent stacks while sharing one cache layer, preventing containers and network state from colliding. New *swarm-app-exec*, *swarm-diagnostic*, zombie-cluster and cross-mode roundtrip targets improve live inspection and Compose/Swarm parity testing."
msgstr "**Crainn oibre forbartha scoite.** Is féidir le craobhacha comhthreomhara úsáid a bhaint as stoic neamhspleácha agus ciseal taisce amháin á roinnt, coimeádáin agus stát líonra a chosc ó colliding. Nuashonraithe go deireanach *swarm-app-exec*, *tréimhse saoil: ilbhliantúil*, zombie-cluster agus spriocanna roundtrip cross-mode feabhas a chur ar iniúchadh beo agus Múirín tástála parity / Swarm."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Isolating runtime:** The compose service is pinned to Kata Containers when hardware virtualization and the Kata shim are present, and to gVisor otherwise."
msgstr "**runtimeolating:** Tá an tseirbhís a chumadh pinned le Kata Coimeádáin nuair a fhíorú crua-earraí agus an shim Kata i láthair, agus a gVisor ar shlí eile."

# libretranslate
