msgstr "**runtimeolating:** Tá an tseirbhís a chumadh pinned le Kata Coimeádán áit `/dev/kvm` agus tá an shim Kata ar fáil, agus gVisor ar shlí eile."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Isolating runtime:** The compose service is pinned to Kata Containers where ``/dev/kvm`` and the Kata shim are available, and to gVisor otherwise."
msgstr "**runtimeolating:** Tá an tseirbhís a chumadh pinned le Kata Coimeádán áit ``/dev/kvm`` agus tá an shim Kata ar fáil, agus gVisor ar shlí eile."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Isolation is gVisor on top of in-app sandboxing; Firecracker is out of reach on this engine.** Each agent app runs under `runtime: runsc`, a userspace guest kernel that intercepts syscalls before they reach the host, so untrusted model-generated code stays kernel-isolated even if the app's own sandbox is bypassed. No custom VMM, jailer wiring, or bespoke rootfs pipeline. E2B/Beam noted as alternatives in the role README but not adopted."
msgstr "**Isolation gVisor ar bharr in-app sandboxing; Tá Firecracker as teacht ar an inneall.** Ritheann gach app gníomhaire faoi `runtime: runsc`, eithne aoi aoi úsáideora a idircheapann syscalls sula sroicheann siad an ósta, mar sin fanann cód samhla-ghinithe untrusted eithne-olated fiú má tá an app bosca gainimh féin sheachbhóthar. Uimh VMM saincheaptha, sreangú jailer, nó píblíne fréamhaithe bespoke. E2B/Beam faoi deara mar roghanna eile sa README ach nach bhfuil glactha."

# libretranslate
#, python-format
msgid "**It is part of a row's identity.** The glyph is in the job label, the value in the artifact name, the column in the plan table, and `:arm64` narrows a selection token the way `%distro` and `/filesystem` do. A retrigger replays it, unlike the filesystem: the title states the machine the job actually ran on, not a preference it could have fallen back from."
msgstr "**Tá sé mar chuid d'aitheantas as a chéile.** Is é an glyph sa lipéad post, an luach in ainm Déantán, an colún sa tábla plean, agus `:arm64` cúngú rogha chomhartha ar an mbealach `%distro` agus `/filesystem` a dhéanamh. Retrigger replays sé, murab ionann agus an córas comhaid: deir an teideal an meaisín an post ar siúl i ndáiríre ar, Ní rogha d'fhéadfadh sé tar éis titim ar ais ó."

# libretranslate
msgid "**It rotates on the row's position directly, not as a third odometer digit.** The distro/filesystem odometer exists because two pools of equal length walked on the same index cover only `n` of `n x m` pairs. Two architectures against five distros are coprime, and against the fifteen distro/filesystem positions too, so the fast rotation reaches every pairing anyway. Making it the slowest digit would be actively wrong: a role with four rows would sit on one architecture forever, and the axis exists precisely so a role's own variants split over both."
msgstr "**Rothlaíonn sé ar sheasamh an tsraith go díreach, ní mar dhigit tríú odometer.** An odometer distro / córas comhaid ann mar gheall ar dhá linnte fad comhionann shiúil ar an chlúdach innéacs céanna amháin `n` de `n x m` péirí. Tá dhá ailtireacht i gcoinne cúig distros coprime, agus i gcoinne an cúig post distro / córas déag ró-, mar sin sroicheann an uainíocht tapa gach pairing ar aon nós. Ag déanamh sé go mbeadh an dhigit is moille a bheith go gníomhach mícheart: Bheadh ról le ceithre sraitheanna suí ar ailtireacht amháin go deo, agus tá an ais go beacht mar sin ról na leaganacha féin roinnte thar an dá."

