# libretranslate
msgid "**Key-file formats** in `HiddenServiceDir`: `hostname` (address + `\\n`), `hs_ed25519_public_key` (`== ed25519v1-public: type0 ==` header + 32-byte key), `hs_ed25519_secret_key` (`== ed25519v1-secret: type0 ==` header + **64-byte expanded** secret key = SHA-512(seed) clamped)."
msgstr "**Key-comhad formáidí** i `HiddenServiceDir`: `hostname` (seoladh + `\\n`), `hs_ed25519_public_key` (`== ed25519v1-public: type0 ==` header + 32eochair -byte), `hs_ed25519_secret_key` (`== ed25519v1-secret: type0 ==` header + **64-byte leathnú** eochair rúnda = SHA-512(síológ) clampáilte)."

