# libretranslate
msgid "**Keycloak OIDC login:** The `jwt`/`oidc` auth method is configured against the platform Keycloak, so users sign in with their existing Infinito.Nexus identity. Logout integrates with `web-svc-logout`."
msgstr "**Logáil isteach Keycloak OIDC:** An bhfuil `jwt`/ Baile`oidc` Tá modh auth cumraithe i gcoinne an t-ardán Keycloak, mar sin a shíniú úsáideoirí i lena gcuid atá ann cheana féin Infinito.Nexus aitheantas. Comhtháthaíonn Logout le `web-svc-logout`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Keycloak SSO:** Fronted by the platform oauth2-proxy gate; the authenticated user is passed to Checkmk via the trusted `X-Remote-User` header (`auth_by_http_header`), so no second login prompt appears."
msgstr "**Keycloak SSO:** Tosaigh ag an oauth ardán2-proxy geata; an t-úsáideoir fíordheimhnithe a rith chuig Checkmk tríd an muinín `X-Remote-User` ceanntásc (`auth_by_http_header`), mar sin is cosúil aon dara logála isteach pras."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Keycloak SSO:** Fronted by the platform oauth2-proxy gate; the authenticated user is passed to Checkmk via the trusted ``X-Remote-User`` header (``auth_by_http_header``), so no second login prompt appears."
msgstr "**Keycloak SSO:** Tosaigh ag an oauth ardán2-proxy geata; an t-úsáideoir fíordheimhnithe a rith chuig Checkmk tríd an muinín ``X-Remote-User`` ceanntásc (``auth_by_http_header``), mar sin is cosúil aon dara logála isteach pras."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Keycloak group → Frappe role mapping** — three tiers: ``roles/web-app-erpnext/administrator`` → ``System Manager``, ``roles/web-app-erpnext/manager`` → ``{Sales, Purchase, Stock, Accounts} User``, default → ``Customer``. Reconciled on each login by a hook reading the persisted map."
msgstr "**Keycloak grúpa →** - trí shraith: ``roles/web-app-erpnext/administrator`` → → ``System Manager``, ``roles/web-app-erpnext/manager`` → → ``{Sales, Purchase, Stock, Accounts} User``, réamhshocraithe → ``Customer``. Comhlánaithe ar gach logáil isteach ag Hook léamh an léarscáil fós."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Keycloak group → Frappe role mapping** — three tiers: `roles/web-app-erpnext/administrator` → `System Manager`, `roles/web-app-erpnext/manager` → `{Sales, Purchase, Stock, Accounts} User`, default → `Customer`. Reconciled on each login by a hook reading the persisted map."
msgstr "**Keycloak grúpa →** - trí shraith: `roles/web-app-erpnext/administrator` → → `System Manager`, `roles/web-app-erpnext/manager` → → `{Sales, Purchase, Stock, Accounts} User`, réamhshocraithe → `Customer`. Comhlánaithe ar gach logáil isteach ag Hook léamh an léarscáil fós."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Keycloak sign-in:** With Keycloak in the deployment, the role sets ``services.sso.flavor: oidc`` and the LiteLLM Gateway reads the platform’s OIDC endpoints from ``GENERIC_CLIENT_ID``, ``GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET``, ``GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT``, ``GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT`` and ``GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT``. Sign in at ``/sso/key/generate``; ``PROXY_ADMIN_ID`` carries the administrator’s username. LiteLLM serves SSO for up to five accounts in ``litellm_usertable`` and refuses beyond that without ``LITELLM_LICENSE``."
msgstr "**Keycloak comhartha isteach:** Le Keycloak san imscaradh, tacair an ról ``services.sso.flavor: oidc`` agus an LiteLLM Gateway léann an ardán ar OIDC endpoints ó ``GENERIC_CLIENT_ID``, ``GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET``, ``GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT``, ``GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT`` agus ``GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT``. Cláraigh ag ``/sso/key/generate``; ``PROXY_ADMIN_ID`` Déanann ainm úsáideora an riarthóra. LiteLLM feidhmíonn SSO ar feadh suas le cúig chuntas i ``litellm_usertable`` agus a dhiúltóidh níos faide ná sin gan ``LITELLM_LICENSE``."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Keycloak sign-in:** With Keycloak in the deployment, the role sets `services.sso.flavor: oidc` and the LiteLLM Gateway reads the platform's OIDC endpoints from `GENERIC_CLIENT_ID`, `GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET`, `GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT`, `GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT` and `GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT`. Sign in at `/sso/key/generate`; `PROXY_ADMIN_ID` carries the administrator's username. LiteLLM serves SSO for up to five accounts in `litellm_usertable` and refuses beyond that without `LITELLM_LICENSE`."
msgstr "**Keycloak comhartha isteach:** Le Keycloak san imscaradh, tacair an ról `services.sso.flavor: oidc` agus an LiteLLM Gateway léann an ardán ar OIDC endpoints ó `GENERIC_CLIENT_ID`, `GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET`, `GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT`, `GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT` agus `GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT`. Cláraigh ag `/sso/key/generate`; `PROXY_ADMIN_ID` Déanann ainm úsáideora an riarthóra. LiteLLM feidhmíonn SSO ar feadh suas le cúig chuntas i `litellm_usertable` agus a dhiúltóidh níos faide ná sin gan `LITELLM_LICENSE`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**LDAP Authentication:** Centralize user authentication against OpenLDAP 🔐"
