# libretranslate
msgid "**LDAP auth is included, behind the `ldap` service flag**, mapping the same LDAP role groups to the same three policies; OIDC stays the default."
msgstr "**Tá auth LDAP san áireamh, taobh thiar de na `ldap` bratach seirbhíse**, mapáil na grúpaí ról LDAP céanna leis na trí pholasaí céanna; OIDC fhanann an réamhshocraithe."

# libretranslate
msgid "**LDAP direct-bind variant:** ``meta/variants.yml`` V3 wires prosody’s ``mod_auth_ldap2`` against ``svc-db-openldap`` for a non-OIDC LDAP-only deploy."
msgstr "**LDAP leagan díreach-bind:** ``meta/variants.yml`` VV VV3 Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí ``mod_auth_ldap2`` i gcoinne ``svc-db-openldap`` le haghaidh LDAP-amháin neamh-OIDC."

# libretranslate
msgid "**LDAP direct-bind variant:** `meta/variants.yml` V3 wires prosody's `mod_auth_ldap2` against `svc-db-openldap` for a non-OIDC LDAP-only deploy."
msgstr "**LDAP leagan díreach-bind:** `meta/variants.yml` VV VV3 Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí `mod_auth_ldap2` i gcoinne `svc-db-openldap` le haghaidh LDAP-amháin neamh-OIDC."

# libretranslate
msgid "**LDAP fallback:** When ``svc-db-openldap`` is deployed, the ``ldap`` auth method is enabled as a second login path, mapping the same role groups to the same policies. OIDC remains the default."
msgstr "**Aisghabháil LDAP:** Nuair a bheidh ``svc-db-openldap`` a imscaradh, an ``ldap`` Tá modh auth ar chumas mar cosán logáil isteach dara, mapáil na grúpaí ról céanna leis na polasaithe céanna. OIDC fós an mhainneachtain."

# libretranslate
msgid "**LDAP fallback:** When `svc-db-openldap` is deployed, the `ldap` auth method is enabled as a second login path, mapping the same role groups to the same policies. OIDC remains the default."
msgstr "**Aisghabháil LDAP:** Nuair a bheidh `svc-db-openldap` a imscaradh, an `ldap` Tá modh auth ar chumas mar cosán logáil isteach dara, mapáil na grúpaí ról céanna leis na polasaithe céanna. OIDC fós an mhainneachtain."

# libretranslate
msgid "**LDAP federation** — when ``svc-db-openldap`` is present, Frappe’s LDAP Settings doctype is auto-configured. End-to-end LDAP login (auto-create Frappe user from LDAP bind) is deferred to a follow-up requirement; v1 ships the Settings doctype only. The LDAP-login Playwright specs are intentionally absent for v1."
msgstr "**Cothú LDAP** — nuair— ``svc-db-openldap`` i láthair, tá Socruithe LDAP Frappe ar doctype uathoibríoch-chumraithe. Deireadh le deireadh a chur le logáil isteach LDAP (auto-create Frappe úsáideoir ó LDAP ceangal) a iarchur chuig ceanglas leantach; v1 longa an Doctype Socruithe amháin. Tá na specs LDAP-login Playwright as láthair d'aon ghnó le haghaidh v1."

# libretranslate
msgid "**LDAP federation** — when `svc-db-openldap` is present, Frappe's LDAP Settings doctype is auto-configured. End-to-end LDAP login (auto-create Frappe user from LDAP bind) is deferred to a follow-up requirement; v1 ships the Settings doctype only. The LDAP-login Playwright specs are intentionally absent for v1."
msgstr "**Cothú LDAP** — nuair— `svc-db-openldap` Tá sé i láthair, tá Socruithe LDAP Frappe ar doctype uathoibríoch-chumraithe. Deireadh le deireadh a chur le logáil isteach LDAP (auto-create Frappe úsáideoir ó LDAP ceangal) a iarchur chuig ceanglas leantach; v1 longa an Doctype Socruithe amháin. Tá na specs LDAP-login Playwright as láthair d'aon ghnó le haghaidh v1."

# libretranslate
msgid "**LDAP federation:** When ``svc-db-openldap`` is present, Zammad authenticates and provisions accounts against the central LDAP."
msgstr "**Cothú LDAP:** Nuair a bheidh ``svc-db-openldap`` i láthair, fhíordheimhniú Zammad agus cuntais forálacha i gcoinne an LDAP lárnach."

# libretranslate
