# libretranslate
msgid "**LDAP import, export and Multi edit finish again in LAM.** The Content Security Policy blocked the inline script that checks on LAM's background jobs, so these tools stayed \"in progress\" forever. That script is allowed again."
msgstr "**LDAP allmhairiú, onnmhairiú agus il in eagar chríochnú arís i LAM.** Chuir an Polasaí Slándála Ábhar bac ar an script inlíne a dhéanann seiceálacha ar phoist chúlra LAM, mar sin d'fhan na huirlisí seo \"dul chun cinn\" go deo. Tá an script a cheadaítear arís."

# libretranslate
msgid "**LDAP login:** When ``svc-db-openldap`` is present, Semaphore’s login form binds against the central OpenLDAP directory (``SEMAPHORE_LDAP_*``). With LDAP enabled the form is LDAP-only; there is no local-password fallback."
msgstr "**Logáil isteach LDAP:** Nuair a bheidh ``svc-db-openldap`` i láthair, Ceanglaíonn foirm logála Semaphore i gcoinne an eolaire OpenLDAP lárnach (``SEMAPHORE_LDAP_*``). Le LDAP ar chumas an fhoirm LDAP-amháin; níl aon fallback áitiúil-password."

# libretranslate
msgid "**LDAP login:** When `svc-db-openldap` is present, Semaphore's login form binds against the central OpenLDAP directory (`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_*`). With LDAP enabled the form is LDAP-only; there is no local-password fallback."
