# libretranslate
msgid "**LDAP user directory:** KIX' `Auth::LDAP` and `Auth::Sync::LDAP` modules are wired against `svc-db-openldap`, with one backend per role group. On first login KIX pulls the user's profile (display name, email, group membership) from LDAP, so no manual KIX-side user pre-creation is required."
