msgstr "**Lint reuses an tsamhail faoi chois.** Rialacha lint nua MCP beo faoi [`tests/lint/ansible/services/`](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/) agus onóir an láithreach `# nocheck:` Coinbhinsiún marcála (féach ar [docs faoi chois](../contributing/actions/testing/suppression.md))."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Lints that fail closed.** Five properties that used to pass silently now fail. The PHP and Ruby that roles ship are syntax-checked, and so are shell scripts that ship as Jinja templates. *sys-service* owns every systemd unit a role installs. Healthcheck timings are judged against what the base image was measured to hold, a variable-free healthcheck belongs in *meta/services.yml*, an unenforceable NFS state layout fails at author time, a sandboxed role cannot be pinned to the manager, credentials are kept out of volumes declared non-secret, *no_log* is required on every task carrying one and forbidden in the test roles, and a JavaScript default for an unset environment variable is rejected."
msgstr "**Leintí a theipeann dúnta.** Cúig airíonna a úsáidtear chun pas a fháil go ciúin theipeann anois. An PHP agus Ruby go bhfuil róil long syntax-checked, agus mar sin tá scripteanna bhlaosc go long mar teimpléid Jinja. *Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí* úinéireacht gach aonad córasach a shuiteáil ról. Amanna Healthcheck a mheas i gcoinne cad a tomhaiseadh an íomhá bonn a shealbhú, baineann athróg-saor in aisce healthcheck i *meta/services.yml*, go mainneoidh leagan amach stáit NFS unenforceable ag am an údair, Ní féidir ról sandboxed a pinned leis an mbainisteoir, dintiúir a choinneáil as na méideanna dearbhaithe neamh-rúnaí, *no_log* ag teastáil ar gach tasc ag iompar amháin agus forbidden i róil tástála, agus tá mainneachtain JavaScript do athróg timpeallacht unset dhiúltaigh."

