# libretranslate
msgid "**MCP surface is the native `mcp_server` integration under the [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) contract.** The role's `meta/services.yml` declares `mcp` with `direction: server`, `implementation: native`, `transport: streamable_http`, served under the role's canonical origin per 025. No third-party MCP add-on is used when the native integration covers the need."
msgstr "**Is é an dromchla MCP dúchais `mcp_server` comhtháthú faoin [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) conradh.** An ról `meta/services.yml` a dhearbhú `mcp` le `direction: server`, `implementation: native`, `transport: streamable_http`, a sheirbheáil faoi thionscnamh Canonical an ról in aghaidh an 025. Níl aon MCP tríú páirtí a úsáidtear nuair a chlúdaíonn an comhtháthú dúchais an gá."

# libretranslate
msgid "**MTU Configuration:** Deploys a template-based script to set the MTU on all defined internet interfaces."
msgstr "**MTU Cumraíocht:** Déan iniúchadh ar script teimpléad-bhunaithe a shocrú ar an MTU ar gach comhéadan idirlín sainithe."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Machine identity:** AppRole is configured independently of human login, so services and automation use their own identities and short-lived tokens instead of a shared administrator token."
msgstr "**Féiniúlacht Meaisín:** Tá AppRole cumraithe go neamhspleách ar logáil isteach an duine, mar sin seirbhísí agus uathoibriú úsáid a n-aitheantas féin agus comharthaí gearr-cónaí in ionad chomhartha riarthóir roinnte."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Made Snipe-IT admin bootstrap idempotent** and treated known *users_groups* duplicate constraint errors as non-fatal while keeping strict failure handling for other cases"
msgstr "**Déanta Snipe-IT buataisí admin idempotent** agus cóireáilte ar eolas *users_groups* earráidí srianta dúbailte mar neamh-mharfach agus a choinneáil láimhseáil teip dian do chásanna eile"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Magento (Adobe Commerce Open Source)** is a powerful, extensible e-commerce platform built with PHP. It supports multi-store setups, advanced catalog management, promotions, checkout flows, and a rich extension ecosystem."
msgstr "**Toir agus Crainn (Foinse Oscailte Adobe Commerce)** Is ardán cumhachtach, extensible ríomhthráchtáil tógtha le PHP. Tacaíonn sé le setups ilstóir, bainistíocht chatalóg chun cinn, cur chun cinn, sreabhadh Seiceáil, agus éiceachóras síneadh saibhir."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Mail-to-ticket:** When ``web-app-mailu`` is present, the ``helpdesk`` mailbox is auto-provisioned and Zammad polls it to create tickets from incoming mail."
msgstr "**Mail-go-ticéad:** Nuair a bheidh ``web-app-mailu`` i láthair, an ``helpdesk`` Tá bosca poist auto-provisioned agus vótaíochtaí Zammad é a chruthú ticéid ó phost isteach."

