# libretranslate
msgid "**Maintenance & Cleanup:** Reduced Let’s Encrypt renewal frequency to avoid rate limits, removed deprecated logs and variables, applied broad refactorings, and merged the Matomo autosetup feature."
msgstr "**Cothabháil agus Glanadh:** Laghdaithe A ligean ar Criptiú minicíocht athnuachana a sheachaint teorainneacha ráta, a bhaint logs deprecated agus athróga, i bhfeidhm refactorings leathan, agus chumasc an gné autosetup Matomo."

