msgid "**Major Changes**"
msgstr "**Amharc ar gach eolas**"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Manage Inventories Securely** Your inventories for running Infinito.Nexus MUST be managed in a separate repository and secured with tools such as [Ansible Vault](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Encryption) 🔒. Sensitive credentials MUST NEVER be stored in plaintext; use a password file to secure these details."
msgstr "**Bainistiú Fardals Securely** Do aireagóirí a reáchtáil Infinito.Nexus MUST a bhainistiú i stór ar leith agus urraithe le huirlisí ar nós [Lochtanna Infheicthe](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Encryption) Dintiúir íogaire MUST NEVER a stóráil i plaintext; comhad phasfhocal a úsáid chun na sonraí seo a dhaingniú."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Managed credentials:** The gateway master key and the admin UI password are generated and kept as role credentials, and the admin UI username is the platform administrator name."
msgstr "**Dintiúr bainistíochta:** An eochair máistir geata agus an focal faire Chomhéadain admin a ghintear agus a choimeád mar dintiúir ról, agus is é an ainm úsáideora admin Chomhéadain an t-ainm riarthóir ardán."

