# libretranslate
msgid "**Manager-pinned** central on-disk state stays node-local (never on NFS) in swarm."
msgstr "**Bainisteoir-pinned** lár ar dhíosc stáit fanacht nód-áitiúil (riamh ar NFS) i swarm."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Manager-pinned, stateful:** Single instance per cluster; bypasses swarm task lifecycle so its volume cannot end up on a worker."
msgstr "**Bainisteoir-pinned, stateful:** Sampla amháin in aghaidh braisle; seachbhóthar saolré tasc swarm mar sin ní féidir a thoirt deireadh suas ar oibrí."

