# libretranslate
msgid "**MariaDB data** stays local on the manager node via [svc-db-mariadb](../svc-db-mariadb/) pinning. NFS for the DB data directory is intentionally out of scope for v1 (locking / `fsync` semantics). See 023's Future Extensions."
msgstr "**Sonraí MariaDB** fanacht áitiúil ar an nód bainisteoir trí [Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí](../svc-db-mariadb/) pinning. NFS don eolaire sonraí DB Tá d'aon ghnó as raon feidhme le haghaidh v1 (glasáil / `fsync` cineál gas: in airde). Féach 023's Future Extensions."

