msgid "**MariaDB data** stays local on the manager node via `svc-db-mariadb <../svc-db-mariadb/>`__ pinning. NFS for the DB data directory is intentionally out of scope for v1 (locking / ``fsync`` semantics). See 023’s Future Extensions."
msgstr "**Sonraí MariaDB** fanacht áitiúil ar an nód bainisteoir trí `svc-db-mariadb <../svc-db-mariadb/>`__ pinning. NFS don eolaire sonraí DB Tá d'aon ghnó as raon feidhme le haghaidh v1 (glasáil / ``fsync`` cineál gas: in airde). Féach 023Síneadh Todhchaí."

