# libretranslate
msgid "**Mini-QR** is a lightweight, self-hosted web application for generating QR codes instantly and privately."
msgstr "**Mini-QR** Is iarratas gréasáin lightweight, féin-óstach do ghiniúint cóid QR láithreach agus go príobháideach."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Mini-QR** is a lightweight, self-hosted web application for generating QR codes instantly and privately.   It provides a minimal and elegant interface to convert any text, URL, or message into a QR code directly in your browser, without external tracking or dependencies."
msgstr "**Mini-QR** Is iarratas gréasáin lightweight, féin-óstach do ghiniúint cóid QR láithreach agus go príobháideach. Soláthraíonn sé comhéadan íosta agus galánta a thiontú ar aon téacs, URL, nó teachtaireacht i cód QR go díreach i do bhrabhsálaí, gan rianú seachtrach nó spleáchais."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Minimal NGINX Setup:** Clean and optimized default configurations."
msgstr "**Socraigh NGINX Minimal:** Glan agus cumraíochtaí réamhshocraithe uasmhéadú."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Minimal Setup:** No unnecessary dependencies are installed."
msgstr "**Socrú Minimal:** Níl aon spleáchas gan ghá suiteáilte."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Minimal footprint:** Does not enable services or autostart entries beyond what the package itself provides."
msgstr "**lorg Minimal:** Ní chuireann seirbhísí ar chumas nó iontrálacha autostart thar an méid a sholáthraíonn an pacáiste féin."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Minimal footprint:** Small Node.js/Express service that fits neatly into larger stacks."
msgstr "**lorg Minimal:** Beag beann ar Node.js/ SeirbhísExpress go néata i stoic níos mó."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Minimal scope** (client-only, no server configuration)"
msgstr "**Raon feidhme Minimal** (cliant-amháin, aon chumraíocht freastalaí)"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** Image-level mutation (`run`, `build`, `push`, `login`) and their synonyms (`docker container run`, `docker image build`, `docker buildx build`, `docker image push`) still route through `ask`, so the operator reviews them before they execute."
msgstr "**Mitigation:** Íomhá-leibhéal sócháin (`run`, `build`, `push`, `login`) agus a gcuid comhchiallaigh (`docker container run`, `docker image build`, `docker buildx build`, `docker image push`) fós bealach tríd `ask`, mar sin athbhreithnithe an t-oibreoir iad sula fhorghníomhú siad."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** Targets still cannot bypass `allowWrite`, `allowedDomains`, or the `deny` list. A malicious target that called `rm -rf .` would be stopped by the `rm -rf*` deny rule."
msgstr "**Mitigation:** Ní féidir le spriocanna fós seachbhóthar `allowWrite`, `allowedDomains`, nó `deny` liosta. Sprioc mailíseach ar a dtugtar `rm -rf .` bheadh a stopadh ag an `rm -rf*` riail deny."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** `docker run*` and its synonyms are in `ask`, so the operator reviews them (subject to Assumption 5). The `deny` list blocks `sudo*`, so direct privilege escalation via `sudo` is unavailable."
msgstr "**Mitigation:** `docker run*` agus tá a comhchiallaigh i `ask`, mar sin athbhreithnithe an t-oibreoir orthu (faoi réir Tomhaltas 5). An `deny` bloic liosta `sudo*`, mar sin díreach escalation phribhléid trí `sudo` Níl sé ar fáil."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Mitigation:** `sandbox.enabled: true` with `sandbox.failIfUnavailable: true` refuses to start when the backend is unavailable. `sandbox.allowUnsandboxedCommands: false` rejects the `dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true` tool parameter, so there is no per-call escape."
msgstr "**Mitigation:** `sandbox.enabled: true` le `sandbox.failIfUnavailable: true` diúltú chun tús a chur nuair nach bhfuil an cúlú ar fáil. `sandbox.allowUnsandboxedCommands: false` Diúltaíonn an `dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true` paraiméadar uirlis, mar sin níl aon éalú in aghaidh an-glaoch."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Mode-aware:** absent optional sources are skipped, not failed, so the same role works in both self-signed and Let's Encrypt setups."
msgstr "**Modh-aware:** foinsí roghnacha as láthair a skipped, ní theip, mar sin oibríonn an ról céanna i setups féin-sínithe agus A ligean ar Criptithe."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Mode-aware:** absent optional sources are skipped, not failed, so the same role works in both self-signed and Let’s Encrypt setups."
msgstr "**Modh-aware:** foinsí roghnacha as láthair a skipped, ní theip, mar sin oibríonn an ról céanna i dá féin-sínithe agus A ligean ar setups Criptithe."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Mode-selection trigger:** Membership in ``svc-swarm-node`` resolves ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm`` for every web-app role on that host."
msgstr "**truicir mód-roghnú:** Comhaltas i ``svc-swarm-node`` an t-eolas úsáideach ``DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm`` do gach ról gréasáin-iarratas ar an óstach."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Mode-selection trigger:** Membership in `svc-swarm-node` resolves `DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm` for every web-app role on that host."
msgstr "**truicir mód-roghnú:** Comhaltas i `svc-swarm-node` an t-eolas úsáideach `DEPLOYMENT_MODE = swarm` do gach ról gréasáin-iarratas ar an óstach."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Model gateway key:** With the LiteLLM Gateway deployed, that gateway provisions a per-consumer virtual key aliased to this application."
msgstr "**eochair geata Samhail:** Leis an LiteLLM Gateway imscaradh, go forálacha geata eochair fíorúil per-tomhaltóir inter aliased leis an iarratas seo."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Models go through the [031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) gateway.** Each agent's BYO-model config points only at the `svc-ai-litellm` `/v1` + a model alias; it never addresses a provider directly. The Pis run no large models locally; heavy inference is routed to a GPU/external backend by the gateway."
msgstr "**Múnlaí dul tríd an [031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) geata.** Gach gníomhaire pointí BYO-samhail config ach amháin ag an `svc-ai-litellm` `/v1` + ailias samhail; ní thugann sé aghaidh ar sholáthraí go díreach. An Pis reáchtáil aon samhlacha mór go háitiúil; Tá tá cur isteach trom ar siúl go dtí siar GPU / seachtrach ag an tairseach."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Models via the [031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) gateway; higher-level tools via [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) MCP.** Embodiment changes the host boundary, not the model or tool planes: inference still goes through the gateway, and non-hardware tools still come via MCP."
msgstr "**Múnlaí tríd an [031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) geata; uirlisí ardleibhéil trí [025](025-mcp-role-integration.md) MCP.** Athruithe embodiment an teorainn óstach, nach bhfuil an tsamhail nó planes uirlis: tátal a théann fós tríd an geata, agus uirlisí neamh-chrua fós ag teacht trí MCP."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Modern Dashboard:** Enjoy a sleek, user-friendly interface for managing campaigns and analyzing performance."
msgstr "**Dashboard Nua-Aimseartha:** Bain sult as comhéadan sleek, éasca le húsáid le haghaidh feachtais a bhainistiú agus feidhmíocht anailís."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Modern Forum Experience:** Engage in interactive, real-time discussions with a responsive, mobile-friendly design."
