# libretranslate
msgid "**Multi-statement chains in shell invocations are FORBIDDEN. ⛔** You MUST NOT chain independent statements inside a single Bash tool call with **any** statement separator (`;`, literal newline, `&&`, `||`, `&` background operator, or subshell/brace groups around the same). The ban covers causally-dependent chains (`cd X && cmd`) just as much as optional ones, and applies to trailing `&` used to background a command (use the Bash tool's `run_in_background: true` parameter instead). Reason: identical to the loop rule. Split the work across **separate Bash tool calls** or use a single-command equivalent (`xargs`, `grep` with multiple args, a make target)."
msgstr "**Tá slabhraí il-ráiteas i sonraisc bhlaosc FORBIDDEN.** NÍ MÓR duit ráitis neamhspleácha slabhra taobh istigh glaoch uirlis Bash amháin le **bláthanna cumhra: aon cumhráin** deighilteoir ráiteas (`;`, líne nua litriúil, `&&`, `||`, `&` oibreoir cúlra, nó grúpaí subshell / brace ar fud an gcéanna). Clúdaíonn an toirmeasc slabhraí causally-spleách (`cd X && cmd`) ach oiread agus cinn roghnacha, agus baineann sé le trailing `&` a úsáidtear chun cúlra ordú (úsáid a bhaint as an uirlis Bash `run_in_background: true` paraiméadar ionad). Cúis: comhionann leis an riail lúb. Scoilt an obair ar fud **glaonna uirlis Bash ar leith** nó úsáid a bhaint as coibhéis aon-ordaithe (`xargs`, `grep` le args il, a dhéanamh sprioc)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Multi-wall**: declare multiple purpose-built walls (per event, hashtag, account set, …) under one deployment."
msgstr "**Il-bhalla**: dhearbhú ballaí ilchuspóireacha-tógtha (in aghaidh an ócáid, hashtag, leagtha cuntas,...) faoi imscaradh amháin."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Multisite Management:** Easily create and maintain multiple sites with a single WordPress installation, ideal for networks of blogs, corporate intranets, or educational institutions."
msgstr "**Bainistíocht Ilchodach:** Go héasca a chruthú agus a chothabháil láithreáin éagsúla le suiteáil WordPress amháin, oiriúnach do líonraí de blogs, inlíonanna corparáideach, nó institiúidí oideachais."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Multisite path** (auto-detected via `is_multisite()`): per-site roles come from `/roles/web-app-wordpress/<canonical-domain>/<role>` entries; the super-admin capability comes from `/roles/web-app-wordpress/network-administrator`. The mapper adds the user to any site they have a role for (`add_user_to_blog`) and removes them from sites it previously added them to (`remove_user_from_blog`) when a role for that site disappears from the claim. A user-meta marker (`_infinito_oidc_added_blog_ids`) records which blog memberships the mapper owns, so memberships added through `wp-admin` or the REST API outside the OIDC flow are never touched."
msgstr "**cosán Ilchodach** (auto-bhraite trí `is_multisite()`): róil in aghaidh an láthair teacht ó `/roles/web-app-wordpress/<canonical-domain>/<role>` iontrálacha; Tagann an cumas Super-admin ó `/roles/web-app-wordpress/network-administrator`. Cuireann an mapper an t-úsáideoir ar aon suíomh a bhfuil ról acu le haghaidh (`add_user_to_blog`) agus cuireann sé iad ó láithreáin a chuir sé leo roimhe seo (`remove_user_from_blog`) nuair a imíonn ról don suíomh sin ón éileamh. A mharcáil úsáideora-meta (`_infinito_oidc_added_blog_ids`) taifid a ballraíocht bhlag an léarscáileoir úinéireacht, mar sin ballraíocht a leanas tríd `wp-admin` nó an API REST lasmuigh den OIDC sreabhadh riamh i dteagmháil léi."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Multi‑Server Management:**"
msgstr "**Bainistíocht Il-Server:**"

