# libretranslate
msgid "**Mutating commands that stay inside `allowWrite`** (e.g. `make test`, `pip install`, `docker build`, though builds still route through `ask`) just work under the sandbox."
msgstr "**Orduithe Mutating a fanacht taobh istigh `allowWrite`** (e.g. `make test`, `pip install`, `docker build`, cé Tógann bealach fós trí `ask`) díreach ag obair faoin mbosca gainimh."

