# libretranslate
msgid "**Never a plain container, and the deploy proves it.** A preflight probes the host for `/dev/kvm` and for each runtime's binary, and selects the strongest runtime that is actually installed; the choice is logged at deploy time. It MUST NOT fall back to a plain `runc` container: unisolated execution of model-generated code is never allowed."
msgstr "**Ná coimeádán plain, agus go gcruthóidh an imscaradh é.** A probes preflight an óstach do `/dev/kvm` agus do gach runtime dénártha, agus roghnaíonn an runtime láidre atá suiteáilte iarbhír; Is é an rogha logáilte ag am imscaradh. NÍ MÓR é titim ar ais go dtí plain `runc` coimeádán: nach bhfuil fhorghníomhú aonsolated de chód samhail-ghiniúint ceadaithe."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Never commit your API token to a public repository. Always keep it secure!**"
msgstr "**Ná tiomantas do API chomhartha chuig stór poiblí. Coimeád slán é i gcónaí!**"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Never disable.** Required by almost every app."
msgstr "**Ná díchumasaigh.** Riachtanach ag beagnach gach app."

