# libretranslate
msgid "**Operating a deployment.** New make targets reach a single deployed application: *compose-app-exec*, *compose-app-logs* and *compose-app-restart*. Diagnostics collect the logs an application writes to a file, including from busybox containers. Health probes use a fast start cadence with a window that outlasts a real boot, so a slow starter is no longer reaped. The CSP health check accepts a status code a vhost declares instead of dropping the vhost, and gives onion vhosts a navigation budget Tor can meet."
msgstr "**Imscaradh a oibriú.** Bainfidh spriocanna nua le hiarratas amháin a imlonnaíodh: *compose-app-exec*, *comhdhéanadh-app-logs* agus *déantúsaíocht-app-restart*. Diagnóiseacha a bhailiú na logs scríobhann iarratas chuig comhad, lena n-áirítear ó choimeádáin bosca gnóthach. Probes sláinte a úsáid cadence tús tapa le fuinneog go outlasts tosaithe fíor, mar sin tá tosaithe mall a thuilleadh reaped. Glacann an seiceáil sláinte CSP cód stádas a vhost Dearbhaíonn ionad dropping an vhost, agus tugann Oinniún vhosts buiséad nascleanúint Is féidir Tor freastal."

