# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Paths that look wrong and are not.** Policies mount at `/openbao/policies/`, because OpenBao parses *every* file under `-config` as server configuration. Storage is `/openbao/file`, not `/openbao/data`: the image pre-chowns only `/openbao/{config,logs,file}` for the non-root `openbao` user, so a volume elsewhere lands root-owned and raft cannot write. `command:` is just `server` — the entrypoint appends `-config` itself, and passing it duplicates the flag."
msgstr "**Paths a cuma mícheart agus nach bhfuil.** Beartais mount ag `/openbao/policies/`, Mar gheall ar pharsaí OpenBao *gach rud* comhad faoi `-config` mar chumraíocht freastalaí. Is maith liom é `/openbao/file`, Níl, `/openbao/data`: an íomhá réamh- leathanaigh amháin `/openbao/{config,logs,file}` don neamh-fréamh `openbao` úsáideoir, mar sin ní féidir le toirt in áit eile tailte fréamh-úinéireacht agus rafta scríobh. `command:` Is maith liom é `server` — na haguisíní iontrála `-config` féin, agus é a rith dhúbailt an bhratach."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Paths that look wrong and are not.** Policies mount at ``/openbao/policies/``, because OpenBao parses *every* file under ``-config`` as server configuration. Storage is ``/openbao/file``, not ``/openbao/data``: the image pre-chowns only ``/openbao/{config,logs,file}`` for the non-root ``openbao`` user, so a volume elsewhere lands root-owned and raft cannot write. ``command:`` is just ``server`` — the entrypoint appends ``-config`` itself, and passing it duplicates the flag."
msgstr "**Paths a cuma mícheart agus nach bhfuil.** Beartais mount ag ``/openbao/policies/``, Mar gheall ar pharsaí OpenBao *gach rud* comhad faoi ``-config`` mar chumraíocht freastalaí. Is maith liom é ``/openbao/file``, Níl, ``/openbao/data``: an íomhá réamh- leathanaigh amháin ``/openbao/{config,logs,file}`` don neamh-fréamh ``openbao`` úsáideoir, mar sin ní féidir le toirt in áit eile tailte fréamh-úinéireacht agus rafta scríobh. ``command:`` Is maith liom é ``server`` — na haguisíní iontrála ``-config`` féin, agus é a rith dhúbailt an bhratach."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-Consumer Isolation:** Each consumer gets a role and user scoped to its own `<entity>-*` index namespace."
msgstr "**Isolation Per-Tomhaltóir:** Faigheann gach tomhaltóir ról agus úsáideoir raon feidhme ar a chuid féin `<entity>-*` innéacs namespace."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-Consumer Isolation:** Each consumer gets a role and user scoped to its own ``<entity>-*`` index namespace."
msgstr "**Isolation Per-Tomhaltóir:** Faigheann gach tomhaltóir ról agus úsáideoir raon feidhme ar a chuid féin ``<entity>-*`` innéacs namespace."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-Consumer Isolation:** Issues a scoped API key per consumer, restricted to its own collection namespace."
msgstr "**Isolation Per-Tomhaltóir:** Saincheisteanna eochair API raon feidhme in aghaidh an tomhaltóra, teoranta dá ainmspás bailiúcháin féin."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Per-Consumer Isolation:** OSS Qdrant has no per-user auth; each consumer is isolated by the collection-name prefix ``{entity}_``."
msgstr "**Isolation Per-Tomhaltóir:** Tá OSS Qdrant aon auth in aghaidh an-úsáideoir; Tá gach tomhaltóir scoite ag an réimír ainm bailiúchán ``{entity}_``."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Per-Consumer Isolation:** OSS Qdrant has no per-user auth; each consumer is isolated by the collection-name prefix `{entity}_`."
msgstr "**Isolation Per-Tomhaltóir:** Tá OSS Qdrant aon auth in aghaidh an-úsáideoir; Tá gach tomhaltóir scoite ag an réimír ainm bailiúchán `{entity}_`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-app RBAC:** Members of `/roles/web-app-kix/administrator` or `/roles/web-app-kix/user` are admitted to KIX; other users are blocked at the OAuth2 proxy. The `user` role is declared via `meta/rbac.yml` so non-admin agents can be granted helpdesk access without bumping them to global administrator."
msgstr "**RBAC Per-app:** Comhaltaí na gComhaltaí `/roles/web-app-kix/administrator` nó `/roles/web-app-kix/user` admhaítear go KIX; úsáideoirí eile a bhlocáil ag an OAuth2 seachvótálaí. An bhfuil `user` Tá ról a dhearbhú trí `meta/rbac.yml` ionas gur féidir neamh-admin gníomhairí a dheonú rochtain deisce cabhrach gan bumping iad a riarthóir domhanda."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-app RBAC:** Members of ``/roles/web-app-kix/administrator`` or ``/roles/web-app-kix/user`` are admitted to KIX; other users are blocked at the OAuth2 proxy. The ``user`` role is declared via ``meta/rbac.yml`` so non-admin agents can be granted helpdesk access without bumping them to global administrator."
msgstr "**RBAC Per-app:** Comhaltaí na gComhaltaí ``/roles/web-app-kix/administrator`` nó ``/roles/web-app-kix/user`` admhaítear go KIX; úsáideoirí eile a bhlocáil ag an OAuth2 seachvótálaí. An bhfuil ``user`` Tá ról a dhearbhú trí ``meta/rbac.yml`` ionas gur féidir neamh-admin gníomhairí a dheonú rochtain deisce cabhrach gan bumping iad a riarthóir domhanda."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-consumer isolation:** Every consumer receives its own identity and bucket with bucket-scoped actions only."
msgstr "**Aonrú Per-tomhaltóir:** Faigheann gach tomhaltóir a chéannacht féin agus buicéad le gníomhartha buicéad-scóip amháin."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-consumer virtual keys:** Each consuming application receives its own virtual key, created through the gateway admin API under an alias naming that application."
msgstr "**Per-tomhaltóir eochracha fíorúil:** Faigheann gach iarratas Tógann a eochair fíorúil féin, a cruthaíodh tríd an API geata admin faoi ailias ainmniú an t-iarratas."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-container snapshots:** rsync `--link-dest` snapshots deduplicate unchanged files across runs."
msgstr "**Per-tainer snapshots:** rsync `--link-dest` snapshots deduplicate comhaid gan athrú ar fud ritheann."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-container snapshots:** rsync ``--link-dest`` snapshots deduplicate unchanged files across runs."
msgstr "**Per-tainer snapshots:** rsync ``--link-dest`` snapshots deduplicate comhaid gan athrú ar fud ritheann."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-domain TLS via app-level override**: extra public domains under `applications.<app>.server.domains` deploy as additional HTTPS vhosts; flavor from `applications.<app>.tls.mode` (default `TLS_MODE`). `.onion` → always HTTP. No per-domain TLS map."
msgstr "**Per-domain TLS trí shárú ar leibhéal app**: fearainn phoiblí breise faoi `applications.<app>.server.domains` imscaradh mar vhosts HTTPS breise; blas ó `applications.<app>.tls.mode` (cineál gas: in airde `TLS_MODE`). `.onion` → i gcónaí HTTP. No per-domain TLS léarscáil."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-family dispatch:** Routes by ``ansible_facts['distribution']`` so the caller never has to gate the role with a ``when:`` clause."
msgstr "**Seoladh an teaghlaigh:** Bealaí ag ``ansible_facts['distribution']`` mar sin ní mór don ghlaoiteoir an ról a réiteach le ``when:`` clásal."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-family dispatch:** Routes by `ansible_facts['distribution']` so the caller never has to gate the role with a `when:` clause."
msgstr "**Seoladh an teaghlaigh:** Bealaí ag `ansible_facts['distribution']` mar sin ní mór don ghlaoiteoir an ról a réiteach le `when:` clásal."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-role opt-IN** on a non-swarm host: explicitly rejected. Swarm mode is exclusively triggered by group membership. The per-role `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` override only opts OUT on a swarm host, never opts IN on a non-swarm host."
msgstr "**An rogha Per-role** ar óstach neamh-swarm: dhiúltaigh sé go sainráite. Tá modh Swarm spreagtha go heisiach ag ballraíocht ghrúpa. An per-role `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` override roghnaíonn ach OUT ar óstach swarm, riamh roghnaíonn I ar óstach neamh-swarm."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-role opt-OUT** on a swarm host: a role MAY override `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose` in its `vars/main.yml` to stay on the compose path even when the host is in `svc-swarm-node`. Role vars win over `group_vars/all` by Ansible precedence."
msgstr "**Per-role rogha AS** ar óstach muc: ról MAY override `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose` ina `vars/main.yml` fanacht ar an cosán a chumadh fiú nuair a bhíonn an t-óstach i `svc-swarm-node`. Ról vars bhuachan thar `group_vars/all` ag tosaíocht Infheicthe."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Per-round variant selection.** In round R every primary app uses variant index `R if R < its_variant_count else 0`. So a single-variant app stays on variant 0 in every round, and a 3-variant app in a 5-round deploy follows `0, 1, 2, 0, 0`."
msgstr "**Roghnú leagan Per-timpeall.** I bhabhta R Úsáideann gach app bunscoile innéacs athraitheach `R if R < its_variant_count else 0`. Mar sin, fanann app aon-athrú ar malairt 0 i ngach babhta, agus 3-Aip éagsúil i 5leanas - Timpeall imscaradh `0, 1, 2, 0, 0`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Performance Enhancement:** Ensures adequate swap space for optimal system performance."
msgstr "**Feabhsú Feidhmíochta:** Cinntíonn spás leordhóthanach swap le haghaidh feidhmíocht córas is fearr is féidir."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Performance Optimization:** Improves overall system performance by leveraging appropriate storage media."
msgstr "**Optamaithe Feidhmíochta:** Feabhsaíonn feidhmíocht fhoriomlán an chórais trí na meáin stórála iomchuí a laghdú."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Performance trade‑off:** While slightly more storage might be used compared to `latin1`, the universality of `utf8mb4` outweighs the cost for most deployments."
msgstr "**Trádáil feidhmíochta-uaire:** Cé go bhféadfadh níos mó stórála a úsáid i gcomparáid le `latin1`, an uilíocht `utf8mb4` níos mó ná an costas don chuid is mó imscaradh."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Permissions:** Ensure you have the necessary permissions and rights within the Docker container to perform these actions."
msgstr "**Ceadanna:** A chinntiú go bhfuil na ceadanna agus na cearta is gá agat laistigh den choimeádán Docker chun na gníomhartha seo a dhéanamh."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Persisted on the deploy target** for `INFINITO_VERSION`, written by the [sys-version](../../../roles/sys-version/) role."
msgstr "**Sisted ar an sprioc imscaradh** le haghaidh `INFINITO_VERSION`, scríofa ag an [riachtanais uisce: measartha](../../../roles/sys-version/) ról."

# libretranslate
