# libretranslate
msgid "**Pinning rounds (single or bundle).** Both init and deploy accept `--variant <csv>` (same semantics as the `variant=` make arg): a single index (`1`) pins one round, a comma-separated list (`0,1,2`) iterates that subset, and empty/unset is the full matrix. When the selection is a single round no inter-round cleanup runs (no previous round to diff against); out-of-range indices raise a clean error. The `make compose-deploy mode=update` flows honour the same `variant=` arg by suffixing `INFINITO_INVENTORY_DIR` / `INFINITO_INVENTORY_FILE` to `<base>-<idx>` (single index), so a redeploy can target one specific variant without iterating the full matrix."
msgstr "**babhtaí pinning (singil nó bundle).** An dá init agus imscaradh glacadh `--variant <csv>` (shéimeantach céanna leis an `variant=` a dhéanamh ar g): innéacs amháin (`1`) bioráin bhabhta amháin, liosta coma-scartha (`0,1,2`) iterates go bhfuil fo-thacar, agus folamh / unset an maitrís iomlán. Nuair a bhíonn an rogha babhta amháin Ritheann aon glanta idir-timthriall (aon bhabhta roimhe sin diff in aghaidh); out-de-raoin innéacsanna a ardú earráid glan. An bhfuil `make compose-deploy mode=update` sreafaí onóir an gcéanna `variant=` arg trí iarmhír `INFINITO_INVENTORY_DIR` / Baile `INFINITO_INVENTORY_FILE` go dtí `<base>-<idx>` (innéacs amháin), mar sin is féidir le redeploy díriú ar leagan amháin ar leith gan atriall an maitrís iomlán."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Pins that cannot age unnoticed.** Image pins are classified and pull references built from the class, a moving tag declares itself with the marker it already carries, and a role's images move as one release or not at all. The updater reads addon declarations, orders vendor patch counters and five-component versions, reads a release line written before the number as a family, and now also watches pinned pip requirements and Ansible collections. Seven roles moved off the Debian codename base onto slim, and one Ubuntu mirror list with failover, a short timeout and a health test serves both the package cache and the image builds. *js-yaml* was lifted to 4.3.2 for GHSA-2883-xcg3-v3hh."
msgstr "**PINs nach féidir a aois unnoticed.** Tá bioráin Íomhá aicmithe agus tarraing tagairtí tógtha ón rang, dearbhaíonn tag ag gluaiseacht féin leis an marcóir a ndéanann sé cheana féin, agus bogadh íomhánna ról mar scaoileadh amháin nó nach bhfuil ar chor ar bith. Léann an updater dearbhuithe addon, orduithe gcuntar paiste díoltóir agus leaganacha cúig-chomhpháirt, léann líne a scaoileadh scríofa roimh an uimhir mar theaghlach, agus anois uaireadóirí pinned freisin ceanglais pip agus bailiúcháin Ansible. Seacht róil ar athraíodh a ionad as an bonn debian codename isteach caol, agus ceann amháin liosta scáthán Ubuntu le fail, timeout gearr agus feidhmíonn tástáil sláinte an dá an taisce pacáiste agus an tógáil íomhá. *riachtanais uisce: measartha* tógadh go 4.3.2 le haghaidh GHSA-2883Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí3An bhfuil tú3hh."

