# libretranslate
msgid "**Preloaded models:** Every entry of ``services.lmstudio.preload_models`` is downloaded on the hosting node with ``lms get --gguf``, overlapped and reaped like the Ollama pre-pull. Each entry carries the ``source`` repository to download, the ``name`` LM Studio indexes that repository under and the gateway addresses it by, and the ``alias`` the gateway publishes it as. ``source`` is a full Hugging Face URL, never a search term: a search term resolves to whichever model the catalogue lists first."
msgstr "**Samhlacha réamhluchtaithe:** Gach iontráil ``services.lmstudio.preload_models`` íoslódáil ar an nód óstáil le ``lms get --gguf``, overlapped agus reaped cosúil leis an Ollama réamh-pull. Déanann gach iontráil ``source`` stór a íoslódáil, an ``name`` LM Stiúideo innéacsanna a stór faoi agus an geata aghaidh air ag, agus an ``alias`` foilsíonn an geata é mar. ``source`` Is URL Aghaidh iomlán Hugging, riamh téarma cuardaigh: réitíonn téarma cuardaigh a cibé samhail na liostaí catalóg ar dtús."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Preloaded models:** Every entry of `services.lmstudio.preload_models` is downloaded on the hosting node with `lms get --gguf`, overlapped and reaped like the Ollama pre-pull. Each entry carries the `source` repository to download, the `name` LM Studio indexes that repository under and the gateway addresses it by, and the `alias` the gateway publishes it as. `source` is a full Hugging Face URL, never a search term: a search term resolves to whichever model the catalogue lists first."
