msgid "**Raspberry Pi is a real deploy target.** Agent images MUST publish an `arm64` manifest so a Pi-class node can pull them, and the agents MUST schedule across at least two labelled worker nodes. This is arch coverage, not arch exclusivity: the same images keep running on the amd64 nodes that CI and the lab use, so the requirement is that every architecture a node may have is published, never that a deploy is pinned to one."
msgstr "**Is sprioc imscaradh fíor é Raspberry Pi.** Íomhánna Gníomhaire MUST fhoilsiú `arm64` léiriú mar sin is féidir le nód Pi-aicme iad a tharraingt, agus na gníomhairí MUST sceideal ar fud ar a laghad dhá nóid oibrí lipéadaithe. Tá sé seo clúdach áirse, ní exclusivity áirse: na híomhánna céanna a choinneáil ag rith ar an amd64 nóid go CI agus an úsáid saotharlainne, mar sin tá an ceanglas go bhféadfadh gach ailtireacht a nód a bheith foilsithe, riamh go bhfuil imscaradh pinned le ceann amháin."

