msgid "**Registry and variant changes.** A variant can dictate the configuration of the providers it pulls in, and an MCP round decides for itself what it carries, which is the breaking change in this release. Fifteen moving pins gained names the registry can order, every MCP provider is registered as a shared service, *meta/schema.yml* finished its rename to *meta/secrets.yml*, role scripts are sorted into per-language folders, and *meta/addons* is now an accepted declaration site for pins and plugins."
msgstr "**Clárú agus athruithe leagan.** Is féidir le malairt cumraíocht na soláthraithe pulls sé i, agus cinntíonn babhta MCP dó féin cad a dhéanann sé, a bhfuil an t-athrú briseadh sa scaoileadh. Fifteen bioráin ag gluaiseacht a fuarthas ainmneacha is féidir leis an gclárlann ordú, tá gach soláthraí MCP cláraithe mar sheirbhís chomhroinnte, *meta/schema.yml* a athainmniú chun críche *meta/secrets.yml*, scripteanna ról atá curtha in eagar i fillteáin in aghaidh na teanga, agus *meta / breiseáin* Tá anois ar láithreán dearbhú glactha le haghaidh bioráin agus plugins."

