msgid "**Reverse-Proxy Ready:** Sets ``ATL_PROXY_NAME/PORT/SCHEME/SECURE`` so Confluence generates correct external URLs behind HTTPS."
msgstr "**Reverse-Proxy Réidh:** Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí ``ATL_PROXY_NAME/PORT/SCHEME/SECURE`` mar sin Gineann tionchar URLanna seachtracha ceart taobh thiar HTTPS."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Reverse-Proxy/HTTPS Ready:** Preconfigured Atlassian Tomcat proxy envs so Jira respects external scheme/host/port."
msgstr "**Reverse-Proxy / HTTPS Réidh:** Envs seachfhreastalaí Atlassian Tomcat mar sin Jira meas seachtrach scheme/host/port."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Reverse-proxy trust:** Renders a ``configuration.yaml`` with ``default_config``, ``use_x_forwarded_for``, and the project-wide trusted-proxy CIDRs listed in ``trusted_proxies``. In swarm the hub joins the proxy’s own overlay, so the forwarded request arrives from that network rather than from the hub’s, and trusting only the hub’s subnet makes Home Assistant answer every proxied request with HTTP 400."
msgstr "**Reverse-proxy muinín:** Renders a ``configuration.yaml`` le ``default_config``, ``use_x_forwarded_for``, agus an tionscadal ar fud iontaofa-proxy CIDRs atá liostaithe i ``trusted_proxies``. I swarm théann an mol overlay an seachvótálaí féin, mar sin tagann an t-iarratas ar aghaidh ón líonra sin seachas ó na mol ar, agus trusting ach a dhéanann subnet an mol freagra Cúntóir Baile gach iarraidh proxied le HTTP 400."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Reverse-proxy trust:** Renders a `configuration.yaml` with `default_config`, `use_x_forwarded_for`, and the project-wide trusted-proxy CIDRs listed in `trusted_proxies`. In swarm the hub joins the proxy's own overlay, so the forwarded request arrives from that network rather than from the hub's, and trusting only the hub's subnet makes Home Assistant answer every proxied request with HTTP 400."
msgstr "**Reverse-proxy muinín:** Renders a `configuration.yaml` le `default_config`, `use_x_forwarded_for`, agus an tionscadal ar fud iontaofa-proxy CIDRs atá liostaithe i `trusted_proxies`. I swarm théann an mol le forleagan an seachvótálaí féin, mar sin tagann an t-iarratas ar aghaidh ón líonra sin seachas ó na mol, agus ní dhéanann muinín ach subnet an mhoil freagra Cúntóir Baile gach iarraidh proxied le HTTP 400."

