# libretranslate
msgid "**Robust Scalability & Performance:** Leverage integrated Redis caching and a reliable database (MariaDB or PostgreSQL) for smooth scaling and high performance."
msgstr "**Scalability & Feidhmíocht Robust:** Leverage comhtháite Redis caching agus bunachar sonraí iontaofa (MariaDB nó PostgreSQL) le haghaidh scaling réidh agus feidhmíocht ard."

# libretranslate
