# libretranslate
msgid "**Role-strategy authorisation:** Map Keycloak groups and LDAP groups onto Jenkins authorities through the ``role-strategy`` plugin."
msgstr "**Údarú Ról-strategy:** Léarscáil grúpaí Keycloak agus grúpaí LDAP isteach údaráis Jenkins tríd an ``role-strategy`` breiseán."

