# libretranslate
msgid "**Runtime probing:** The container role checks every host for `/dev/kvm`, for the Kata shim binary and for docker-in-docker, and publishes the resulting choice between `kata` and `runsc` as `SANDBOX_RUNTIME`."
msgstr "**Rithtime probing:** Seiceálacha ról coimeádán gach óstach do `/dev/kvm`, le haghaidh an chim dénártha Kata agus le haghaidh docker-i-dugaer, agus foilsíonn an rogha mar thoradh idir `kata` agus `runsc` mar atá `SANDBOX_RUNTIME`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Runtime probing:** The container role checks every host for ``/dev/kvm``, for the Kata shim binary and for docker-in-docker, and publishes the resulting choice between ``kata`` and ``runsc`` as ``SANDBOX_RUNTIME``."
msgstr "**Rithtime probing:** Seiceálacha ról coimeádán gach óstach do ``/dev/kvm``, le haghaidh an chim dénártha Kata agus le haghaidh docker-i-dugaer, agus foilsíonn an rogha mar thoradh idir ``kata`` agus ``runsc`` mar atá ``SANDBOX_RUNTIME``."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Runtime target:** Cloudflare Workers (`wrangler.jsonc` present), backed by **D1** (Cloudflare's SQLite) as the aggregator cache and **Meilisearch** (optional) for full-text + geo search."
msgstr "**Sprioc Runtime:** Oibrithe scamallach (`wrangler.jsonc` i láthair na huaire), tacaíocht ag **D. D.D.1** (cliceáil grianghraf a mhéadú) mar an taisce aggregator agus **Déan Teagmháil Linn** (roghnach) le haghaidh cuardaigh lán-téacs + geo."

# libretranslate
