# libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Architecture:** Benefit from a multi-service, Docker-based setup that supports high user loads and seamless background processing."
msgstr "**ailtireacht Scalable:** Sochar ó thus ilseirbhíse, Docker-bhunaithe a thacaíonn ualaí úsáideoirí ard agus próiseáil cúlra gan uaim."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Architecture:** Designed to handle increasing user loads and message volumes with high performance."
msgstr "**ailtireacht Scalable:** Deartha chun láimhseáil ualaí úsáideora ag méadú agus méideanna teachtaireacht le feidhmíocht ard."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Architecture:** Efficiently handle increasing workloads while maintaining high performance."
msgstr "**ailtireacht Scalable:** Láimhseáil go héifeachtach ualaí oibre a mhéadú agus feidhmíocht ard a choinneáil."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Architecture:** Utilize a Docker-based deployment that adapts easily to increasing traffic and community size."
msgstr "**ailtireacht Scalable:** Úsáid a bhaint as Docker-bhunaithe a chuireann in oiriúint go héasca chun méid tráchta agus pobail a mhéadú."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Deployment:** Leverage Docker for a portable and scalable installation that adapts as your user base grows."
msgstr "**Imscaradh Scalable:** Docker Leverage le haghaidh suiteáil iniompartha agus inscálaithe a théann in oiriúint mar a fhásann do bonn úsáideora."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Deployment:** Use Docker to ensure your analytics platform can grow with your traffic demands."
msgstr "**Imscaradh Scalable:** Bain úsáid as Docker chun a chinntiú gur féidir le do ardán Analytics fás le do éilimh tráchta."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Deployment:** Use Docker to ensure your event platform grows seamlessly with your community’s needs."
msgstr "**Imscaradh Scalable:** Bain úsáid as Docker chun a chinntiú go bhfásann do ardán ócáid seamlessly le riachtanais do phobail."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Deployment:** Utilize Docker for a portable and scalable setup that adapts as your community grows."
msgstr "**Imscaradh Scalable:** Utilize Docker do thus iniompartha agus inscálaithe go n-oiriúnaíonn mar a fhásann do phobal."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable Service Architecture:** Leverage the robust orchestration of multiple services to power your Funkwhale instance."
msgstr "**ailtireacht Seirbhís Scalable:** Deoch an orchestration láidir na seirbhísí il a chumhacht do shampla Funkwhale."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Scalable and Customizable:** Easily tailor settings and scale your Keycloak instance to meet growing demands."
msgstr "**Scalable agus Customizable:** Socruithe saincheaptha go héasca agus scála do shampla Keycloak chun freastal ar éilimh atá ag fás."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Schedule-coordinated:** the systemd unit is part of the global manipulation group, so it never races backup/cleanup/repair jobs on the same host."
msgstr "**Sceideal-chomhordú:** Is é an t-aonad córasach mar chuid den ghrúpa ionramháil domhanda, mar sin ní rásaí sé backup/cleanup/repair poist ar an óstach céanna."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Scheduled Execution:** Integrates with a systemd timer for periodic health sweeps."
msgstr "**Forghníomhú Sceidealta:** Comhtháthú le lasc ama córasach le haghaidh scuaba sláinte tréimhsiúla."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Scheduled Execution:** Runs daily (or as configured) based on `SYS_SCHEDULE_CLEANUP_DOCKER`."
msgstr "**Forghníomhú Sceidealta:** Rith laethúil (nó mar cumraithe) bunaithe ar `SYS_SCHEDULE_CLEANUP_DOCKER`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Scheduled Execution:** Runs daily (or as configured) based on ``SYS_SCHEDULE_CLEANUP_DOCKER``."
msgstr "**Forghníomhú Sceidealta:** Rith laethúil (nó mar cumraithe) bunaithe ar ``SYS_SCHEDULE_CLEANUP_DOCKER``."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Scope is the full backlog, executed in phases.** The definition of done is the FULL set: every ✅ cell in the matrix wired as an addon, and an exhaustive per-`web-app-*`-role upstream-plugin survey completed so the ✅ layer is exhaustive rather than hub-biased. Delivery is phased: the shared contract plus the first-slice roles land first (see [Implementation Strategy](#implementation-strategy)), then the remaining roles and ✅ wirings sweep incrementally, but no phase reduces scope. The requirement is not complete until the full ✅ set is wired and every `web-app-*` role surveyed."
msgstr "**Is é an raon feidhme an backlog iomlán, fhorghníomhú i gcéimeanna.** Is é an sainmhíniú a rinneadh an sraith FULL: gach cill SI sa sreang maitrís mar addon, agus uileghabhálach in aghaidh an-`web-app-*`-role suirbhé upstream-plugin curtha i gcrích mar sin tá an ciseal PT exhaustive seachas mol-biased. Seachadadh céimnithe: an conradh roinnte móide na róil chéad-slice talamh chéad (féach ar [Plean Gníomhaíochta don Oideachas](#implementation-strategy)), ansin na róil atá fágtha agus sreangú TP sweep incrimintigh, ach laghdaíonn aon chéim raon feidhme. Níl an ceanglas iomlán go dtí go bhfuil an tacar iomlán CRF sreangaithe agus gach `web-app-*` ról suirbhé."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Scoped Content-Security-Policy:** The UI's inline bootstrap scripts pass through a `script-src-elem` flag, and no external font or connect sources are whitelisted."
msgstr "**Raon feidhme Ábhar-Security-Policy:** An Chomhéadain ar inlíne buataisítrap scripteanna pas a fháil trí `script-src-elem` bratach, agus gan aon chló seachtrach nó ceangal foinsí a whitelisted."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Scoped Content-Security-Policy:** The UI’s inline bootstrap scripts pass through a ``script-src-elem`` flag, and no external font or connect sources are whitelisted."
msgstr "**Raon feidhme Ábhar-Security-Policy:** An Chomhéadain ar inlíne buataisítrap scripteanna pas a fháil trí ``script-src-elem`` bratach, agus gan aon chló seachtrach nó ceangal foinsí a whitelisted."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Script Cloning:** Retrieves the latest swapfile creation script from a Git repository."
