# libretranslate
msgid "**Seal is `seal \"static\"`** with a 32-byte key generated by the repo credential generator into the ansible-vault-encrypted inventory and injected as `env://OPENBAO_SEAL_KEY`."
msgstr "**Is é an séala `seal \"static\"`** le 32-tríte eochair a ghintear ag an gineadóir repo dintiúir isteach ansible-vault-encrypted fardal agus instealladh mar `env://OPENBAO_SEAL_KEY`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Seamless Collaboration:** Collaborate in real time with team members, ensuring smooth data sharing and project management."
msgstr "**Comhoibriú gan uaim:** Comhoibriú i bhfíor-am le baill foirne, ag cinntiú sonraí a roinnt go réidh agus bainistíocht tionscadail."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Seamless Docker Integration:** Works harmoniously with Docker Compose and other roles in your infrastructure."
msgstr "**Comhtháthú Docker gan uaim:** Oibríonn sé go comhchuí le Docker Compose agus róil eile i do bhonneagar."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Seamless Docker Integration:** Works with Docker Compose and the central-engine deploy machinery."
msgstr "**Comhtháthú Docker gan uaim:** Oibreacha le Docker Compose agus an innealra lár-inneall imscaradh."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Seamless IFrame Embedding**: Launch apps directly within the UI or open in new tabs."
msgstr "**Suíochán IFrame Leabaithe**: Seoladh apps go díreach laistigh den Chomhéadain nó a oscailt i tabs nua."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Seamless Integration:** Designed to work within a larger system setup environment, integrating with dependencies such as Hunspell for spell checking."
msgstr "**Comhtháthú gan uaim:** Deartha chun obair laistigh de thimpeallacht thus córas níos mó, a chomhtháthú le spleáchais ar nós Hunspell le haghaidh seiceáil litriú."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Seamless Integration:** Easily integrates with other automation roles for a complete system setup."
msgstr "**Comhtháthú gan uaim:** Comhtháthaíonn sé go héasca le róil uathoibriú eile le haghaidh thus córas iomlán."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Seamless Integration:** Provides a stable and secure browsing setup as part of broader system automation workflows."
msgstr "**Comhtháthú gan uaim:** Soláthraíonn thus brabhsála cobhsaí agus slán mar chuid de shreabhadh oibre uathoibriú córas níos leithne."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Seamless NGINX Reload:** Reloads the NGINX service automatically after successful renewals."
msgstr "**Uaslódáil gan uaim NGINX:** Reloads an tseirbhís NGINX go huathoibríoch tar éis athnuachana rathúil."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Secrets management with OpenBao.** The new *web-app-openbao* role deploys OpenBao at *openbao.<domain>*. It stores application credentials, API keys and machine identities. People sign in through Keycloak, or through LDAP when OpenLDAP is deployed. Their *administrator*, *operator* or *reader* group decides what they can reach, and signing in without one of those groups grants only the default policy. Services and automation use their own AppRole identities, whose credentials change on every deploy, and no root token is kept after the first deploy. A recovery key kept in the token store lets a later deploy get back in if those credentials are lost. A static seal unseals the node on its own after every restart. An internal PKI can be switched on, and Prometheus alerts when the node is sealed or unreachable. The seal key lives only in the encrypted inventory, and a backup of the store cannot be read without it, so back up the inventory together with the volume. See [web-app-openbao](roles/web-app-openbao/README.md)."
msgstr "**Bainistíocht Rúin le OpenBao.** An nua *web development* Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí *openbao.<domain>*. siopaí sé dintiúir iarratais, eochracha API agus céannachtaí meaisín. Daoine a shíniú i trí Keycloak, nó trí LDAP nuair a OpenLDAP imscaradh. A n- *business directory*, *trade policy* nó *léitheoireacht* chinneann grúpa cad is féidir leo a bhaint amach, agus a shíniú i gan ceann de na grúpaí deontais ach an polasaí réamhshocraithe. Seirbhísí agus uathoibriú úsáid a n-aitheantas AppRole féin, a bhfuil dintiúir athrú ar gach imscaradh, agus nach bhfuil aon chomhartha fréimhe a choimeád tar éis an chéad imscaradh. Ligeann eochair a ghnóthú a choimeádtar sa siopa chomhartha a imscaradh níos déanaí a fháil ar ais i má tá na dintiúir caillte. Unseal séala statach an nód ar a chuid féin tar éis gach restart. Is féidir le PKI inmheánach a athrú ar, agus foláirimh Prometheus nuair a bhíonn an nód séalaithe nó neamh-in-athchúrsáilte. An saol eochair séala ach amháin san fhardal criptithe, agus ní féidir cúltaca an siopa a léamh gan é, mar sin ar ais suas an fardal mar aon leis an méid. Féach ar [web development](roles/web-app-openbao/README.md)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Secrets reuse the credentials mechanism.** MCP tokens, app-passwords, and OAuth client secrets are declared in each role's [`meta/secrets.yml`](../../roles/web-app-baserow/meta/secrets.yml) `credentials:` block and read via `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')`. No new secret store is introduced."
msgstr "**Rúin athúsáid an mheicníocht dintiúir.** Fógraítear comharthaí MCP, app-passwords, agus rúin chliaint OAuth i ngach ról [`meta/secrets.yml`](../../roles/web-app-baserow/meta/secrets.yml) `credentials:` bloc agus a léamh trí `lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')`. Níl aon siopa rúnda nua isteach."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Secure Access:** Integrates with an NGINX reverse proxy for encrypted, high-performance access."
msgstr "**Rochtain shlán:** Comhtháthú le seachfhreastalaí NGINX droim ar ais le haghaidh rochtain criptithe, ard-fheidhmíocht."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Secure Access:** Utilize NGINX reverse proxy integration to safeguard your management interface."
msgstr "**Rochtain shlán:** Úsáid NGINX comhtháthú seachfhreastalaí droim ar ais a chosaint do comhéadan bainistíochta."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Secure Communications:** Enable TLS encryption for data in transit when accessed through an NGINX reverse proxy."
msgstr "**Slán Cumarsáid:** Cumasaigh criptithe TLS le haghaidh sonraí i idirthurais nuair a rochtain trí seachfhreastalaí NGINX droim ar ais."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Secure Notifications:** Integrates with systemd to trigger email alerts when services fail."
msgstr "**Fógraí Slán:** Comhtháthú le systemd chun tús foláirimh ríomhphoist nuair a theipeann seirbhísí."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Secure Notifications:** Leverages systemd to trigger alerts automatically when services fail."
msgstr "**Fógraí Slán:** Deochanna córasaithe chun foláirimh a spreagadh go huathoibríoch nuair a theipeann ar sheirbhísí."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Secure Remote Access:** Facilitates secure remote access by providing a verified public key for use with [SSH](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell)."
msgstr "**Secure Rochtain cianda:** Éascaíonn rochtain iargúlta slán trí eochair phoiblí fíoraithe a sholáthar le húsáid le [SSH S](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Secure Remote Access:** Facilitates secure remote access by providing a verified public key for use with `SSH <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell>`__."
msgstr "**Secure Rochtain cianda:** Éascaíonn rochtain iargúlta slán trí eochair phoiblí fíoraithe a sholáthar le húsáid le `SSH <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell>`__."

