# libretranslate
msgid "**Self-registration** is *on* when OIDC is enabled and *off* otherwise — also derived from the ``sso`` service flag. Penpot routes first-time OIDC logins through the registration path (a disabled flag makes the callback fail with ``?error=registration-disabled`` for not-yet-provisioned users), so registration must stay on wherever OIDC is. Native admin is bootstrapped and LDAP self-provisions without it. ``PENPOT_FLAGS`` renders ``enable-registration`` / ``disable-registration`` accordingly."
msgstr "**Féinchlárú** Is maith liom *ar aghaidh* nuair a chumasaítear OIDC agus *amach as* ar shlí eile — a dhíorthaigh freisin ón ``sso`` bratach seirbhíse. Bealaí Penpot logáil isteach den chéad uair OIDC tríd an cosán clárúcháin (a dhéanann bratach faoi mhíchumas an callback theipeann le ``?error=registration-disabled`` d'úsáideoirí nach bhfuil ar fáil), mar sin ní mór clárú fanacht ar cibé áit a bhfuil OIDC. Tá admin Dúchasach bootstrapped agus LDAP féin-forálacha gan é. ``PENPOT_FLAGS`` custom ``enable-registration`` / Baile ``disable-registration`` dá réir sin."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Self-registration** is *on* when OIDC is enabled and *off* otherwise — also derived from the `sso` service flag. Penpot routes first-time OIDC logins through the registration path (a disabled flag makes the callback fail with `?error=registration-disabled` for not-yet-provisioned users), so registration must stay on wherever OIDC is. Native admin is bootstrapped and LDAP self-provisions without it. `PENPOT_FLAGS` renders `enable-registration` / `disable-registration` accordingly."
msgstr "**Féinchlárú** Is maith liom *ar aghaidh* nuair a chumasaítear OIDC agus *amach as* ar shlí eile — a dhíorthaigh freisin ón `sso` bratach seirbhíse. Bealaí Penpot logáil isteach den chéad uair OIDC tríd an cosán clárúcháin (a dhéanann bratach faoi mhíchumas an callback theipeann le `?error=registration-disabled` d'úsáideoirí nach bhfuil ar fáil), mar sin ní mór clárú fanacht ar cibé áit a bhfuil OIDC. Tá admin Dúchasach bootstrapped agus LDAP féin-forálacha gan é. `PENPOT_FLAGS` custom `enable-registration` / Baile `disable-registration` dá réir sin."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Sentinel `__ALL__` in the `whitelist` input** (case-insensitive). The diff logic MUST be skipped and an empty whitelist MUST be emitted, which deploys everything in the workflow's scope. This is the explicit opt-out from diff narrowing for manual dispatch."
msgstr "**Braiteoir `__ALL__` sa `whitelist` ionchur ionchuir** (cás-íogair). MÓR an loighic diff a skipped agus MUST whitelist folamh astaítear, a imscaradh gach rud i raon feidhme an sreabhadh oibre. Is é seo an rogha follasach amach ó diff caolú do sheoladh láimhe."

