# libretranslate
msgid "**Single key, per-app subdomains:** one hidden service serves every app at `<app>.<node>.onion`, Host-routed by OpenResty."
msgstr "**eochair amháin, subdomains per-app:** seirbhís amháin i bhfolach feidhmíonn gach app ag `<app>.<node>.onion`, Host-routed ag OpenResty."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Single key, per-app subdomains:** one hidden service serves every app at ``<app>.<node>.onion``, Host-routed by OpenResty."
msgstr "**eochair amháin, subdomains per-app:** seirbhís amháin i bhfolach feidhmíonn gach app ag ``<app>.<node>.onion``, Host-routed ag OpenResty."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Single logic for all roles**"
msgstr "**loighic Aonair do gach ról**"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Single points of truth, enforced by lint.** The new *sys-lint* role pins the GitHub-release lint tools. Every mount target has one spot in *meta/volumes.yml* and container paths are derived from it, *default.env* is the enforced source of the primary domain, *container_backup* is rejected where no volume exists, and role credentials live at *meta/secrets.yml*. Linters no longer read gitignored build output, comments are checked in every file rather than only changed ones, and every shipped script requires a mirrored unit test."
msgstr "**Pointí aonair na fírinne, i bhfeidhm ag lint.** An nua *riachtanais uisce: measartha* ról bioráin an GitHub-scaoileadh uirlisí lint. Tá gach sprioc mount ar aon láthair i *meta/volumes.yml* agus cosáin coimeádán a dhíorthaítear uaidh, *default.env* gurb é foinse fhorfheidhmiúcháin an phríomhfhearainn é, *container_backup* diúltaíodh nuair nach bhfuil aon toirt ann, agus ról dintiúir beo ag *meta/secrets.yml*. Linters a thuilleadh a léamh aschur a thógáil gitignored, tuairimí a sheiceáil i ngach comhad seachas na cinn a athrú amháin, agus éilíonn gach script shipped tástáil aonad scáthánaithe."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Single sign-on across protocols and domains.** Keycloak imports a SAML client for every app that asks for one; SuiteCRM authenticates against it via SAML instead of a proxy, and Shopware provisions its admin through AdminOpenAuth with the front and back channel split. Sessions are shared across app domains, the issuer is pinned to the canonical OIDC URL, each consumer's redirect scheme resolves on its own side, and the logout sweep runs where the visitor is looking. Directory users are read through one lookup so seeding cannot diverge."
msgstr "**Sínigh aonair ar fud prótacail agus fearainn.** Keycloak allmhairí cliant SAML do gach app a iarrann le haghaidh ceann amháin; SuiteCRM fhíordheimhnithe ina choinne trí SAML in ionad seachvótálaí, agus forálacha Shopware a admin tríd an Riarachán OpenAuth leis an tosaigh agus ar ais cainéal scoilt. Tá seisiúin roinnte ar fud réimsí app, tá an t-eisitheoir pinned leis an URL Canonical OIDC, réitíonn gach scéim atreorú tomhaltóirí ar a thaobh féin, agus ritheann an sweep logout áit a bhfuil an cuairteoir ag lorg. Úsáideoirí Eolaire a léamh trí lookup amháin mar sin ní féidir síolú éagsúla."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Single sign-on:** When Keycloak is deployed, an OAuth2 proxy sits in front of the gateway and admits only members of the administrator group of this application."
msgstr "**Sínigh aonair ar:** Nuair a úsáidtear Keycloak, an OAuth2 suíonn seachvótálaí os comhair na tairsí agus ní cheadaíonn sé ach baill de ghrúpa an riarthóra den iarratas seo."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Single-Site path**: the claim MUST contain `/roles/web-app-wordpress/<role>` entries. The highest-privilege role across all matches wins (`administrator > editor > author > contributor > subscriber`). When no entry matches, the user's role is set to `subscriber` as a deterministic fallback."
msgstr "**cosán Aonair-Site**: go bhfuil an t-éileamh MUST `/roles/web-app-wordpress/<role>` iontrálacha. An ról is airde-privilege ar fud gach bua cluichí (`administrator > editor > author > contributor > subscriber`). Nuair a oireann aon iontráil, tá ról an úsáideora leagtha chun `subscriber` mar fallback cinntitheach."

# libretranslate
