# libretranslate
msgid "**Tor = compose sidecar**, `network_mode: host`, keys on a named volume, restored from the vaulted mint **before** Tor starts. Backup via `svc-bkp-container-2-local`."
msgstr "**Tor = a chumadh sidecar**, `network_mode: host`, eochracha ar toirt ainmnithe, ar ais ón mint boghtach **roimh** Tosaíonn Tor. Cúltaca via `svc-bkp-container-2-local`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Tor as a first-class deployment axis.** The new *svc-net-tor* role routes onion names through Tor via DNS instead of per-app proxies, offers a chutney flavor for private-net test deployments, and ties its dnsmasq listener to ownership rather than the deploy mode. Applications follow: server-side OIDC discovery and token exchange reach plaintext onion issuers through the SOCKS proxy (WordPress, Joomla, PeerTube, Mobilizon, EspoCRM, Nextcloud), session cookies drop the *Secure* flag where an onion cannot carry it (Taiga, Pixelfed, Joomla), and mail authenticates on the submission port the onion relay actually serves. The deploy matrix gained a tor axis with an onion marker plus enforced and exclusive modes, and lint now requires the onion in every variant. See the [svc-net-tor](roles/svc-net-tor/README.md) README."
msgstr "**Tor mar ais imscaradh den chéad scoth.** An nua *svc-líon-tor* róil bealaí ainmneacha oinniún trí Tor via DNS in ionad proxies per-app, Cuireann blas chutney le haghaidh imscaradh tástála príobháideacha-líon, agus ceangail a éisteoir dnsmasq úinéireacht seachas an modh imscaradh. Iarratais a leanúint: freastalaí taobh OIDC fionnachtain agus malartú comharthaíochta a bhaint amach eisitheoirí oinniún plaintext tríd an seachfhreastalaí SOCKS (WordPress, Joomla, PeerTube, Mobilizon, EspoCRM, Nextcloud), fianáin seisiún titim an *Amharc ar gach eolas* bratach nach féidir oinniún a iompar (cliceáil grianghraf a mhéadú), agus fíordheimhnithe phost ar an gcalafort aighneacht feidhmíonn an Relay oinniún iarbhír. Fuair an maitrís imscaradh ais tor le marcóir oinniún móide modhanna forfheidhmiú agus eisiach, agus éilíonn lint anois an oinniún i ngach leagan. Féach an [svc-líon-tor](roles/svc-net-tor/README.md) README."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Tor image built via `files/Dockerfile`** from a pinned Debian `tor` package (`deb.debian.org`; no sandbox-allowlist change). `deb.torproject.org` = documented alternative requiring an allowlist entry."
msgstr "**íomhá Tor tógtha via `files/Dockerfile`** ó Debian pinned `tor` pacáiste pacáiste (`deb.debian.org`; aon athrú bosca gainimh-liúntas). `deb.torproject.org` = rogha doiciméadaithe a éilíonn iontráil ar an liosta."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Tor-ready:** ``svc-net-tor`` depends on this service, so onion deployments serve all whitelisted third-party assets from the onion itself."
msgstr "**Ró-réidh:** ``svc-net-tor`` ag brath ar an tseirbhís seo, mar sin freastal ar imscaradh oinniún gach sócmhainní tríú páirtí whitelisted ón oinniún féin."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Tor-ready:** `svc-net-tor` depends on this service, so onion deployments serve all whitelisted third-party assets from the onion itself."
msgstr "**Ró-réidh:** `svc-net-tor` ag brath ar an tseirbhís seo, mar sin freastal ar imscaradh oinniún gach sócmhainní tríú páirtí whitelisted ón oinniún féin."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Traefik migration / edge HA.** v1 keeps openresty as the swarm edge (pinned to manager) to preserve the `sys-front-inj-*` Lua body-rewriting pipeline unchanged. Migrating to Traefik for true multi-replica edge HA is a follow-up requirement and is gated on porting the body_filter.lua injection logic (CSP-meta stripping + head/body snippet injection for Matomo / CSS / JavaScript / Dashboard / Logout) to a Traefik Yaegi plugin OR introducing a Traefik → openresty chain. Without one of those, switching the edge to Traefik would silently drop the frontend-injection pipeline."
msgstr "**Traefik imirce / imeall HA.** v v v v v v1 coimeádann openresty mar an imeall Swarm (pinned le bainisteoir) a chaomhnú an `sys-front-inj-*` Lua comhlacht-athscríobh píblíne gan athrú. Is riachtanas leantach é Migrating go Traefik le haghaidh HA imeall fíor il-replica agus tá sé gated ar an gcalafortáil body_filter.lua loighic instealladh (CSP-meta stripping + ceann / instealladh snippet comhlacht do Matomo / CSS / JavaScript / Dashboard / Logout) le Traefik Yaegi breiseán NÓ a thabhairt isteach Traefik → slabhra oscailte. Gan ceann de na, bheadh athrú ar an imeall go Traefik titim go ciúin ar an phíblíne tosaigh-instealladh."

