# libretranslate
msgid "**Trusted-Header SSO Bridge:**"
msgstr "**Iontaofa-Ceannaire SSO Droichead:**"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Trusted-Header SSO Bridge:**   When the oauth2-proxy SSO flavor is active, Snipe-IT's native `loginViaRemoteUser()` is enabled via the `Setting` model (`login_remote_user_enabled`, `login_remote_user_header_name = HTTP_X_FORWARDED_PREFERRED_USERNAME`). nginx gates `/login` through oauth2-proxy/Keycloak and injects the verified `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username` header, which Snipe-IT matches against `users.username` (the user must pre-exist and be activated — sync them via LDAP) to mint a native `snipeit_session`. Visitors without a matching activated user silently fall through to the normal login form (no error). The password/LDAP login form stays available as a fallback (`login_common_disabled = 0`), and the in-app logout is redirected to the central OIDC end-session URL."
msgstr "**Iontaofa-Ceannaire SSO Droichead:** Nuair a bheidh an oauth2-proxy SSO blas gníomhach, Snipe-IT dúchais `loginViaRemoteUser()` ar chumas tríd an `Setting` múnla múnla múnla (`login_remote_user_enabled`, `login_remote_user_header_name = HTTP_X_FORWARDED_PREFERRED_USERNAME`). geataí nginx `/login` trí údail2-proxy/Keycloak agus instealladh an fíoraithe `X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username` header, a oireann Snipe-IT i gcoinne `users.username` (ní mór don úsáideoir réamh-mheas agus a ghníomhachtú — iad a sync trí LDAP) a mint dúchais `snipeit_session`. Cuairteoirí gan meaitseáil úsáideoir gníomhachtaithe titim go ciúin tríd an bhfoirm logáil isteach gnáth (aon earráid). Fanann an focal faire / LDAP foirm logáil isteach ar fáil mar fallback (`login_common_disabled = 0`), agus tá an logout in-app atreorú chuig an URL deiridh OIDC lárnach."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Trusted-header SSO bridge:** Establishes the owner session from the oauth2-proxy identity (see below)."
msgstr "**Iontaofa-ceannaire SSO droichead:** Bunaíonn sé seisiún an úinéara ón auth2-proxy féiniúlacht (féach thíos:)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Two-layer tool policy:** Home Assistant offers no per-tool filter of its own; enabling the Assist API always publishes its actuating intents (`HassTurnOn`, `HassTurnOff`, the todo-list writers). The role names those in `tools.mutating`, and `mutating_tools_enabled: false` withholds them from every client's include list, so an agent is offered the read tools only. Entity exposure bounds the rest: the role exposes no entity to Assist, and making the hub actuate anything is an explicit operator step per entity."
msgstr "**Beartas uirlis Dhá-ciseal:** Baile Cúntóir Cuireann aon scagaire in aghaidh an-ol dá chuid féin; ar chumas an API Cúnamh a fhoilsiú i gcónaí a intinn actuating (`HassTurnOn`, `HassTurnOff`, na scríbhneoirí todo-liosta). Ainmneacha an ról siúd i `tools.mutating`, agus `mutating_tools_enabled: false` choimeád siar iad ó gach cliant ar áireamh liosta, mar sin tá gníomhaire ar fáil na huirlisí a léamh amháin. Entity neamhchosaint bounds an chuid eile: an ról nochtann aon eintiteas chun cabhrú, agus a dhéanamh ar an mol actuate aon rud is céim oibreoir follasach in aghaidh an eintitis."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Two-layer tool policy:** Home Assistant offers no per-tool filter of its own; enabling the Assist API always publishes its actuating intents (``HassTurnOn``, ``HassTurnOff``, the todo-list writers). The role names those in ``tools.mutating``, and ``mutating_tools_enabled: false`` withholds them from every client’s include list, so an agent is offered the read tools only. Entity exposure bounds the rest: the role exposes no entity to Assist, and making the hub actuate anything is an explicit operator step per entity."
msgstr "**Beartas uirlis Dhá-ciseal:** Baile Cúntóir Cuireann aon scagaire in aghaidh an-ol dá chuid féin; ar chumas an API Cúnamh a fhoilsiú i gcónaí a intinn actuating (``HassTurnOn``, ``HassTurnOff``, na scríbhneoirí todo-liosta). Ainmneacha an ról siúd i ``tools.mutating``, agus ``mutating_tools_enabled: false`` choimeád siar iad ó gach cliant ar áireamh liosta, mar sin tá gníomhaire ar fáil na huirlisí a léamh amháin. Entity neamhchosaint bounds an chuid eile: an ról nochtann aon eintiteas chun cabhrú, agus a dhéanamh ar an mol actuate aon rud is céim oibreoir follasach in aghaidh an eintitis."

