# libretranslate
msgid "**Unified schema, native mechanism preserved.** Every addon entry uses one schema across all roles. The app-native term is retained only as the `mechanism` field (`addon`, `plugin`, `mu_plugin`, `extension`, `module`, `bridge`). Tasks keep using the upstream installer for that mechanism; only the *declaration* is unified. App-specific runtime configuration is carried under an opaque `config:` mapping that only the owning role's tasks interpret, so the surrounding schema stays uniform while each addon keeps its full per-addon payload. Each `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` is therefore the single source for both the declaration and the runtime config: where a role previously split the enable/disable declaration from a per-addon config payload (e.g. Nextcloud's `vars/plugins/`), both move into that addon's `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` file and the superseded per-addon config files are deleted by the migration."
msgstr "**scéimre aontaithe, meicníocht dúchais leasaithe.** Úsáideann gach iontráil addon scéimre amháin ar fud gach ról. Coinnítear an téarma ainmniúcháin ach amháin mar an `mechanism` réimse réimse réimse (`addon`, `plugin`, `mu_plugin`, `extension`, `module`, `bridge`). Coinníonn tascanna ag baint úsáide as an suiteálaí réamhtheachtach don mheicníocht sin; ach an *dearbhú* Tá aontaithe. Tá cumraíocht runtime App-sonrach i gcrích faoi teimhneach `config:` mapáil go ach an ról féin tascanna a léirmhíniú, mar sin fanann an scéimre máguaird aonfhoirmeach agus coimeádann gach addon a lán per-addon payload. Gach ceann `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` dá bhrí sin, is é an fhoinse aonair don dearbhú agus don choigist runtime araon: i gcás ina roinneann ról an dearbhú ar chumas/díchumas ó phá-ualach per-addon config (e.g. Nextcloud ar `vars/plugins/`), an dá bogadh isteach go addon ar `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` comhad agus na comhaid in aghaidh an-addon config scriosadh ag an imirce."

