# libretranslate
msgid "**Update PR behaviour.** The scheduled update workflow MAY open or refresh an update pull request for addon version bumps and newly discovered catalog entries. Addon entries *discovered by update automation* MUST be added disabled by default (`enabled: false`) and MUST NOT silently enable new runtime behaviour. This hard-off default applies to auto-discovered addons only; it does NOT override the auto-enable-with-partner rule for deliberately-wired integrations (Decision 5)."
msgstr "**Nuashonraigh iompar PR.** An sreabhadh oibre cothrom le dáta sceidealta MAY oscailte nó athnuachan iarratas tarraingt cothrom le dáta do bumps leagan addon agus iontrálacha catalóg nua-aimsithe. iontrálacha breise *fuair sé amach ag uathoibriú cothrom le dáta* MUST a chur leis faoi mhíchumas de réir réamhshocraithe (`enabled: false`) agus NÍ MÓR a chumas go ciúin iompar runtime nua. Tá feidhm ag an mainneachtain crua-uaire seo maidir le breiseáin auto-clúdaithe amháin; NACH sáraíonn sé an riail uathoibríoch-inúsáidte-le-partner do chomhtháthú d'aon ghnó-sreangaithe (Cinneadh an Chinnidh 5)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Use Artisan Commands:** Pixelfed is built on Laravel, so you'll use Laravel's Artisan CLI for user management. Here are some common tasks:"
msgstr "**Bain úsáid as Orduithe Artisan:** Pixelfed tógtha ar Laravel, mar sin beidh tú ag úsáid CLI Artisan Laravel do bhainistíocht úsáideoirí. Seo roinnt tascanna coitianta:"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Use Encrypted Systems** You SHOULD run Infinito.Nexus only on systems with full disk encryption. For example, Linux distributions such as [Manjaro](https://manjaro.org/) (based on ArchLinux) with desktop environments like [GNOME](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/GNOME) provide excellent security. (Learn more about [disk encryption](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) on Wikipedia.)"
msgstr "**Úsáid Córais Criptithe** Tá tú ag rith SHOULD Infinito.Nexus ach amháin ar chórais le criptithe diosca iomlán. Mar shampla, dáiltí Linux nós [cliceáil grianghraf a mhéadú](https://manjaro.org/) (bunaithe ar ArchLinux) le timpeallachtaí deisce cosúil [Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/GNOME) slándáil den scoth a chur ar fáil. (Foghlaim tuilleadh faoi [criptithe diosca](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) ar Vicipéid.)"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Use a Password Manager** You SHOULD use a reliable password manager such as [KeePassXC](https://keepassxc.org/) 🔐. (Learn more about [password managers](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Password_manager) on Wikipedia.) KeePassXC is available for both smartphones and PCs, and it can automatically generate strong, random passwords."
msgstr "**Bain úsáid as Bainisteoir Pasfhocal** Úsáideann tú SHOULD bainisteoir phasfhocal iontaofa, mar shampla [Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí](https://keepassxc.org/) Oifig na Gaeilge (Foghlaim tuilleadh faoi [bainisteoirí phasfhocal](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Password_manager) ar Vicipéid.) Tá KeePassXC ar fáil don dá smartphones agus ríomhairí pearsanta, agus is féidir é a ghiniúint go huathoibríoch focal faire láidir, randamach."

