# libretranslate
msgid "**V1 (SSO):** The oauth2-proxy edge gate redirects all requests to Keycloak. ``files/hooks.js`` reads the trusted ``Remote-Email`` header openresty sets once the gate passes and auto-provisions/logs in the matching n8n user (role ``global:member``, or the pre-existing owner for ``users.administrator.email``), so every Keycloak user — administrator and regular users alike — lands directly on n8n’s own workflow surface with no second, n8n-local login step."
msgstr "**VV VV1 (SSO):** Níl an Tweet seo ar fáil2Redirects geata imeall -proxy gach iarratas ar Keycloak. ``files/hooks.js`` léann an muinín ``Remote-Email`` Leagann openresty header nuair a théann an geata agus auto-provisions / logs sa meaitseáil n8n úsáideoir (Ról na Gaeilge ``global:member``, nó an t-úinéir atá ann cheana féin le haghaidh ``users.administrator.email``), mar sin gach úsáideoir Keycloak - riarthóir agus úsáideoirí rialta araon - tailte díreach ar n8n dromchla sreabhadh oibre féin gan aon dara, n8n-áit logála isteach céim."

