# libretranslate
msgid "**Why this matters:** Loops can hide destructive operations (for example `for f in $(ls); do rm \"$f\"; done`) behind a single approval step. The deny rule converts a rule violation into a hard failure, so the agent receives concrete feedback and refactors to the flat form."
msgstr "**Cén fáth na nithe seo:** Is féidir le loopaí oibríochtaí millteach a cheilt (mar shampla `for f in $(ls); do rm \"$f\"; done`) taobh thiar de chéim ceadaithe amháin. Athraíonn an riail dhiúltach sárú riail i teip chrua, mar sin faigheann an gníomhaire aiseolas nithiúil agus athfhachtóirí ar an bhfoirm árasán."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Why this set?** [Debian](https://www.debian.org) is preferred for stable community-operated servers because it offers long-term support without commercial backing requirements. [Fedora](https://fedoraproject.org) and [CentOS](https://www.centos.org) are required to ensure compatibility with [Red Hat Enterprise Linux (RHEL)](https://www.redhat.com/en/technologies/linux-platforms/enterprise-linux) environments. Red Hat support MUST be guaranteed because enterprise customers operate under SLA and security compliance requirements that mandate a RHEL-compatible platform, including certified package versions, SELinux enforcement, and vendor-backed security advisories. [Arch Linux](https://archlinux.org) is included to catch integration problems with newer software versions early in the development cycle before they reach stable distributions."
msgstr "**Cén fáth a leagtar seo?** [De réir a chéile](https://www.debian.org) Is fearr le haghaidh freastalaithe cobhsaí pobail-oibriú toisc go dtugann sé tacaíocht fadtéarmach gan riachtanais tacaíocht tráchtála. [tréimhse saoil: ilbhliantúil](https://fedoraproject.org) agus [Féachaint ar Fholúntais](https://www.centos.org) ag teastáil chun comhoiriúnacht a áirithiú le [cliceáil grianghraf a mhéadú (SEIRBHÍSÍ)](https://www.redhat.com/en/technologies/linux-platforms/enterprise-linux) timpeallachtaí. Red Hat tacaíocht MUST a ráthú mar a oibríonn custaiméirí fiontraíochta faoi CLS agus ceanglais comhlíonta slándála a sainordú ardán RHEL-compatible, lena n-áirítear leaganacha pacáiste deimhnithe, forfheidhmiú SELinux, agus comhairleoirí slándála díoltóir-tacaíocht. [Ar an láithreán gréasáin](https://archlinux.org) san áireamh chun fadhbanna comhtháthú le leaganacha bogearraí níos nuaí a ghabháil go luath sa timthriall forbartha sula sroicheann siad dáiltí cobhsaí."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Why:** Friendica currently authenticates in two steps: oauth2-proxy gates the vhost (Keycloak-Authorization-Code-Flow, 2FA-enforceable), then the user must fill Friendica's own `/login` form because stock Friendica has **no header-trusted auto-login** — Owa.php / OAuth/Token.php only read `HTTP_AUTHORIZATION` for API endpoints, never for the web session. The ldapauth addon stays enabled solely as a first-login bootstrap that materialises the `friendica.user` row from openldap."
msgstr "**Cén fáth:** Friendica fhíordheimhnithe faoi láthair i dhá chéim: oauth2-proxy geataí an vhost (Keycloak-Údarú-Code-Flow, 2FA- infheidhmithe), ansin caithfidh an t-úsáideoir a líonadh Friendica féin `/login` foirm mar gheall ar stoc Friendica **aon header-iontaofa auto-login** — — — — Owa.php / Baile OAuth/Token.php ach amháin a léamh `HTTP_AUTHORIZATION` do endpoints API, riamh don seisiún gréasáin. Fanann an addon ldapauth ar chumas amháin mar chéad-login buataisítrap go materialises an `friendica.user` as a chéile ó openldap."

