# libretranslate
msgid "**[Hermes Agent](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/)** (Nous Research, MIT). Self-hostable with `local`, `Docker`, `SSH`, `Singularity`, `Modal` backends plus container hardening. Ships an official web dashboard with **self-hosted OIDC** auth (fits the platform SSO), delegates work through **isolated subagents**, has persistent memory, scheduling, vision web browsing, and MCP support (**client since v0.2.0, server since v0.6.0**). Deployed as `web-app-hermes`."
msgstr "**[Hermes Gníomhaire](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/)** (Taighde Nous, MIT). Féin-óstáil le `local`, `Docker`, `SSH`, `Singularity`, `Modal` backends móide cruaite coimeádán. Longa ar Painéal na nIonstraimí gréasáin oifigiúil le **OIDC féin-óstáil** cineál gas: in airde (oireann an ardán SSO), toscairí ag obair trí **subagents iargúlta**, Tá cuimhne leanúnach, sceidealú, brabhsála gréasáin fís, agus tacaíocht MCP (**cliant ó v0.2.0, freastalaí ó v0.6.0**). Imlonnú mar `web-app-hermes`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**[OpenClaw](https://openclaw.ai/)** (open-source, npm/pnpm). Built-in Gateway web dashboard (default port `18789`) plus CLI/TUI, browser control, filesystem sandbox, persistent memory, skills/plugins, and native MCP (`@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`, both client and server). Deployed as `web-app-openclaw`."
msgstr "**[Oscailt an dlí](https://openclaw.ai/)** (foinse oscailte, npm/pnpm). Tógtha-i Painéal na nIonstraimí gréasáin Geata (cineál gas: in airde `18789`) móide CLI/TUI, rialú bhrabhsálaí, bosca gainimh córas comhaid, cuimhne leanúnach, scileanna / plocóidí, agus MCP dúchais (`@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`, cliant agus freastalaí araon). Imlonnú mar `web-app-openclaw`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**`--full-cycle` (async update pass).** When set (or `full_cycle=true` on `make compose-deploy`), the wrapper runs each round's deploy TWICE: first the regular sync pass, then immediately a second pass with `-e ASYNC_ENABLED=true` overriding the host_var, against the SAME variant's folder, BEFORE moving to the next round. The two passes are therefore always co-located on the same host state; the async pass never accidentally targets a host that a previous round's variant left behind."
msgstr "**`--full-cycle` (pas cothrom le dáta async).** Nuair a leagtar (nó `full_cycle=true` ar aghaidh `make compose-deploy`), Ritheann an fillteán gach babhta TWICE imscaradh: an chéad pas info rialta, ansin láithreach an dara pas le `-e ASYNC_ENABLED=true` overriding an host_var, i gcoinne an leagan SAME ar fillteán, BEFORE bogadh go dtí an chéad bhabhta eile. Dá bhrí sin, tá an dá Gabhann comhlonnaithe i gcónaí ar an stát óstach céanna; an pas async spriocanna thaisme óstach go bhfuil leagan bhabhta roimhe fágtha taobh thiar de."

