msgid "**`deny`** (precedence 1): structurally destructive shapes are blocked outright, even when sandboxed. Covers shell loops (`for`/`while`/`until`), cross-repo `git -C *`, force-push/reset/clean, `rm -rf*`, `sudo*`, privileged `gh` verbs (`secret`/`ssh-key`/`gpg-key`/`variable`/`extension`/`workflow enable`/`workflow disable`/`repo delete`/`pr merge`/`issue transfer`), and mutating `gh api` verbs (`DELETE`/`PUT`, secrets/keys/collaborators/merge paths)."
msgstr "**`deny`** (roimh ré 1): cruthanna struchtúrtha millteach atá bac ar dheis, fiú nuair a sandboxed. Clúdaigh lúba bhlaosc (`for`/ Baile`while`/ Baile`until`), tras-repo `git -C *`, force-push/reset/clean, `rm -rf*`, `sudo*`, phribhléid `gh` briathra (`secret`/ Baile`ssh-key`/ Baile`gpg-key`/ Baile`variable`/ Baile`extension`/ Baile`workflow enable`/ Baile`workflow disable`/ Baile`repo delete`/ Baile`pr merge`/ Baile`issue transfer`), agus mutating `gh api` briathra (`DELETE`/ Baile`PUT`, secrets/keys/collaborators/merge cosáin)."

