# libretranslate
msgid "**`docker exec` is FORBIDDEN. ⛔** You MUST NEVER invoke `docker exec` (nor nested `docker exec … docker exec …` into the DiD stack) directly. Always reach the live stack through `make` targets (e.g. `make compose-exec`, or the role-specific targets the `Makefile` exposes). If no `make` target covers what you need, ask the operator instead of falling back to raw `docker exec`."
msgstr "**`docker exec` Tá FORBIDDEN.** MUST tú NEVER agairt `docker exec` (ná neadaithe `docker exec … docker exec …` isteach sa Stack DiD) go díreach. A bhaint amach i gcónaí ar an chairn beo trí `make` spriocanna (e.g. `make compose-exec`, nó an ról-shonrach spriocanna na `Makefile` a nochtadh). `make` Clúdaíonn sprioc cad is gá duit, a iarraidh ar an t-oibreoir in ionad titim ar ais go dtí amh `docker exec`."

