msgid "**`hugo` reports template execution errors**: the theme's templates are incompatible with the bundled Hugo binary. Bump `services.hugo.builder_version` (e.g. to a newer `exts-<version>` tag) or pin the source repo to a tag known to build with the current Hugo."
msgstr "**`hugo` tuarascálacha earráidí fhorghníomhú teimpléad**: Tá teimpléid an téama ar neamhréir leis an dénártha Hugo cuachta. Bumpord `services.hugo.builder_version` (e.g. chuig níos nuaí `exts-<version>` tag tag) nó bioráin an repo foinse le tag ar eolas a thógáil leis an Hugo reatha."

# libretranslate
msgid "**`hugo` reports unknown content / module errors**: the upstream repository moved a directory or a Hugo Module. Pin to a known-good tag in `source_version`."
msgstr "**`hugo` tuarascálacha ábhar anaithnid / earráidí modúl**: bhog an stór upstream eolaire nó Modúl Hugo. PIN le tag aitheanta-mhaith i `source_version`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**`images/`** opts into NFS (`nfs: true` in the `compose_volumes` call from `templates/compose.yml.j2`). The volume is shared across all swarm nodes so the MediaWiki application service can be rescheduled freely."
msgstr "**`images/`** roghnaigh isteach NFS (`nfs: true` sa `compose_volumes` glaoch ó `templates/compose.yml.j2`). Tá an toirt roinnte ar fud na nóid swarm ionas gur féidir leis an tseirbhís iarratais MediaWiki a athsceidealú faoi shaoirse."

# libretranslate
msgid "**`linux.sh`**. installs the CA into the Linux system trust store"
msgstr "**`linux.sh`**. installs an CA isteach sa siopa muinín córas Linux"

# libretranslate
msgid "**`local.sh` — fully local, no external GitHub.** Checks the runner containers are healthy and the DooD socket works, then `container cp`s the repo into a runner, **builds the Infinito image locally**, and deploys `web-app-dashboard` (all other services disabled) inside a **sealed, throwaway Docker daemon** that shares the runner's network namespace. The sandbox is torn down on exit, so the host stack is never touched and **no GitHub/GHCR access is required**. On the async test pass the heavy deploy is skipped (it is validated once on the sync pass)."
msgstr "**`local.sh` — go hiomlán áitiúil, gan aon GitHub seachtrach.** Tá na coimeádáin rádala sláintiúil agus oibríonn soicéad DooD, ansin `container cp`s an repo isteach sa dara háit, **Tógann an íomhá Infinito go háitiúil**, agus imscaradh `web-app-dashboard` (gach seirbhís eile faoi mhíchumas) taobh istigh de **séalaithe, throwaway Docker daemon** go scaireanna an dara háit ar líonra ainmspás. Tá an bosca gainimh torn síos ar an slí amach, mar sin tá an Stack óstach riamh i dteagmháil léi agus **Níl gá le rochtain GitHub / GHCR**. Ar an tástáil async pas a fháil go bhfuil an imscaradh trom skipped (tá sé bailíochtaithe uair amháin ar an pas info)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**`mechanism: bridge`** marks an addon that *is* a network/appservice bridge to an external system (e.g. a Matrix `mautrix` bridge to WhatsApp)."
msgstr "**`mechanism: bridge`** marcanna addon go *Is maith liom* droichead líonra / seirbhísí chuig córas seachtrach (e.g. Maitrís `mautrix` droichead go WhatsApp)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**`no_remote_surface` (24):** `svc-ai-ollama`, `svc-ai-robot`, `web-app-chess`, `web-app-dashboard`, `web-app-docs`, `web-app-fediwall`, `web-app-hugo`, `web-app-littlejs`, `web-app-mig`, `web-app-mini-qr`, `web-app-navigator`, `web-app-roulette-wheel`, `web-opt-rdr-domains`, `web-opt-rdr-www`, `web-svc-asset`, `web-svc-cdn`, `web-svc-coturn`, `web-svc-css`, `web-svc-file`, `web-svc-html`, `web-svc-legal`, `web-svc-logout`, `web-svc-mirror`, `web-svc-simpleicons`. These roles have no independently useful authenticated remote action contract at the pinned implementation. Static published content MAY later be consumed through one owning application's bounded `resource_readonly` adapter, but a new MCP sidecar that merely reimplements a static site's behavior does not count as integration. Model tool calling in Ollama does not by itself make Ollama an MCP client or server."
msgstr "**`no_remote_surface` (24):** `svc-ai-ollama`, `svc-ai-robot`, `web-app-chess`, `web-app-dashboard`, `web-app-docs`, `web-app-fediwall`, `web-app-hugo`, `web-app-littlejs`, `web-app-mig`, `web-app-mini-qr`, `web-app-navigator`, `web-app-roulette-wheel`, `web-opt-rdr-domains`, `web-opt-rdr-www`, `web-svc-asset`, `web-svc-cdn`, `web-svc-coturn`, `web-svc-css`, `web-svc-file`, `web-svc-html`, `web-svc-legal`, `web-svc-logout`, `web-svc-mirror`, `web-svc-simpleicons`. Níl aon chonradh gníomhaíochta iargúlta fíordheimhnithe go neamhspleách ag an gcur chun feidhme pinned ag na róil seo. Ábhar foilsithe statach MAY a chaitheamh níos déanaí trí iarratas amháin ar úinéireacht teoranta `resource_readonly` adapter, ach nach bhfuil carr nua MCP go reimplements ach iompar láithreán statach ar áireamh mar chomhtháthú. Ní uirlis múnla glaoch i Ollama a dhéanamh leis féin Ollama an cliant MCP nó freastalaí."

# libretranslate
msgid "**`privileged_control_plane` (25):** `svc-bkp-local-2-device`, `svc-bkp-nfs-2-local`, `svc-bkp-remote-2-local`, `svc-bkp-secrets-2-local`, `svc-bkp-volume-2-local`, `svc-dns-unbound`, `svc-net-firewall`, `svc-net-tor`, `svc-net-wireguard-core`, `svc-net-wireguard-firewalled`, `svc-net-wireguard-plain`, `svc-opt-keyboard-color`, `svc-opt-ssd-hdd`, `svc-opt-swapfile`, `svc-prx-openresty`, `svc-registry-cache`, `svc-registry-docker`, `svc-runner`, `svc-storage-nfs-client`, `svc-storage-nfs-server`, `svc-swarm-manager`, `svc-swarm-node`, `svc-virt-kata`, `update`, `web-app-openbao`. These roles can recover secrets, alter routing or host state, run code, change deployment state, or reach storage/control-plane sockets; they require a separate audited operations gateway and human approval rather than general-purpose application MCP."
msgstr "**`privileged_control_plane` (25):** `svc-bkp-local-2-device`, `svc-bkp-nfs-2-local`, `svc-bkp-remote-2-local`, `svc-bkp-secrets-2-local`, `svc-bkp-volume-2-local`, `svc-dns-unbound`, `svc-net-firewall`, `svc-net-tor`, `svc-net-wireguard-core`, `svc-net-wireguard-firewalled`, `svc-net-wireguard-plain`, `svc-opt-keyboard-color`, `svc-opt-ssd-hdd`, `svc-opt-swapfile`, `svc-prx-openresty`, `svc-registry-cache`, `svc-registry-docker`, `svc-runner`, `svc-storage-nfs-client`, `svc-storage-nfs-server`, `svc-swarm-manager`, `svc-swarm-node`, `svc-virt-kata`, `update`, `web-app-openbao`. Is féidir leis na róil seo rúin a ghnóthú, athrú a dhéanamh ar ródú nó ar stát óstach, cód reáchtáil, stát imlonnaithe athraithe, nó soicéid stórála / rialaithe-phlána a bhaint amach; éilíonn siad geata oibríochtaí iniúchta ar leith agus ceadú an duine seachas iarratas ginearálta MCP."

