# libretranslate
msgid "**`svc-ai-litellm` is headless and internal-only; the admin UI is a separate optional `web-app-litellm` role.** The gateway itself exposes no public domain and no LiteLLM admin UI. A distinct `web-app-litellm` role serves the admin interface behind the proxy with SSO, following the standard `web-app-*` contract. Coupling is asymmetric: `web-app-litellm` REQUIRES the gateway (deploying it forces `svc-ai-litellm` to `enabled: true` + `shared: true`), while `svc-ai-litellm` only OPTIONALLY references the UI (via `group_names`) and runs fine without it."
msgstr "**`svc-ai-litellm` Tá headless agus inmheánach-amháin; Is é an Chomhéadain admin roghnach ar leith `web-app-litellm` ról.** An geata féin nochtann aon bhfearann poiblí agus aon Chomhéadain LiteLLM admin. Ar leith `web-app-litellm` feidhmíonn ról an comhéadan admin taobh thiar den seachfhreastalaí le SSO, tar éis an caighdeán `web-app-*` conradh. Tá cúpláil asymmetric: `web-app-litellm` CEANGLAIS AN gheata (imscaradh sé fórsaí `svc-ai-litellm` go dtí `enabled: true` + + + + `shared: true`), cé `svc-ai-litellm` ach tagairtí OPTIONALLY an Chomhéadain (via via via via `group_names`) agus ritheann fíneáil gan é."

# libretranslate
msgid "**`svc-ai-ollama` stays the default local backend behind the gateway.** No new model-serving stack replaces it; it is registered as a `model_list` entry."
msgstr "**`svc-ai-ollama` Fanann an cúlú áitiúil réamhshocraithe taobh thiar den tairseach.** Uimh nua samhail-lorg Stack ionad sé; tá sé cláraithe mar `model_list` iontráil."

# libretranslate
msgid "**`svc-ai-robot` deploys Hermes in embodied mode on a dedicated device.** It reuses the `web-app-hermes` agent from [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) and configures it for privileged hardware access. The trust boundary is the device ([032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) Decision #12), so no microVM wraps the agent here."
msgstr "**`svc-ai-robot` imscaradh Hermes i mód chorprófar ar ghléas tiomnaithe.** Reuses sé an `web-app-hermes` gníomhaire ó [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) agus cumrú sé le haghaidh rochtain crua-earraí phribhléid. Is é an teorainn iontaobhais an gléas ([032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md) Cinneadh #12), mar sin ní wraps aon microVM an gníomhaire anseo."

