# libretranslate
msgid "**dual-family providers** — the one real remaining design gap. On a CI onion node, tor-enabled providers (e.g. mastodon) are onion-exclusive: their domain list contains only the `.onion` canonical, no clearnet sibling. The family-alignment resolver (`utils/tls_common.py:align_domain_to_consumer`, wired into `plugins/lookup/tls.py`) correctly bails in that case, so a clearnet-pinned consumer still receives an onion URL it can neither resolve nor reach. First hard evidence: `web-app-fediwall` variant 2 (tor=false) renders `microblog.<onion>` into `wall-config.json.servers`; the clearnet browser (no SOCKS) times out waiting for mastodon wall items (`test-walls-surface-posts.js:24`, deterministic across retries). The same class is expected to keep `web-app-bigbluebutton`, `web-app-nextcloud`, `web-app-opentalk` and `web-app-jitsi` red (clearnet-pinned apps whose peer refs — OIDC/cdn/matomo/logout — resolve onion-primary). Fix direction: providers must publish BOTH families (clearnet sibling alongside the onion canonical) so the resolver has something to align to; includes re-applying the deferred `KC_HOSTNAME` onion-gate for Keycloak that was dropped from the earlier bundle because it is only needed once dual-family exists."
msgstr "**soláthraithe dé-teaghlaigh** — an bhearna dearaidh amháin fíor atá fágtha. Ar nód oinniún CI, soláthraithe tor-chumasaithe (e.g. mastodon) Tá oinniún-eisiach: tá a liosta fearainn ach an `.onion` Canonical, aon siblín glan. An réiteach teaghlaigh-ailíniú (`utils/tls_common.py:align_domain_to_consumer`, sreangaithe isteach `plugins/lookup/tls.py`) bannaí i gceart sa chás sin, mar sin faigheann tomhaltóir glan-próipthe fós URL oinniún ní féidir leis a réiteach ná a bhaint amach. An chéad fhianaise chrua: `web-app-fediwall` malairt leagan 2 (Torraigh:) custom `microblog.<onion>` isteach i `wall-config.json.servers`; an brabhsálaí glan (Níl aon SOCHT) amanna amach ag fanacht le míreanna balla mastodon (`test-walls-surface-posts.js:24`, cinntitheach ar fud retries). Táthar ag súil leis an rang céanna a choinneáil `web-app-bigbluebutton`, `web-app-nextcloud`, `web-app-opentalk` agus `web-app-jitsi` dearg dearg dearg (apps soiléire-bioráin a bhfuil a gcomhfholcadh — OIDC/cdn/matomo/logout — an t-iarbhunoideachas a réiteach). Treo Fix: ní mór do sholáthraithe teaghlaigh BOTH a fhoilsiú (soiléir deirfiúr taobh leis an Canonical oinniún) mar sin tá an réiteoir rud éigin a ailíniú le; Áirítear ath-chur i bhfeidhm ar an iarchurtha `KC_HOSTNAME` oinniún-gheata le haghaidh Keycloak a thit as an bundle níos luaithe toisc go bhfuil sé ag teastáil ach uair amháin dé-teaghlach ann."

