# libretranslate
msgid "**filesystem** -- which kind the row's docker data root runs on. The two read the row's position like an odometer: the distro is the low digit and the filesystem the high one, so consecutive rows walk every pairing rather than a diagonal through it. Turning both on the position directly would cover only ``n`` of the ``n x m`` pairs whenever the two pools happen to be the same length, and no sweep would unlock it, because the sweep shifts both by the same amount."
msgstr "**córas comhaid** - cén cineál a ritheann fréamh sonraí docker an tsraith ar. An dá léamh seasamh an tsraith ar nós odometer: Is é an distro an dhigit íseal agus an córas comhaid an ceann ard, sraitheanna chomh as a chéile siúl gach pairing seachas trasnánach tríd. Bheadh Casadh araon ar an seasamh a chlúdach go díreach ach amháin ``n`` de na ``n x m`` péirí aon uair a tharlóidh an dá linnte a bheith ar an fad céanna, agus ní bheadh aon sweep dhíghlasáil é, mar athraíonn an sweep araon ag an méid céanna."

