# libretranslate
msgid ":func:`ensure_node_onion` pre-mints (or reuses) the node's onion and returns its address, storing the authoritative hidden-service key files at the repo root. The ``svc-net-tor`` role copies those keys into the running daemon so it serves exactly that address; the inventory provisioner writes the address into ``applications.svc-net-tor.services.tor.node``. The onion is a deploy-time input; there is no in-deploy minting (a random mint would not match the provisioned node)."
msgstr ":func:`ensure_node_onion` réamh-mhianraí (nó reuses) an nód ar oinniún agus tuairisceáin a sheoladh, a stóráil na n-údarás i bhfolach-seirbhís comhaid eochair ag an fhréamh repo. An bhfuil ``svc-net-tor`` cóipeanna ról na heochracha isteach sa daemon ag rith mar sin feidhmíonn sé go díreach an seoladh sin; scríobhann an soláthar fardal an seoladh isteach ``applications.svc-net-tor.services.tor.node``. Is é an oinniún ionchur imscaradh-am; níl aon minting in-deploy (Ní bheadh mint randamach mheaitseáil leis an nód sholáthar)."

# libretranslate
