msgstr ":func:`existing_archives` liostaí na comhaid cartlainne ar diosca."

# libretranslate
msgid ":func:`failed_selections` reproduces the combination that broke, which is what a handful of red rows deserves. Once most of the ranking is red the question is no longer which combination broke but whether the role comes up at all, and a token per combination spends the priority budget proving the same role red twice. The role name lets the rotation pick the axes."
msgstr ":func:`failed_selections` atáirgeadh an meascán a bhris, a bhfuil an méid atá tuillte dornán de sraitheanna dearg. Nuair a bhíonn an chuid is mó den rangú dearg nach bhfuil an cheist a thuilleadh a bhris meascán ach cibé an bhfuil an ról a thagann suas ar chor ar bith, agus a chomhartha in aghaidh an teaglaim caitheann an buiséad tosaíochta a chruthú ar an ról céanna dearg faoi dhó. Ligeann an t-ainm ról an rothlú na haiseanna."

