# libretranslate
msgid "A \"version\" here is a tag of the shape ``(<channel>-)?v?<numeric-semver><patch>?(-<flavor>)?``, where the numeric part has 1 to 5 dot-separated components, the optional leading ``<channel>-`` is a release line written before the number (e.g. the LiteLLM tag ``main-v1.77.7-stable`` or the Jitsi tag ``stable-9646``), the optional ``<patch>`` is a vendor counter written as a letter and a number (e.g. the Checkmk tag ``2.4.0p32``), and the optional ``-<flavor>`` suffix is an opaque discriminator (e.g. the Docker Official Image tag ``5.4.5-php8.3-apache`` or the npm-style ``1.2.3-alpha``)."
msgstr "Amharc ar gach eolas \"version\" anseo tá tag an cruth ``(<channel>-)?v?<numeric-semver><patch>?(-<flavor>)?``, áit a bhfuil an chuid uimhriúil 1 go dtí 5 comhpháirteanna dot-scartha, an tosaigh roghnach ``<channel>-`` Is líne scaoilte scríofa roimh an uimhir (e.g. an chlib LiteLLM ``main-v1.77.7-stable`` nó an chlib Jitsi ``stable-9646``), an roghnach ``<patch>`` Is cuntar díoltóir scríofa mar litir agus uimhir (e.g. an chlib Checkmk ``2.4.0p32``), agus an roghnach ``-<flavor>`` Is iarmhír discriminator teimhneach (e.g. an chlib Íomhá Docker Oifigiúil ``5.4.5-php8.3-apache`` nó npm-stíl ``1.2.3-alpha``)."

# libretranslate
msgid "A **dedicated, single-tenant, network-segmented** device (robot controller / SBC), NOT a shared cluster node. This device is Hermes' body."
msgstr "Amharc ar gach eolas **tiomanta, singil-tionónta, líonra-segmented** gléas gléas (rialtóir robot / SBC), NACH nód braisle roinnte. Is é seo an gléas Hermes 'comhlacht."

# libretranslate
msgid "A **sweep** is one orchestrator run. It builds a single ordered list of `role#variant` rows, assigns each row a deploy mode and a tor state, and deploys the list in serial **chunk** blocks."
msgstr "Amharc ar gach eolas **scuab sweep** Is é ceann ceolfhoirneach reáchtáil. Tógann sé liosta ordaigh amháin de `role#variant` sraitheanna, Sannann gach a chéile modh imscaradh agus stát tor, agus imscaradh an liosta i sraitheach **Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí** bloic."

# libretranslate
msgid "A **variant** is the role's assembled per-role meta payload (the same payload `applications.<app>` exposes; see [layout.md](../../../design/role/services/layout.md)) deep-merged with the matching list entry. The deep-merge follows the same rules as the [`applications`](../plugins/lookup/applications.md) lookup: dictionaries merge recursively, scalars and lists are replaced, and the entry has precedence."
msgstr "Amharc ar gach eolas **malairt leagan** Is é an ról le chéile per-role pálasta meta (an pálasta céanna `applications.<app>` nochtadh; féach [layout.md](../../../design/role/services/layout.md)) domhain- chumasc leis an iontráil liosta meaitseáil. Leanann an cumasc domhain na rialacha céanna leis na [`applications`](../plugins/lookup/applications.md) lookup: foclóirí chumasc recourse, scalars agus liostaí a chur in ionad, agus tá an iontráil roimh."

# libretranslate
msgid "A *chunk* is one serial block of deploy jobs in the orchestrator. Two independent ceilings bound it, and the smaller one wins:"
msgstr "Amharc ar gach eolas *Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí* Is bloc sraitheach amháin de phoist a imscaradh sa cheolfhoireann. Dhá uasteorainneacha neamhspleácha cheangal air, agus an ceann is lú Bhuaigh:"

# libretranslate
msgid "A *relevant* candidate with no matching declared addon becomes a :class:`CatalogSuggestion` (added disabled by update automation)."
