# libretranslate
msgid "A *sweep* is one orchestrator run. It deploys its rows in serial chunk blocks, each small enough that its last runner wave still starts inside the queue window (:mod:`cli.meta.ci.slots` sizes them). Two rules shape the split:"
msgstr "Amharc ar gach eolas *scuab sweep* Is é ceann ceolfhoirneach reáchtáil. imscaradh sé a sraitheanna i bloic smután sraitheach, gach beag go leor a thosaíonn a tonn dara háit deireanach fós taobh istigh den fhuinneog scuaine (:mod:`cli.meta.ci.slots` méideanna iad). Dhá rialacha cruth an scoilt:"

