# libretranslate
msgid "A ``type: volume`` entry may set ``nfs: false`` to opt out of the swarm NFS rewrite: the volume then stays a plain node-local named volume even when ``storage.backend`` is ``nfs`` (e.g. gitaly repository storage, which upstream forbids on NFS). Any other ``nfs`` value (absent, ``true``, or the uid/gid/mode dict consumed by the NFS subdir pre-creation) keeps the rewrite."
msgstr "Amharc ar gach eolas ``type: volume`` Is féidir iontráil leagtha ``nfs: false`` a roghnú as an NFS swarm athscríobh: an toirt tréimhsí ansin a nód-áit plain ainmnithe toirt fiú nuair ``storage.backend`` Is maith liom ``nfs`` (e.g. stóráil stórais giniúna, a chuireann cosc ar an sruth ar NFS). Aon eile ``nfs`` luach (as láthair, ``true``, nó uid/gid/mode dict arna gcaitheamh ag an subdir NFS réamh-creation) Coinníonn an athscríobh."

