# libretranslate
msgid "A `templates/Dockerfile.j2` is acceptable when the file contains Jinja2 control-flow logic that cannot be expressed through Docker `ARG` alone, for example a conditional build step that installs an optional component only when a feature flag is enabled."
msgstr "Amharc ar gach eolas `templates/Dockerfile.j2` inghlactha nuair a bhíonn Jinja sa chomhad2 loighic rialaithe-sreabhadh nach féidir a chur in iúl trí Docker `ARG` ina n-aonar, mar shampla céim coinníollach a thógáil go installs comhpháirt roghnach ach amháin nuair a bratach gné ar chumas."

# libretranslate
msgid "A `v*` tag push fans out into two CI workflows:"
msgstr "Amharc ar gach eolas `v*` lucht leanúna chlib bhrú amach i dhá shreabhadh oibre CI:"

# libretranslate
msgid "A bare `mode=update` without `variant=` on a matrix-variant role. Every `mode=update` MUST carry `variant=<idx>` (row 2). A missing `variant=` is never a reason to switch to `mode=reinstall`."
msgstr "A lom `mode=update` gan `variant=` ar ról maitrís-athrú. Gach `mode=update` MUST iompar `variant=<idx>` (sraith 2). A iarraidh `variant=` Tá riamh ar chúis a athrú chun `mode=reinstall`."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
