# libretranslate
msgid "A digital administration and documentation platform for structured organizations."
msgstr "Ionad riaracháin agus doiciméadaithe digiteach d'eagraíochtaí struchtúrtha."

# libretranslate
msgid "A distro ships the interpreter and its extensions as separate packages, so a present ``php`` binary says nothing about them and ``ensure_command_present`` returns early on one. The extension is therefore probed against ``php -m``."
msgstr "A distro longa an ateangaire agus a síntí mar phacáistí ar leith, mar sin i láthair ``php`` dénártha deir aon rud mar gheall orthu agus ``ensure_command_present`` tuairisceáin go luath ar cheann amháin. Dá bhrí sin, tá síneadh probed i gcoinne ``php -m``."

# libretranslate
msgid "A docs `README.md` MUST NOT act as a manual index, table of contents, or page inventory."
msgstr "A docs `README.md` NÍ MÓR gníomhú mar innéacs láimhe, tábla ábhar, nó fardal leathanach."

# libretranslate
msgid "A docs `README.md` MUST NOT duplicate navigation that Sphinx already provides."
msgstr "A docs `README.md` NÍ MÓR Dúblach nascleanúint a sholáthraíonn Sphinx cheana féin."

# libretranslate
