# libretranslate
msgid "A single-node lab cannot answer the multi-node criteria: replica scaling, placement across two `kata-capable` Raspberry-Pi-class nodes, and the compose-plus-swarm end-to-end pass all need the cluster the requirement describes. The arm64 half of the placement criterion is proven by the image check above; the two-node half is not."
msgstr "Ní féidir le saotharlann aon-node na critéir il-node a fhreagairt: scálaithe macasamhail, socrúcháin thar dhá `kata-capable` Sú craobh-Pi-aicme nóid, agus an chuma-plus-swarm pas deireadh-le-deireadh gach gá an braisle an ceanglas cur síos. An lámh64 Tá leath den chritéar socrúcháin cruthaithe ag an seiceáil íomhá thuas; nach bhfuil an leath dhá-nód."

# libretranslate
msgid "A small Express middleware (``files/sso/header_auth.js``, mounted into ``server.js`` at build time by ``files/sso/patch_server.js``) reads only those nginx-overwritten ``X-Forwarded-*`` headers and flips ``req.session.loggedIn = true``, so the existing ``isAuthenticated`` gate on ``/admin`` opens for the proxied owner."
msgstr "Meánearraí beag Express (``files/sso/header_auth.js``, suite isteach ``server.js`` ag tógáil am ag ``files/sso/patch_server.js``) léann ach na nginx-overwritten ``X-Forwarded-*`` ceanntásca agus smeach ``req.session.loggedIn = true``, mar sin an reatha ``isAuthenticated`` geata ar ``/admin`` osclaíonn don úinéir proxied."

# libretranslate
msgid "A small Express middleware (`files/sso/header_auth.js`, mounted into `server.js` at build time by `files/sso/patch_server.js`) reads only those nginx-overwritten `X-Forwarded-*` headers and flips `req.session.loggedIn = true`, so the existing `isAuthenticated` gate on `/admin` opens for the proxied owner."
msgstr "Meánearraí beag Express (`files/sso/header_auth.js`, suite isteach `server.js` ag tógáil am ag `files/sso/patch_server.js`) léann ach na nginx-overwritten `X-Forwarded-*` ceanntásca agus smeach `req.session.loggedIn = true`, mar sin an reatha `isAuthenticated` geata ar `/admin` osclaíonn don úinéir proxied."

# libretranslate
