# libretranslate
msgid "A versioned managed chatflow or agentflow fixture MUST be created through a supported API, tagged with an Infinito ownership marker, and updated idempotently without overwriting human flows. It MUST reference registry connections or encrypted Flowise credentials, never plaintext bearer values in `flowData`. The end-to-end test MUST execute a deterministic MCP tool and assert its result; listing a connection or rejecting an anonymous chatflow request is insufficient."
msgstr "A MUST comhráite leaganaithe bhainistiú nó fixture agentflow a chruthú trí API tacaíocht, clib le marcóir úinéireacht Infinito, agus cothrom le dáta idempotently gan overwriting sreabhadh daonna. MUST sé naisc clárlainne tagartha nó dintiúir Flowise criptithe, riamh luachanna settings plaintext i `flowData`. Déanann an tástáil deiridh go deireadh uirlis MCP cinntitheach a fhorghníomhú agus a thoradh a dhearbhú; ní leor nasc a liostú nó iarraidh ar shreabhadh comhrá gan ainm a dhiúltú."

# libretranslate
msgid "A volume whose payload cannot tolerate NFS semantics opts out with `nfs: false` plus a justification, which keeps engine state local without pinning the whole role. The deploy MUST NOT silently lose data on reschedule."
msgstr "Ní féidir le toirt a n-íocualach a fhulaingt shéantaigh NFS rogha amach le `nfs: false` móide bonn cirt, a choinníonn an stát inneall áitiúil gan pinning an ról iomlán. An MUST imscaradh NACH chailleadh go ciúin sonraí ar reschedule."

# libretranslate
msgid "A wall's `config.servers` may be left empty to auto-fill with the active Mastodon-API-compatible Fediverse siblings (`web-app-mastodon`, `web-app-pixelfed`, `web-app-friendica`) that are present in the current host's `group_names`. Every other field of `wall-config.json` is read verbatim from the wall's `config` block."
msgstr "A balla ar `config.servers` Is féidir a fhágáil folamh a uathoibríoch-líonadh leis an gníomhach Mastodon-API-comhoiriúnach deartháireacha Droim (`web-app-mastodon`, `web-app-pixelfed`, `web-app-friendica`) atá i láthair sa óstach reatha `group_names`. Gach réimse eile de `wall-config.json` a léamh verbatim ó bhalla ar `config` bloc."

