# libretranslate
msgid "A workflow the entries call declares no `concurrency` of its own: its jobs then belong to the entry's group, and the entry's `cancel-in-progress` reaches them. `call-images-build-ci.yml` and `call-images-mirror-missing.yml` still declare one, so a run whose only live job is theirs stays outside the entry's group and waits for the fallback."
msgstr "A sreabhadh oibre na n-iontrálacha glaoch Dearbhaíonn aon `concurrency` dá chuid féin: a chuid post a bhaineann ansin leis an iontráil ghrúpa, agus an iontráil ar `cancel-in-progress` sroicheann siad iad. `call-images-build-ci.yml` agus `call-images-mirror-missing.yml` fós a dhearbhú amháin, mar sin tá a reáchtáil a bhfuil ach post beo fhanann inniúlacht siúd lasmuigh de ghrúpa an iontrála agus fanann an fallback."

# libretranslate
msgid "A workflow with a `workflow_dispatch` trigger MUST keep its `name:` at or below 25 characters, enforced by [test_workflow_dispatch_name_length.py](../../../../../tests/lint/repository/test_workflow_dispatch_name_length.py). The dispatch menu lists those names in one narrow column, where a longer one is truncated. Move the explanatory wording into `run-name:`, which carries no such limit."
msgstr "Sreabhadh oibre le `workflow_dispatch` MUST tús a choinneáil ar a `name:` ag nó thíos 25 carachtair, i bhfeidhm ag [test_workflow_dispatch_name_length.py](../../../../../tests/lint/repository/test_workflow_dispatch_name_length.py). Liostaíonn an roghchlár seolta na hainmneacha sin i gcolún caol amháin, áit a bhfuil ceann níos faide teasctha. Bog an focal míniúcháin isteach `run-name:`, nach ndéanann aon teorainn den sórt sin."

