# libretranslate
msgid "Additional sections (for example \"When to use\", \"Conventions\", \"Background\") MAY follow the description paragraph. They MUST be separated from the description paragraph by a blank line so the help-extraction heuristic stops at the right place. They MUST NOT duplicate content that the sub-commands' own `--help` output already exposes."
msgstr "Ailt nua (mar shampla \"Cathain a úsáid\", \"Conventions\", \"Background\") MAY lean an mhír cur síos. MUST siad a scartha ón mír cur síos ag líne bán mar sin stopann an cúnamh-tarraingt heuristic ag an áit ceart. NÍ MÓR dóibh ábhar a dhúbailt go bhfuil na fo-orduithe' féin `--help` aschur nochtadh cheana féin."

# libretranslate
msgid "Additional top-level-or-nested directory names to skip. Matched by path-component containment, not by prefix. E.g. ``exclude_dirs=(\"docs\",)`` skips any file whose path contains a ``docs`` segment."
msgstr "Ainmneacha eolaire barr-leibhéal nó a dtugtar chun skip. Comhoiriúnacht le srianadh cosán-chomhpháirt, ní trí réimír. E.g. ``exclude_dirs=(\"docs\",)`` skips aon chomhad a bhfuil cosán ``docs`` deighleog."

