# libretranslate
msgid "An `swarm-zombie` run rebuilds a full DinD cluster over tens of minutes, so you MUST confirm a fix on the live cluster before redeploying."
msgstr "An bhfuil `swarm-zombie` rebuilds reáchtáil braisle DinD iomlán níos mó ná deich nóiméad, mar sin MUST tú a dhaingniú a shocrú ar an braisle beo roimh ath-imlonnú."

# libretranslate
msgid "An adapter could reach these, and none has been curated yet. The five that used to sit under \"current MCP metadata requiring revalidation\" are here because that revalidation found no shipped surface to revalidate."
msgstr "D'fhéadfadh adapter teacht ar na, agus tá aon cheann curtha a leigheas go fóill. An cúig a úsáidtear chun suí faoi \"meiteashonraí reatha MCP a éilíonn athluacháil\" Tá anseo mar gheall ar an athluacháil fuair aon dromchla shipped chun athbheochan."

# libretranslate
msgid "An addon MUST NOT bridge a service that is absent from `meta/services.yml`; lint fails with the missing key named."
msgstr "An addon NACH droichead seirbhís atá as láthair ó `meta/services.yml`; lint theipeann leis an eochair ar iarraidh ainmnithe."

# libretranslate
msgid "An addon that needs install/enable/configure logic beyond the generic `config:` payload MUST place it in `roles/<role>/tasks/addons/<addon_id>.yml`, mirroring the `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` file-root convention."
msgstr "An addon riachtanais install/enable/configure loighic thar an cineálach `config:` MUST pálasta áit sé i `roles/<role>/tasks/addons/<addon_id>.yml`, scáthánú an `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` coinbhinsiún comhad-fréamh."

# libretranslate
msgid "An addon under `meta/addons/` MAY declare an `incompatible_plugins` list in its `config:`. [01_install.yml](./01_install.yml) runs `occ app:disable` for every listed plugin before the install attempt. This guarantees that mutually exclusive integrations such as the OIDC entry points (`oidc_login`, `sociallogin`, `user_oidc`) and the document-editing surfaces (`onlyoffice`, `richdocuments`, `fileslibreofficeedit`) cannot accidentally coexist on the same instance."
msgstr "An addon faoi `meta/addons/` MAY dhearbhú `incompatible_plugins` liosta ina `config:`. [01Suiteáil.yml](./01_install.yml) Ritheann `occ app:disable` do gach breiseán liostaithe roimh an iarracht a shuiteáil. Ráthaíonn sé seo go bhfuil comhtháthú comheisiatach ar nós na bpointí iontrála OIDC (`oidc_login`, `sociallogin`, `user_oidc`) agus na dromchlaí doiciméad-eagarthóireachta (`onlyoffice`, `richdocuments`, `fileslibreofficeedit`) Ní féidir le coexist thaisme ar an nós céanna."

# libretranslate
msgid "An addon whose pinned version is behind the latest upstream release."
msgstr "Tá addon a leagan pinned taobh thiar den scaoileadh is déanaí upstream."

# libretranslate
msgid "An app that needs an extra mapper MUST add it through a per-client scope. See [nextcloud.json.j2](../../../../roles/web-app-keycloak/templates/import/scopes/nextcloud.json.j2) for the precedent: a dedicated scope holds the Nextcloud-specific UID and quota mappers and is attached only to the Nextcloud client."
msgstr "Aip go bhfuil gá MUST mapper breise a chur leis trí raon feidhme per-client. Féach ar [nextcloud.json.j2](../../../../roles/web-app-keycloak/templates/import/scopes/nextcloud.json.j2) don fhasach: tá raon feidhme tiomnaithe an UID Nextcloud-shonrach agus léarscáileoirí cuóta agus tá sé ceangailte ach leis an gcliant Nextcloud."

# libretranslate
msgid "An application SHOULD opt in to `axis: domain` only when its authorisation model is genuinely per-tenant and the tenant axis is the canonical domain. Typical consumer: WordPress Multisite. Applications whose authorisation is one global user set (Nextcloud, Gitea, Keycloak itself) MUST keep `axis: none`."
msgstr "iarratas SHOULD roghnú i `axis: domain` ach amháin nuair atá a shamhail údaraithe fíor in aghaidh an tionónta agus gurb é ais an tionónta an fearainn Canonical. tomhaltóir tipiciúil: WordPress Multisite. Iarratais a bhfuil a n-údarú socraithe úsáideoir domhanda amháin (Nextcloud, Gitea, Keycloak féin) MUST choinneáil `axis: none`."

# libretranslate
msgid "An application id is expanded to the service key(s) that role provides; every other token is kept verbatim. Order-preserving, de-duplicated. Used wherever the operator supplies service references (``disable``, include/prune closures) so both spellings resolve identically."
msgstr "Tá iarratas id leathnú chuig an eochair seirbhíse(s s) go soláthraíonn an ról sin; coimeádtar briathra ar gach dearbhán eile. Ordú-preserving, de-duplicated. Úsáidte cibé áit a sholáthraíonn an t-oibreoir tagairtí seirbhíse (``disable``, lena n-áirítear/clúdaigh phrune) mar sin an dá litriú réiteach mar an gcéanna."

# libretranslate
msgid "An application that authenticates its own API with a bearer MUST expose that path through the SSO ACL whitelist. The proxy cannot validate an application bearer, so a fully gated vhost answers an API call with an identity-provider redirect, which a client following redirects reads as a successful 200."
msgstr "Iarratas a fhíoraíonn a API féin le MUST settings nochtadh go cosán tríd an Liosta bán SSO ACL. Ní féidir leis an seachfhreastalaí a bhailíochtú ar iompróir iarratais, mar sin freagraí vhost go hiomlán gated glao API le haitheantas-sholáthar atreorú, a bhfuil cliant tar éis atreoruithe léann mar rathúil 200."

# libretranslate
msgid "An application whose registration rejects the shell-safe alphabet states that in its own meta/users.yml rather than carrying a second credential beside the account it already owns."
msgstr "Maidir le hiarratas a ndiúltaíonn a chlárú an aibítir sliogáin-sábháilte a deir go bhfuil ina chuid féin meta/users.yml seachas a iompar dara credential in aice leis an gcuntas úinéireacht sé cheana féin."

# libretranslate
msgid "An application's canonical primary domain when it has at most max_length characters, otherwise its short entity name (e.g. ``keycloak``)."
msgstr "An t-iarratas príomhfhearainn Canonical nuair atá sé ar an chuid is mó max_length carachtair, ar shlí eile a ainm eintiteas gearr (e.g. ``keycloak``)."

# libretranslate
msgid "An audit-only mapping MUST use this minimal explicit form:"
msgstr "Baintear úsáid as an bhfoirm íosta shainráite seo le mapáil-amháin:"

# libretranslate
msgid "An axis the token leaves open matches anything, so ``web-app-x`` covers every row of that role and ``web-app-x#2@swarm`` only its swarm deploy of variant 2. Reads the strings a matrix entry carries, not a discovery row's native types."
msgstr "An ais fágann an dearbhán cluichí oscailte rud ar bith, mar sin ``web-app-x`` Clúdaíonn sé gach sraith den ról sin agus ``web-app-x#2@swarm`` ach a swarm imscaradh de malairt 2. Léigh na teaghráin a dhéanann iontráil maitrís, ní cineálacha dúchais sraith fionnachtana."

# libretranslate
msgid "An empty `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY` sends no header at all."
msgstr "An folamh `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY` Cuireann aon header ar chor ar bith."

# libretranslate
msgid "An empty ``ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY`` sends no header at all."
msgstr "An folamh ``ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY`` Cuireann aon header ar chor ar bith."

# libretranslate
msgid "An empty body is rejected."
msgstr "Diúltaítear comhlacht folamh."

# libretranslate
msgid "An empty mapping or list returns the empty string so the surrounding template stays valid YAML (no orphan ``depends_on:`` keyword)."
msgstr "Filleann mapáil folamh nó liosta an teaghrán folamh mar sin fanann an teimpléad máguaird bailí YAML (aon dílleachta ``depends_on:`` eochairfhocal)."

# libretranslate
msgid "An empty or unresolvable closure filters nothing: discovery that silently dropped every provider would look exactly like a deployment without any, which is the failure this module refuses to produce elsewhere."
msgstr "Scagairí dúnadh folamh nó neamh-inréitithe rud ar bith: fionnachtain a thit go ciúin go mbeadh gach soláthraí cuma díreach cosúil le imscaradh gan aon, a bhfuil an teip dhiúltaíonn an modúl seo a thabhairt ar aird in áiteanna eile."

# libretranslate
msgid "An empty result is cached under its id too, or a role without the file would re-stat it on every call."
msgstr "Tá toradh folamh i dtaisce faoina id freisin, nó ról gan an comhad a bheadh ath-stat sé ar gach glaoch."

# libretranslate
msgid "An empty string is a valid answer: a provider that has not minted its credential yet is the normal state early in a play, and the callers distinguish it from a wrong one by probing."
msgstr "Is teaghrán folamh freagra bailí: soláthraí nach bhfuil lúide a chreidiúnacht go fóill is é an stát gnáth go luath i spraoi, agus na glaoiteoirí idirdhealú a dhéanamh ó cheann mícheart ag probing."

# libretranslate
msgid "An empty string means \"not configured\" and passes every check, which is what makes an optional provider key expressible: declare the shape, leave the value empty, and the consumer gates on emptiness."
msgstr "Ciallaíonn teaghrán folamh \"ní chumrú\" agus Gabhann gach seiceáil, a bhfuil cad a dhéanann eochair soláthraí roghnach in iúl: dhearbhú an cruth, fág an luach folamh, agus geataí an tomhaltóra ar fholmhú."

# libretranslate
msgid "An entry in `whitelist` or `priority` is a role name that MAY pin the axes the row would otherwise be assigned. Two spellings are accepted:"
msgstr "iontráil i `whitelist` nó `priority` Is ainm ról go bioráin MAY na haiseanna a bheadh an tsraith a shannadh ar shlí eile. Glactar le dhá litriú:"

# libretranslate
msgid "An entry therefore carries `enforce_filesystem`, true when a human left the row no choice: a `/filesystem` selection token, or a run whose `filesystem` input names exactly one kind."
msgstr "Dá bhrí sin, déanann iontráil `enforce_filesystem`, fíor nuair a d'fhág an duine an tsraith aon rogha: a `/filesystem` token roghnú, nó a reáchtáil a bhfuil `filesystem` ainmneacha ionchur go díreach cineál amháin."

# libretranslate
msgid "An entry whose ``version:`` is not a semver (a branch name, say) states an intent this cannot second-guess and is skipped."
msgstr "iontráil a bhfuil ``version:`` Níl an Tweet seo ar fáil (ainm brainse, a rá) deir intinn nach féidir é seo a dara-rág agus tá sé skipped."

# libretranslate
msgid "An entry with overrides produces a derived shape (for example WordPress Multisite domains)."
msgstr "Táirgeann iontráil le overrides cruth díorthaithe (mar shampla fearainn WordPress Ilsite)."

# libretranslate
msgid "An entry without a pinned version can never be confirmed from disk and is always reported, so the caller falls through to a real install."
msgstr "Ní féidir iontráil gan leagan pinned a dhaingniú ó dhiosca agus tá sé tuairiscithe i gcónaí, mar sin tagann an glaoiteoir trí a shuiteáil fíor."

# libretranslate
msgid "An example of how to use this role in your playbook:"
msgstr "Sampla de conas an ról seo a úsáid i do leabhar súgartha:"

# libretranslate
msgid "An explicit `tor` input still wins over the full coverage: `enforced`, `exclusive` and `disabled` are operator narrowings, and a variant that pins `services.tor.enabled` to false never gets an onion run regardless."
msgstr "Gan a bheith ráite `tor` ionchur Bhuaigh fós thar an clúdach iomlán: `enforced`, `exclusive` agus `disabled` Tá cúnguithe oibreoir, agus leagan go bioráin `services.tor.enabled` a bréagach riamh faigheann oinniún reáchtáil beag beann ar."

# libretranslate
msgid "An explicit per-domain allowlist is required because the wildcard form `WebFetch(domain:*)` is **inert**: observed empirically, the permission prompt still fires for every new host despite the wildcard being present, so the wildcard buys nothing. Contributors who need a new origin MUST extend this list (and the sandbox `allowedDomains` in [sandbox.md](sandbox.md)) explicitly."
msgstr "Tá an deisitheoir follasach in aghaidh an-domain ag teastáil mar gheall ar an bhfoirm cárta fiáin `WebFetch(domain:*)` Is maith liom **taiseachas aeir: fliuch**: faoi deara empirically, an cead go pras fós tinte do gach óstach nua in ainneoin an cárta fiáin a bheith i láthair, mar sin ceannaíonn an wildcard rud ar bith. Sínitheoirí a dteastaíonn MUST tionscnaimh nua uathu an liosta seo a leathnú (agus an bosca gainimh `allowedDomains` i [sandbox.md](sandbox.md)) go sainráite."

# libretranslate
msgid "An explicit string value at applications['web-app-nextcloud'] .services.sso.oidc.plugin (inventory override)."
msgstr "Luach teaghrán follasach ar iarratais['web-app-nextcloud'] .services.sso.oidc.plugin (override fardal)."

# libretranslate
msgid "An independent creator stack for publishing, video, audio, analytics, and community without platform lock-in."
msgstr "Stack cruthaitheoir neamhspleách le haghaidh a fhoilsiú, físeán, fuaime, Analytics, agus pobail gan ardán glas-i."

# libretranslate
msgid "An input the source left on its default resolves to empty and is dropped, so the retrigger leaves it on that same default rather than pinning today's default into a run that never asked for it."
msgstr "Réitigh ionchur an fhoinse a d'fhág ar a réamhshocraithe a fholmhú agus tá sé thit, mar sin fágann an retrigger é ar an mainneachtain chéanna seachas pinning an lae inniu mainneachtain i rith a d'iarr riamh é."

# libretranslate
msgid "An input whose ``format()`` opens with nothing yields no segment: with no opening literal there is nothing to locate in a title, and ``str.find('')`` would match at position 0 and hand back the title's own prefix as the value. Such an input renders a glyph the reader understands and is recovered from the job log instead (``runs.LOG_INPUTS``)."
msgstr "ionchur a bhfuil ``format()`` osclaíonn le rud ar bith táirgeacht aon deighleog: gan aon oscailt litriúil níl aon rud a aimsiú i dteideal, agus ``str.find('')`` Bheadh mheaitseáil ag seasamh 0 agus an teideal féin a thabhairt ar ais mar an luach. Tugann ionchur den sórt sin glyph a thuigeann an léitheoir agus tá sé aisghabháil ón logáil poist ina ionad sin (``runs.LOG_INPUTS``)."

# libretranslate
msgid "An integration whose partner is self-hostable in-repo (e.g. `gitlab`) is wired as a local `bridges:` integration gated on the partner role being present. An integration whose target is purely proprietary / external (e.g. `github`, `google`, `jira`) carries NO `bridges:` and MUST be enabled only when its `lookup('api', '<provider>.client_id')` and `client_secret` are present."
msgstr "Comhtháthú a bhfuil a pháirtí féin-óstáil in-repo (e.g. `gitlab`) Tá sreangaithe mar áitiúil `bridges:` comhtháthú gated ar an ról comhpháirtíochta a bheith i láthair. Comhtháthú a bhfuil a sprioc amháin dílseánaigh / seachtrach (e.g. `github`, `google`, `jira`) Déan teagmháil `bridges:` agus MUST a chumasú ach amháin nuair a `lookup('api', '<provider>.client_id')` agus `client_secret` Tá siad i láthair."

# libretranslate
msgid "An inventory in Infinito.Nexus is not just a host definition. It represents a complete, declarative infrastructure bundle."
msgstr "An fardal i Infinito.Nexus Níl ach sainmhíniú óstach. Léiríonn sé bundle bonneagair iomlán, declarative."

