msgid "An inventory in Infinito.Nexus is:"
msgstr "An fardal i Infinito.Nexus Is é:"

# libretranslate
msgid "An omitted flag inherits the client's own declaration; only an explicit ``mcp_consumer: false`` excludes, so a deliberate exclusion is distinguishable from a forgotten entry."
msgstr "Fuair bratach ar lár dearbhú an chliaint féin; ach follasach ``mcp_consumer: false`` eisiamh, mar sin tá eisiamh d'aon ghnó idirdhealú ó iontráil dearmad."

# libretranslate
msgid "An optional `PROXY_HEADER_SSO_ADMIN_GROUP` check against `X-Forwarded-Groups` restricts the owner session to members of the application's administrator RBAC group."
msgstr "Roghnaigh `PROXY_HEADER_SSO_ADMIN_GROUP` seiceáil i gcoinne `X-Forwarded-Groups` srian a chur ar sheisiún an úinéara chuig comhaltaí de ghrúpa RBAC riarthóir an iarratais."

# libretranslate
msgid "An optional ``PROXY_HEADER_SSO_ADMIN_GROUP`` check against ``X-Forwarded-Groups`` restricts the owner session to members of the application’s administrator RBAC group."
msgstr "Roghnaigh ``PROXY_HEADER_SSO_ADMIN_GROUP`` seiceáil i gcoinne ``X-Forwarded-Groups`` srian a chur ar sheisiún an úinéara chuig comhaltaí de ghrúpa RBAC riarthóir an iarratais."

