msgstr "Cruthaíonn log inléite clúdach nach bealach agus tá sé tuairiscithe mar \"missing\" i gcás gach ról riachtanach, mar sin fógraí an oibreora."

# libretranslate
msgid "An unset key is not an error. The provider's route stays unpublished, the gateway serves whatever local backend the round deploys, and [the litellm CLI test](../../../../../roles/svc-ai-litellm/files/test/probe.py) asserts the absence rather than skipping."
msgstr "Níl an eochair unset earráid. Fanann bealach an tsoláthraí gan foilsiú, feidhmíonn an geata cibé áit a dtéann an babhta i bhfeidhm, agus [an tástáil litellm CLI](../../../../../roles/svc-ai-litellm/files/test/probe.py) Dearbhaíonn an easpa in áit gan bacadh."

# libretranslate
msgid "An upstream README or current default branch MAY identify a candidate, but only the source and tests of the exact selected tag or digest may close a compatibility criterion."
msgstr "Aithníonn README nó brainse réamhshocraithe reatha MAY iarrthóir, ach ní fhéadfaidh foinse agus tástálacha an chlib nó an díolama a roghnaíodh go cruinn critéar comhoiriúnachta a dhúnadh."

# libretranslate
msgid "An upstream path exists or is claimed, and something concrete stops it here. Each row names what, using the reason vocabulary above, so \"blocked\" never reads as \"nobody looked\"."
msgstr "Tá cosán upstream ann nó tá sé á éileamh, agus stopann rud éigin coincréite anseo. Gach as a chéile ainmneacha cad, ag baint úsáide as an chúis stór focal thuas, mar sin \"blocked\" riamh léann mar \"aon duine a d'fhéach\"."

