# libretranslate
msgid "As a contributor maintaining the per-role Playwright suite, I want every role whose `meta/services.yml` declares `ldap.enabled` (literal `true` or the dynamic `\"{{ 'svc-db-openldap' in group_names }}\"` form) to ship a Playwright scenario that exercises the LDAP-bind login path end-to-end, so that the LDAP variant of the role's authentication stack is verified independently from its OIDC counterpart."
msgstr "Mar ranníocóir a chothabháil an sraith per-role Playwright, Ba mhaith liom gach ról a bhfuil `meta/services.yml` a dhearbhú `ldap.enabled` (foirm duille: líneach `true` nó an dinimiciúil `\"{{ 'svc-db-openldap' in group_names }}\"` foirm duille: oval) a long cás Playwright a fheidhmíonn an cosán LDAP-bind logáil isteach deireadh-le-deireadh, ionas go bhfuil an leagan LDAP de Stack fíordheimhnithe an ról a fhíorú go neamhspleách óna OIDC contrapháirtí."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a contributor maintaining the per-role Playwright suite, I want every role whose login flow is RBAC-gated (OIDC and/or LDAP) to also exercise the canonical non-admin user `biber` end-to-end, so that the RBAC plumbing from [004 - Generic RBAC role auto-provisioning](README.md#archive) is verified per role rather than only on the privileged-admin path."
msgstr "Mar ranníocóir a choinníonn an tsraith per-role Playwright, ba mhaith liom gach ról a bhfuil a sreabhadh logáil isteach RBAC-gated (OIDC agus/nó LDAP) a fheidhmiú freisin an Canonical neamh-admin úsáideoir `biber` deireadh le deireadh, ionas go mbeidh an pluiméireacht RBAC ó [004 - Ról RBAC Cineálach uathoibríoch-sholáthar](README.md#archive) a fhíorú in aghaidh an ról seachas ach amháin ar an cosán phribhléid-admin."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a contributor to Infinito.Nexus, I want every role that ships application-level extensions to declare them through one unified `meta/addons/` contract (one file per addon), instead of today's per-app spelling (`addons`, `plugins`, `extensions`, `modules`, `mu_plugins`) scattered across `meta/services.yml`, `vars/main.yml`, and `tasks/`, so that addons are discoverable, lintable, and testable with a single schema, and so that any addon that bridges into another role declares that dependency explicitly through a service flag in `meta/services.yml`."
msgstr "Mar ranníocóir le Infinito.Nexus, Ba mhaith liom gach ról a leathnú ar leibhéal na n-iarratas long chun iad a dhearbhú trí aontaithe amháin `meta/addons/` conradh (comhad amháin in aghaidh an addon), in ionad an lae inniu litriú in aghaidh an-app (`addons`, `plugins`, `extensions`, `modules`, `mu_plugins`) scaipthe ar fud `meta/services.yml`, `vars/main.yml`, agus `tasks/`, ionas go mbeidh addons fhionnadh, lintable, agus testable le scéimre amháin, agus mar sin go Dearbhaíonn aon addon go droichid i ról eile go spleáchas go sainráite trí bhratach seirbhíse i `meta/services.yml`."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a contributor, I want a requirements template so that new requirements are consistent and machine-readable."
msgstr "Mar ranníocóir, ba mhaith liom teimpléad ceanglais ionas go mbeidh ceanglais nua comhsheasmhach agus inléite ag meaisín."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a developer, I want to run the Infinito.Nexus CI on a dedicated server so that the deploy + test cycle is no longer bound by local hardware restrictions."
msgstr "Mar forbróir, ba mhaith liom a reáchtáil ar an Infinito.Nexus CI ar fhreastalaí tiomnaithe ionas nach mbeidh srianta crua-earraí áitiúla ag an timthriall imscaradh + tástála."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a maintainer of Infinito.Nexus, I want every user-facing string that core ships extracted into gettext catalogs and machine-translated by LibreTranslate through `make`, so that the API, the documentation and every consumer app serve all ISO 639-1 languages from one source of truth in this repository."
msgstr "Mar choimeádaí de Infinito.Nexus, Ba mhaith liom gach teaghrán úsáideoir-facing a bhaintear croí longa isteach catalóga gettext agus meaisín-aistrithe ag LibreTranslate trí `make`, ionas go mbeidh an API, an doiciméadú agus gach app tomhaltóirí freastal ar gach ISO 639- - - - -1 teangacha ó fhoinse amháin na fírinne sa stór."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want ERPNext (Frappe Framework) integrated as a `web-app-erpnext` role with OpenID Connect identity provider integration so that users can access the ERP through the same Single Sign-On (SSO) mechanism used across the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem, reusing the platform's central database and cache services."
msgstr "Mar riarthóir ardán de Infinito.Nexus, Ba mhaith liom ERPNext (Creat an Fheirtéaraigh) comhtháite mar `web-app-erpnext` ról le OpenID Nasc comhtháthú soláthraí aitheantais ionas gur féidir le húsáideoirí rochtain a fháil ar an ERP tríd an Aonair Cláraigh-Ar (SSO) meicníocht a úsáidtear ar fud an Infinito.Nexus éiceachóras, athúsáid bunachar sonraí lárnach an ardán agus seirbhísí taisce."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want [Checkmk](https://github.com/Checkmk/checkmk) integrated as a `web-app-checkmk` role with Keycloak SSO (via the oauth2-proxy gate) and native LDAP user management so that operators can run the open-source Checkmk monitoring server behind the platform's central Single Sign-On, validated end-to-end with Playwright personas."
msgstr "Mar riarthóir ardán de Infinito.Nexus, Ba mhaith liom [Seiceáil](https://github.com/Checkmk/checkmk) comhtháite mar `web-app-checkmk` Ról le Keycloak SSO (tríd an oauth2-proxy geata) agus ó dhúchas bainistíochta úsáideora LDAP ionas gur féidir le hoibreoirí a reáchtáil an oscailte-foinse freastalaí monatóireachta Checkmk taobh thiar an ardán lárnach Aonair Cláraigh-Ar, bailíochtaithe deireadh-le-deireadh le duine Playwright."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want [Jellyfin](https://jellyfin.org) integrated as a `web-app-jellyfin` role with Keycloak-backed Single Sign-On so that users can stream the media server behind the platform's central identity, validated end-to-end with Playwright personas."
msgstr "Mar riarthóir ardán de Infinito.Nexus, Ba mhaith liom [riachtanais uisce: measartha](https://jellyfin.org) comhtháite mar `web-app-jellyfin` ról le Keycloak-backed Aonair Cláraigh-Ar ionas gur féidir le húsáideoirí sruth an fhreastalaí meáin taobh thiar de féiniúlacht lárnach an ardán, bailíochtaithe deireadh-le-deireadh le personas Playwright."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want [Semaphore UI](https://github.com/semaphoreui/semaphore) integrated as a `web-app-semaphore` role with OpenID Connect (Keycloak) SSO and optional LDAP login so that operators can run Ansible / Terraform / OpenTofu / Bash automation from a web UI behind the platform's central Single Sign-On, reusing the central database, and validated end-to-end with Playwright personas."
msgstr "Mar riarthóir ardán de Infinito.Nexus, Ba mhaith liom [Semaphore Chomhéadain](https://github.com/semaphoreui/semaphore) comhtháite mar `web-app-semaphore` ról le OpenID Connect (Uisce agus Séarachas) SSO agus logáil isteach LDAP roghnach ionas gur féidir le hoibreoirí reáchtáil Uathoibriú Ansible / Terraform / OpenTofu / Bash ó Chomhéadain gréasáin taobh thiar de lár an ardán Aonair Cláraigh-Ar, athúsáid an bunachar sonraí lárnach, agus bailíochtaithe deireadh-le-deireadh le duine Playwrightas."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want a `svc-ai-robot` role that turns one dedicated machine into an embodied platform for Hermes, giving the agent scoped-to-full host access so it can explore its own hardware and act in the physical world, so that Hermes can \"come to life\" on a robot while this power stays confined to a dedicated, segmented device and never leaks onto shared infrastructure."
msgstr "Mar riarthóir ardán de Infinito.Nexus, Ba mhaith liom `svc-ai-robot` ról a casadh meaisín tiomanta amháin isteach i ardán chorprófar do Hermes, a thabhairt ar an gníomhaire raon feidhme-go-lán rochtain óstach ionas gur féidir é a iniúchadh a crua-earraí féin agus gníomhú ar fud an domhain fisiciúil, ionas gur féidir Hermes \"teacht ar an saol\" ar robot agus fanann an chumhacht teoranta do gléas tiomnaithe, deighilte agus ní sceitheadh ar bhonneagar roinnte."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want a `web-app-homeassistant` role that deploys [Home Assistant](https://www.home-assistant.io/) and exposes its native MCP server, so that agent employees (Hermes on a Pi, [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md)) and other MCP clients can control home devices as scoped MCP tools without any host access, making the \"isolated home assistant\" scenario concrete."
msgstr "Mar riarthóir ardán de Infinito.Nexus, Ba mhaith liom `web-app-homeassistant` ról a imscaradh [Baile Cúnta](https://www.home-assistant.io/) agus nochtann a fhreastalaí MCP dúchais, ionas go mbeidh fostaithe gníomhaire (Hermes ar Pi, [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md)) agus is féidir le cliaint MCP eile feistí baile a rialú mar uirlisí MCP raon feidhme gan aon rochtain óstach, a dhéanamh ar an \"cúntóir baile iargúlta\" coincréite scéal."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want a self-hostable `web-app-atmo` role that deploys an [atmo.rsvp](https://atmo.rsvp) instance (upstream [flo-bit/atmo-events](https://github.com/flo-bit/atmo-events), the successor to OpenMeet) wired to the platform's existing AT Protocol identity, and a bridge that mirrors calendar events between AT Protocol and Mobilizon, so that events created on my instance appear simultaneously on the AT Protocol (Bluesky) network and the ActivityPub (Fediverse) network from a single source of truth."
msgstr "Mar riarthóir ardán de Infinito.Nexus, Ba mhaith liom féin-óstach `web-app-atmo` ról a imscaradh [atmo.rsvp](https://atmo.rsvp) mar shampla (tréimhse saoil: ilbhliantúil [taiseachas aeir: fliuch](https://github.com/flo-bit/atmo-events), an comharba OpenMeet) sreangaithe le féiniúlacht Prótacail an ardáin atá ann cheana féin, agus droichead a dhíríonn ar imeachtaí féilire idir Prótacal AT agus Mobilizon, ionas go mbeidh imeachtaí a cruthaíodh ar mo shampla le feiceáil ag an am céanna ar Phrótacal an AT (taiseachas aeir: fliuch) líonra agus an GníomhaíochtPub (Feicsean) líonra ó fhoinse amháin na fírinne."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want a single OpenAI-compatible LLM gateway that routes to any model backend (local Ollama, LM Studio, OpenRouter, ...), so that every AI consumer (OpenWebUI, Flowise, and the agent employees in [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md)) targets one `/v1` endpoint and I swap or add model backends centrally without touching any consumer."
msgstr "Mar riarthóir ardán de Infinito.Nexus, Ba mhaith liom amháin OpenAI-comhoiriúnach LLM geata go bealaí chun aon samhail siar (Ollama áitiúil, LM Stiúideo, OpenRouter,...), ionas go mbeidh gach tomhaltóir AI (OpenWebUI, Flowise, agus na fostaithe gníomhaire i [032](032-agent-employees-firecracker.md)) spriocanna amháin `/v1` endpoint agus babhtála mé nó cuireann backends samhail lárnach gan touching aon tomhaltóir."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want every role with a documented Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface to expose or consume MCP through the platform's standard service, identity, proxy, and test contracts so that AI clients can use application data and actions safely without one-off per-role wiring."
msgstr "Mar riarthóir ardán de Infinito.Nexus, Ba mhaith liom gach ról le Prótacal Comhthéacs Múnla doiciméadaithe (MLA) dromchla a nochtadh nó a ithe MCP tríd an ardán seirbhíse caighdeánach, aitheantas, seachfhreastalaí, agus conarthaí tástála ionas gur féidir le cliaint AI úsáid sonraí iarratais agus gníomhartha go sábháilte gan aon-uaire in aghaidh an-ról sreangú."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want every role with an `application_id` to have an explicit, evidence-based MCP disposition and every suitable application to expose a narrowly curated MCP surface to Open WebUI, Flowise, n8n, and other approved clients so that applications can be connected without turning shared administrator credentials, raw infrastructure APIs, or arbitrary network access into agent tools."
msgstr "Mar riarthóir ardán de Infinito.Nexus, Ba mhaith liom gach ról le `application_id` a bheith acu sainráite, diúscairt MCP fianaise-bhunaithe agus gach iarratas oiriúnach a nochtadh dromchla MCP caol leasaithe go WebUI Oscailte, Flowise, n8n, agus cliaint ceadaithe eile ionas gur féidir iarratais a bheith ceangailte gan casadh dintiúir riarthóir roinnte, APIs bonneagar amh, nó rochtain líonra treallach isteach uirlisí gníomhaire."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want the `web-app-matrix` role to gain a second deployment flavor that delegates the heavy lifting to the upstream [matrix-docker-ansible-deploy](https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy) (MDAD) playbook, so that the full Matrix ecosystem — Synapse, Element, every supported bridge, Jitsi-backed video conferencing, ma1sd / Dimension / hookshot / etcetera — is available without the role re-implementing each service from scratch. The existing role-internal compose stack stays selectable as the `compose` flavor for one cycle, marked deprecated."
msgstr "Mar riarthóir ardán de Infinito.Nexus, Ba mhaith liom an `web-app-matrix` ról a fháil blas imscaradh dara a tharmligeans an ardú trom go dtí an sruth [maitrís-ddocker-inláimhsithe-imlonnú](https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy) (MDAD) playbook, ionas go mbeidh an t-éiceachóras Maitrís iomlán - Synapse, Element, gach droichead tacaithe, Jitsi-backed video giveencing, ma1sd / Toise / hookshot / etcetera - tá sé ar fáil gan an ról ath-fheidhmiú gach seirbhís ó scratch. Fanann an chairn róil-inmheánach atá ann cheana inroghnaithe mar an `compose` blas le haghaidh timthriall amháin, marcáilte dímheasta."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator of Infinito.Nexus, I want to deploy self-hostable AI agent platforms (Hermes Agent, OpenClaw) as kernel-isolated, scalable \"employees\" across my nodes, coordinated by a Flowise supervisor over MCP and routed to models through the [031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) gateway, so that I run a fleet of isolated agents with cross-agent pipelines and kernel-level isolation, without bespoke per-agent wiring."
msgstr "Mar riarthóir ardán de Infinito.Nexus, Ba mhaith liom ardáin gníomhaire AI féin-óstáil a imscaradh (Hermes Gníomhaire, OpenClaw) mar eithne-olated, inscálaithe \"employees\" ar fud mo nóid, comhordaithe ag maoirseoir Flowise thar MCP agus ród chuig samhlacha tríd an [031](031-llm-gateway-model-backends.md) geata, ionas go ritheann mé cabhlach de ghníomhairí iargúlta le píblínte tras-gníomhaire agus leithlisiú ar leibhéal eithne, gan sreangú in aghaidh an-gníomhaire."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a platform administrator, I want Infinito.Nexus to support multi-node Docker Swarm deployments with NFS-backed shared volumes, so that services can be rescheduled across nodes without losing persistent data, scaled horizontally, and updated with rolling updates — gaining high availability without introducing Kubernetes complexity."
msgstr "Mar riarthóir ardán, Ba mhaith liom Infinito.Nexus chun tacú le imscaradh il-node Docker Swarm le líon roinnte NFS-tacaíocht, ionas gur féidir seirbhísí a athsceidealú thar nóid gan chailliúint sonraí leanúnach, scála cothrománach, agus cothrom le dáta le nuashonruithe rollta - fháil ar fáil ard gan a thabhairt isteach Kubernetes chastacht."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a self-hoster running Infinito.Nexus behind NAT/CGNAT/dynamic IP (Raspberry Pi, edge node, home server), I want a `svc-net-tor` role that makes the node's primary domain a Tor v3 `.onion` address so that the entire stack (web, SSO, LDAP, CA) is reachable over Tor without public IP, port forwarding, VPS, or DynDNS — while individual apps can still attach extra public domains with their own TLS."
msgstr "Mar féin-óstach ag rith Infinito.Nexus taobh thiar de NAT/CGNAT/dynamic IP IP IP IP (Sú craobh Pi, nód imeall, freastalaí baile), Ba mhaith liom `svc-net-tor` ról a dhéanann an nód príomhfhearainn a Tor v3 `.onion` seoladh ionas go mbeidh an Stack ar fad (web, SSO, LDAP, CA) Is reachable thar Tor gan IP poiblí, port ar aghaidh, VPS, nó DynDNS - cé gur féidir apps aonair a cheangal go fóill réimsí poiblí breise lena TLS féin."

# libretranslate
msgid "As a server, each managed MCP Server Trigger workflow MUST:"
msgstr "Mar fhreastalaí, gach MUST Sreabhadh oibre MCP Freastalaí bhainistiú:"

# libretranslate
msgid "As a visitor of an Infinito.Nexus deployment, I want the documentation, the universal logout panel and the dashboard to speak my language from the core gettext catalogs, and I want browser apps such as MIG to be allowed to read the API, so that every surface core renders follows the same translations."
msgstr "Mar chuairteoir ar Infinito.Nexus imscaradh, Ba mhaith liom an doiciméadú, an painéal logout uilíoch agus an Painéal na nIonstraimí a labhairt mo theanga ó na catalóga croí gettext, agus ba mhaith liom apps bhrabhsálaí ar nós MIG a cheadú a léamh an API, ionas go mbeidh gach croí dromchla a leanas na haistriúcháin céanna."

# libretranslate
msgid "As an Infinito.Nexus administrator, I want [OpenBao](https://github.com/openbao/openbao) deployed as a `web-app-openbao` role with Keycloak OIDC login, group-mapped policies, persistent storage, automatic unsealing, backup and monitoring, so that infrastructure secrets, application credentials, certificates and tokens can be stored and retrieved centrally without distributing static secrets across systems."
msgstr "Mar an gcéanna Infinito.Nexus riarthóir, Ba mhaith liom [Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí](https://github.com/openbao/openbao) a imscaradh mar `web-app-openbao` ról le logáil isteach Keycloak OIDC, beartais grúpa-tábáilte, stóráil leanúnach, unsealing uathoibríoch, cúltaca agus monatóireacht, ionas gur féidir rúin bonneagair, dintiúir iarratais, deimhnithe agus comharthaí a stóráil agus a aisghabháil go lárnach gan rúin statach ar fud na gcóras a dháileadh."

# libretranslate
msgid "As an operator of a self-hosted deployment, I want every role whose application ships a native AI feature to reach the platform's own LiteLLM gateway instead of a third-party provider, so that prompts, documents and telemetry never leave the deployment and one credential rotation covers every application."
msgstr "Mar oibreoir imscaradh féin-óstach, ba mhaith liom gach ról a bhfuil longa iarratas gné AI dúchais chun teacht ar an ardán féin LiteLLM geata in ionad soláthraí tríú páirtí, ionas go mbeidh leideanna, doiciméid agus teiliméadracht riamh fhágáil ar an imscaradh agus clúdach rothlú dintiúir amháin gach iarratas."

# libretranslate
msgid "As the conversation grows, the agent MUST proactively suggest a higher tier. Base the estimate on observable signals: message count, response sizes, and whether context compression has been triggered by the system."
msgstr "Mar a fhásann an comhrá, MUST an gníomhaire le fios go réamhghníomhach sraith níos airde. Bonn an meastachán ar comharthaí inbhraite: comhaireamh teachtaireacht, méideanna freagartha, agus cibé an bhfuil comhbhrú comhthéacs spreagtha ag an gcóras."

# libretranslate
msgid "Ask Permissions ⚠️"
msgstr "Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí"

# libretranslate
msgid "Ask the docker daemon what a replay is allowed to touch."
msgstr "Iarr ar an daemon docker cad a bhfuil replay ceadaithe chun teagmháil a dhéanamh."

# libretranslate
msgid "Assemble the healthcheck mapping."
msgstr "Assemble an léarscáiliú healthcheck."

# libretranslate
msgid "Assemble the shared context for a network lookup."
msgstr "Assemble an comhthéacs roinnte le haghaidh Lookup líonra."

# libretranslate
msgid "Assertion at the gate"
msgstr "Assertion ag an geata"

# libretranslate
msgid "Asset Mirror (Privacy Proxy)"
msgstr "Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí (Príobháideacht Proxy)"

# libretranslate
msgid "Assets Server"
msgstr "Sócmhainní Freastalaí"

# libretranslate
msgid "Assets are stored on the filesystem backend (`PENPOT_ASSETS_STORAGE_BACKEND=assets-fs`) on the backup-ready named volume `penpot_assets`, mounted into both `frontend` and `backend` at `/opt/data/assets`."
msgstr "Sócmhainní a stóráil ar chúlchóras an chomhaid (`PENPOT_ASSETS_STORAGE_BACKEND=assets-fs`) ar an toirt cúltaca-réidh ainmnithe `penpot_assets`, suite isteach sa dá `frontend` agus `backend` ag an `/opt/data/assets`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Assets are stored on the filesystem backend (``PENPOT_ASSETS_STORAGE_BACKEND=assets-fs``) on the backup-ready named volume ``penpot_assets``, mounted into both ``frontend`` and ``backend`` at ``/opt/data/assets``."
msgstr "Sócmhainní a stóráil ar chúlchóras an chomhaid (``PENPOT_ASSETS_STORAGE_BACKEND=assets-fs``) ar an toirt cúltaca-réidh ainmnithe ``penpot_assets``, suite isteach sa dá ``frontend`` agus ``backend`` ag an ``/opt/data/assets``."

# libretranslate
msgid "Assets do not update after a deployment."
msgstr "Ní dhéanann sócmhainní cothrom le dáta tar éis imscaradh."

# libretranslate
msgid "Assign exactly one workspace track to every dev-runtime image."
msgstr "Sann díreach rian spás oibre amháin do gach íomhá dev-runtime."

# libretranslate
msgid "Assign the deploy axes to CI matrix rows."
msgstr "Sann na haiseanna imscaradh le sraitheanna maitrís CI."

# libretranslate
msgid "Assistant via `integration_openai`"
msgstr "Cúntóir via `integration_openai`"

# libretranslate
msgid "Associations, NGOs, and online communities looking to build independent digital spaces."
msgstr "Cumainn, eagraíochtaí neamhrialtasacha, agus pobail ar líne ag iarraidh spásanna digiteacha neamhspleácha a thógáil."

# libretranslate
msgid "Assuming every job burns its full timeout is deliberately pessimistic — no job can outlast it — so the estimate can only overshoot the real drain time. With the current constants that is 4 waves of 20 runners, so 80 rows per chunk, and the last job of a chunk starts around t=18h, well inside the 24h window."
msgstr "Ag glacadh le gach post dónna go bhfuil a timeout iomlán pessimistic d'aon ghnó - ní féidir aon phost outlast sé - mar sin is féidir leis an meastachán overshoot ach an t-am draein fíor. Leis na tairiseacha atá ann faoi láthair atá 4 tonnta na 20 dara háit, mar sin 80 sraitheanna in aghaidh smután, agus tosaíonn an post deireanach de shmután timpeall t =18h, go maith taobh istigh den 24h fuinneog."

# libretranslate
msgid "Assumption 10: `~/.ssh` is intentionally readable to allow `git push` on `ask` 🔑"
msgstr "Tomhaltas 10: `~/.ssh` is inléite d'aon ghnó a cheadú `git push` ar aghaidh `ask` Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí"

# libretranslate
msgid "Assumption 1: The sandbox backend is installed and functional ⚙️"
msgstr "Tomhaltas 1: Tá an backend bosca gainimh suiteáilte agus feidhmiúil"

# libretranslate
msgid "Assumption 2: `sandbox.filesystem.allowWrite` is the authoritative write boundary ✍️"
msgstr "Tomhaltas 2: `sandbox.filesystem.allowWrite` Is é an údarásach scríobh teorainn †"

# libretranslate
msgid "Assumption 3: The host runs only test workloads 🧪"
msgstr "Tomhaltas 3: Ritheann an óstach ach ualach oibre tástála"

# libretranslate
msgid "Assumption 4: Operators review `ask` prompts before approval 👀"
msgstr "Tomhaltas 4: Athbhreithniú oibreoirí `ask` leideanna roimh cheadú"

# libretranslate
msgid "Assumption 5: DinD ask-gates are comfort thresholds, not hard barriers 🐳"
msgstr "Tomhaltas 5: DinD iarraidh-gheataí Tá tairseacha chompord, ní bacainní crua"

# libretranslate
msgid "Assumption 6: Access to `/var/run/docker.sock` equals host root 🔓"
msgstr "Tomhaltas 6: Rochtain ar `/var/run/docker.sock` comhionanna óstach fréamh"

# libretranslate
msgid "Assumption 7: The `Makefile` is peer-reviewed and trusted 🔧"
msgstr "Tomhaltas 7: An `Makefile` Tá piaraí-athbhreithnithe agus muiníneach LIF"

# libretranslate
msgid "Assumption 8: Shell control-flow loops are never necessary 🔁"
msgstr "Tomhaltas 8: Ní gá lúbanna Sreabhadh rialú Shell"

# libretranslate
msgid "Assumption 9: `denyRead` lists every credential directory 🔐"
msgstr "Tomhaltas 9: `denyRead` Liostaíonn gach eolaire dintiúir"

# libretranslate
msgid "At boot, ``files/mcp-api-token.groovy`` runs from ``init.groovy.d`` and mints an API token named ``infinito-mcp`` for the administrator account, writing the plain value to ``/var/jenkins_home/secrets/infinito-mcp.token``. ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` then reads that value out of the container, persists it through ``sys-token-store``, and hard-fails the deploy when the controller rejects it. ``MCP_DISCOVERED_SERVERS`` picks the token up from the store and the client roles build the header via the ``mcp_authorization`` filter."
msgstr "Ag tosaithe, ``files/mcp-api-token.groovy`` Ritheann ó ``init.groovy.d`` agus mints chomhartha API ainmnithe ``infinito-mcp`` don chuntas riarthóir, scríobh an luach plain chun ``/var/jenkins_home/secrets/infinito-mcp.token``. ``tasks/utils/mcp.yml`` ansin léann an luach as an gcoimeádán, leanann sé tríd ``sys-token-store``, agus crua-fails an imscaradh nuair a dhiúltaíonn an rialtóir é. ``MCP_DISCOVERED_SERVERS`` picks an chomhartha suas as an siopa agus na róil cliant a thógáil ar an header tríd an ``mcp_authorization`` scagaire."

# libretranslate
msgid "At boot, `files/mcp-api-token.groovy` runs from `init.groovy.d` and mints an API token named `infinito-mcp` for the administrator account, writing the plain value to `/var/jenkins_home/secrets/infinito-mcp.token`. `tasks/utils/mcp.yml` then reads that value out of the container, persists it through `sys-token-store`, and hard-fails the deploy when the controller rejects it. `MCP_DISCOVERED_SERVERS` picks the token up from the store and the client roles build the header via the `mcp_authorization` filter."
msgstr "Ag tosaithe, `files/mcp-api-token.groovy` Ritheann ó `init.groovy.d` agus mints chomhartha API ainmnithe `infinito-mcp` don chuntas riarthóir, scríobh an luach plain chun `/var/jenkins_home/secrets/infinito-mcp.token`. `tasks/utils/mcp.yml` ansin léann an luach as an gcoimeádán, leanann sé tríd `sys-token-store`, agus crua-fails an imscaradh nuair a dhiúltaíonn an rialtóir é. `MCP_DISCOVERED_SERVERS` picks an chomhartha suas as an siopa agus na róil cliant a thógáil ar an header tríd an `mcp_authorization` scagaire."

# libretranslate
msgid "At most one entity per role carries `run_after` and `lifecycle`. Putting these fields on a non-primary entity fails the lint."
msgstr "Ag an chuid is mó eintiteas amháin in aghaidh an róil `run_after` agus `lifecycle`. Ag cur na réimsí seo ar eintiteas neamh-bhunscoile theipeann ar an lint."

# libretranslate
msgid "At the **start of every conversation**, before doing any other work, the agent MUST display the following block verbatim (substituting the active mode if it has been changed by the user):"
msgstr "Ag an **tús gach comhrá**, sula ndéanann sé aon obair eile, léiríonn an gníomhaire MUST an bloc seo a leanas verbatim (in ionad an modh gníomhach má tá sé athraithe ag an úsáideoir):"

# libretranslate
msgid "At the start of every conversation, the agent MUST check whether agent skills are installed by verifying that `.agents/skills/` exists and is non-empty. If skills are missing, the agent MUST notify the user once with:"
