# libretranslate
msgid "Baserow"
msgstr "bláthanna cumhra: cumhráin"

# libretranslate
msgid "Baserow documents a native built-in MCP server."
msgstr "Doiciméid Baserow ó dhúchas-tógtha i freastalaí MCP."

# libretranslate
msgid "Baserow requires Django `SECRET_KEY` for correct backend operation (e.g., JWT, sessions). This role reads it from `credentials.secret_key` and writes it into the container environment file."
msgstr "Éilíonn Based Django `SECRET_KEY` le haghaidh oibriú ceart cúltaca (e.g., JWT, seisiúin). Léann an ról seo é ó `credentials.secret_key` agus scríobhann sé isteach sa chomhad timpeallacht coimeádán."

# libretranslate
msgid "Baserow requires Django ``SECRET_KEY`` for correct backend operation (e.g., JWT, sessions). This role reads it from ``credentials.secret_key`` and writes it into the container environment file."
msgstr "Éilíonn Based Django ``SECRET_KEY`` le haghaidh oibriú ceart cúltaca (e.g., JWT, seisiúin). Léann an ról seo é ó ``credentials.secret_key`` agus scríobhann sé isteach sa chomhad timpeallacht coimeádán."

# libretranslate
msgid "Baserow ships a native MCP server in the OSS backend, mounted on the ASGI root ahead of Django. Clients do not reach it. The role runs it as the *upstream* of a [`svc-ai-mcp-adapter`](../svc-ai-mcp-adapter/README.md) sidecar (`classification: adapter_server`), and the sidecar is the only MCP surface a consumer is given."
msgstr "Longa Baserow freastalaí MCP dúchais i chúl an OSS, suite ar an fhréamh ASGI roimh Django. Níl cliaint a bhaint amach. Ritheann an ról mar *tréimhse saoil: ilbhliantúil* de [`svc-ai-mcp-adapter`](../svc-ai-mcp-adapter/README.md) taobh istigh (`classification: adapter_server`), agus is é an taobhcharr an t-aon dromchla MCP a thugtar tomhaltóir."

# libretranslate
msgid "Baserow ships a native MCP server in the OSS backend, mounted on the ASGI root ahead of Django. Clients do not reach it. The role runs it as the *upstream* of a ```svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` <../svc-ai-mcp-adapter/README.md>`__ sidecar (``classification: adapter_server``), and the sidecar is the only MCP surface a consumer is given."
msgstr "Longa Baserow freastalaí MCP dúchais i chúl an OSS, suite ar an fhréamh ASGI roimh Django. Níl cliaint a bhaint amach. Ritheann an ról mar *tréimhse saoil: ilbhliantúil* de ```svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` <../svc-ai-mcp-adapter/README.md>`__ sidecar (``classification: adapter_server``), agus is é an taobhcharr an t-aon dromchla MCP a thugtar tomhaltóir."

# libretranslate
