msgstr "Gliú Bash taobh thiar de na spriocanna a dhéanamh (úr / athúsáid / leaganacha purge)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Basic shell/Python helper tooling used by scripts"
msgstr "bhlaosc bunúsach / pithon tooling cabhrach a úsáidtear ag scripteanna"

# libretranslate
msgid "Be idempotent (re-running the same cleanup MUST NOT error: a second delete on an already-gone resource MUST be a no-op)."
msgstr "Bí slántach (ath-reáchtáil an glanadh céanna NACH earráid: an dara scriosadh ar acmhainn cheana féin-aon MUST a bheith ina aon-op)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Because Bash is allowed wholesale, the operational safety of shell invocations rests on three layers, in order of precedence:"
msgstr "Toisc go bhfuil Bash ceadaithe mórdhíola, tá sábháilteacht oibriúcháin na n-invocations bhlaosc ar thrí shraith, in ord tosaíochta:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Because Jellyfin has no native SSO and its apps use API tokens, the **LDAP plugin against the central `svc-db-openldap`** is the \"works everywhere\" path — closest in spirit to roles that consume central LDAP. The optional OIDC web-SSO plugin maps to the platform Keycloak."
msgstr "Toisc nach bhfuil aon SSO dúchais ag Jellyfin agus go n-úsáideann a apps comharthaí API, na **LDAP breiseán i gcoinne an lárnach `svc-db-openldap`** Is é an \"oibreacha i ngach áit\" cosán - is gaire i spiorad do róil a ithe LDAP lárnach. An OIDC gréasáin-SSO roghnach léarscáileanna breiseán ar an ardán Keycloak."

# libretranslate
msgid "Because no stack service exists, the swarm test gates that poll ``docker service ls`` (``converge``, ``seed``, ``drain``, ``assert``) skip themselves via the ``workload: node-local`` declaration (``scripts/tests/deploy/swarm/utils/_context.sh`` maps ``node-local`` to ``HAS_SWARM_SERVICE=false``); the deploy itself, the registry distribution chain and the CLI e2e suite run in full."
msgstr "Toisc go bhfuil aon seirbhís chairn, na geataí tástála Swarm go vótaíocht ``docker service ls`` (``converge``, ``seed``, ``drain``, ``assert``) skip iad féin tríd an ``workload: node-local`` dearbhú (``scripts/tests/deploy/swarm/utils/_context.sh`` Léarscáileanna ``node-local`` go dtí ``HAS_SWARM_SERVICE=false``); an imscaradh féin, an slabhra dáileadh clár agus an CLI e2e sraith reáchtáil go hiomlán."

# libretranslate
msgid "Because no stack service exists, the swarm test gates that poll `docker service ls` (`converge`, `seed`, `drain`, `assert`) skip themselves via the `workload: node-local` declaration (`scripts/tests/deploy/swarm/utils/_context.sh` maps `node-local` to `HAS_SWARM_SERVICE=false`); the deploy itself, the registry distribution chain and the CLI e2e suite run in full."
msgstr "Toisc go bhfuil aon seirbhís chairn, na geataí tástála Swarm go vótaíocht `docker service ls` (`converge`, `seed`, `drain`, `assert`) skip iad féin tríd an `workload: node-local` dearbhú (`scripts/tests/deploy/swarm/utils/_context.sh` Léarscáileanna `node-local` go dtí `HAS_SWARM_SERVICE=false`); an imscaradh féin, an slabhra dáileadh clár agus an CLI e2e sraith reáchtáil go hiomlán."

# libretranslate
msgid "Because that grant is irreversible once the container starts, the checks run inside the agent role before it deploys, not afterwards in this role: the agent is a shared service, so the service loader brings it up in the constructor stage while ``svc-ai`` roles only run at the following step. A check placed here would sit behind the deployment it exists to prevent."
msgstr "Toisc nach bhfuil an deontas sin dochúlaithe nuair a thosaíonn an coimeádán, reáchtáiltear na seiceálacha laistigh de ról an ghníomhaire sula n-imsíonn sé, ní ina dhiaidh sin sa ról seo: is seirbhís chomhroinnte é an gníomhaire, mar sin tugann an t-ualach seirbhíse é suas sa chéim tógálaí agus é á thógáil ``svc-ai`` róil reáchtáil ach ag an gcéim seo a leanas. Bheadh seiceáil a chuirtear anseo suí taobh thiar den imscaradh ann chun cosc a chur."

# libretranslate
msgid "Because that grant is irreversible once the container starts, the checks run inside the agent role before it deploys, not afterwards in this role: the agent is a shared service, so the service loader brings it up in the constructor stage while `svc-ai` roles only run at the following step. A check placed here would sit behind the deployment it exists to prevent."
msgstr "Toisc nach bhfuil an deontas sin dochúlaithe nuair a thosaíonn an coimeádán, reáchtáiltear na seiceálacha laistigh de ról an ghníomhaire sula n-imsíonn sé, ní ina dhiaidh sin sa ról seo: is seirbhís chomhroinnte é an gníomhaire, mar sin tugann an t-ualach seirbhíse é suas sa chéim tógálaí agus é á thógáil `svc-ai` róil reáchtáil ach ag an gcéim seo a leanas. Bheadh seiceáil a chuirtear anseo suí taobh thiar den imscaradh ann chun cosc a chur."

# libretranslate
msgid "Because the lookup emits ``$(...)`` shell syntax, callers MUST use the ``ansible.builtin.shell`` module (not ``command``) for the surrounding ``container exec`` invocation. A companion lint rule enforces this."
msgstr "Mar astaíonn an Lookup ``$(...)`` syntax bhlaosc, callers MUST úsáid a bhaint as an ``ansible.builtin.shell`` modúlach (bláthanna cumhra: aon cumhráin ``command``) le haghaidh an máguaird ``container exec`` sonrascadh. Forfheidhmíonn riail lint chompánach seo."

# libretranslate
msgid "Because the pins use the same `(repository, ref)` shape as every other `meta/services.yml`, the existing `update-repository-refs` CI job discovers them on its own: it resolves the newest semver tag of each repository via `git ls-remote --tags` and opens a pull request with the bump. Upgrading a linter is therefore a reviewed commit, not a surprise."
msgstr "Toisc go n-úsáideann na bioráin mar an gcéanna `(repository, ref)` cruth mar gach eile `meta/services.yml`, na láithreacha `update-repository-refs` Faigheann CI post iad ar a chuid féin: réitíonn sé an chlib is nua de gach stór trí `git ls-remote --tags` agus osclaíonn iarratas tarraingt leis an bump. Dá bhrí sin, tá athghrádú a dhéanamh ar linter, ní iontas."

# libretranslate
msgid "Because the pins use the same ``(repository, ref)`` shape as every other ``meta/services.yml``, the existing ``update-repository-refs`` CI job discovers them on its own: it resolves the newest semver tag of each repository via ``git ls-remote --tags`` and opens a pull request with the bump. Upgrading a linter is therefore a reviewed commit, not a surprise."
msgstr "Toisc go n-úsáideann na bioráin mar an gcéanna ``(repository, ref)`` cruth mar gach eile ``meta/services.yml``, na láithreacha ``update-repository-refs`` Faigheann CI post iad ar a chuid féin: réitíonn sé an chlib is nua de gach stór trí ``git ls-remote --tags`` agus osclaíonn iarratas tarraingt leis an bump. Dá bhrí sin, tá athghrádú a dhéanamh ar linter, ní iontas."

# libretranslate
msgid "Because the same variant can run several times in one sweep, the onion state is part of what identifies a job: it is in the job label (`🧅` vs `🌐`) and in every artifact name. Two jobs uploading under one artifact name is a conflict, not an overwrite. The distro, filesystem and architecture glyphs follow it in the label (`🐳🧅🌀🦓🦾`), so a title says which combination died without opening the job."
msgstr "Toisc gur féidir leis an leagan céanna a reáchtáil arís agus arís eile i scuab amháin, tá an stát oinniún mar chuid de cad aithníonn post: tá sé sa lipéad poist (`🧅` vs `🌐`) agus i ngach ainm Déantán. Dhá post uaslódáil faoi ainm Déantán amháin is coimhlint, ní overwrite. An distro, córas comhaid agus glyphs ailtireacht leanúint sé sa lipéad (`🐳🧅🌀🦓🦾`), mar sin deir teideal a fuair bás meascán gan oscailt an post."

# libretranslate
msgid "Before EVERY `compose-deploy` that follows a failed deploy, you MUST emit one explicit line, and it MUST be one of exactly two forms — no third option:"
msgstr "Roimh an `compose-deploy` a leanann imscaradh theip, MUST tú scaoileann líne sainráite amháin, agus MUST sé a bheith ar cheann de go díreach dhá fhoirm - aon tríú rogha:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Before adding or editing a workflow file:"
msgstr "Roimh comhad sreabhadh oibre a chur leis nó a chur in eagar:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Before any implementation work, the agent MUST read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and follow it, then [Role Loop](../agents/action/iteration/compose.md) and the [Playwright spec contract](../contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md)."
msgstr "Roimh aon obair a chur i bhfeidhm, léigh an gníomhaire MUST [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) agus é a leanúint, ansin [Naisc ábhartha eile](../agents/action/iteration/compose.md) agus an [Conradh spec Playwright](../contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md)."

# libretranslate
#, no-python-format
msgid "Before every redeploy you MUST fully resolve the failure and reach at least **95% confidence that your fix actually fixes it**. That confidence MUST come from in-container inspection (`make compose-exec` / `make compose-inner-run`): reproduce the failure, walk the fix path, and confirm the corrected behaviour. Never redeploy on a guess."
msgstr "Roimh gach redeploy tú MUST réiteach go hiomlán ar an teip agus teacht ar a laghad **95% muinín a shocraíonn do shocrú iarbhír é**. Go MÓR muinín teacht ó iniúchadh in-atá (`make compose-exec` / Baile `make compose-inner-run`): atáirgeadh ar an teip, siúl ar an cosán a shocrú, agus an t-iompar ceartaithe a dheimhniú. Ná ath-imlonnú ar buille faoi thuairim."

# libretranslate
#, no-python-format
msgid "Before every redeploy you MUST fully resolve the failure in swarm and reach at least **95% confidence that your fix actually fixes it**. That confidence MUST come from inspecting the live cluster in-container: reproduce the failure, walk the fix path, and confirm the corrected behaviour on the running services. Never redeploy on a guess — a swarm redeploy costs tens of minutes."
msgstr "Roimh gach ath-imlonnú tú MUST réiteach go hiomlán ar an teip i swarm agus teacht ar a laghad **95% muinín a shocraíonn do shocrú iarbhír é**. Go MUST muinín teacht ó iniúchadh a dhéanamh ar an mbraisle beo in-tainer: atáirgeadh an teip, siúl ar an cosán a shocrú, agus an t-iompar ceartaithe ar na seirbhísí ag rith. Ná ath-imlonnú ar buille faoi thuairim - a redeploy swarm costais deich nóiméad."

# libretranslate
msgid "Before implementation, the agent MUST read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md), the target role's `AGENTS.md` when present, [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../CONTRIBUTING.md), and the repository's agent and contributor guidance. Any upstream capability MUST be verified against the exact image tag, source tag, or commit selected by the implementation; current documentation or a newer upstream release is not evidence for the deployed pin."
msgstr "Roimh chur i bhfeidhm, léigh an gníomhaire MUST [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md), an ról sprioc ar `AGENTS.md` nuair atá sé i láthair, [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../CONTRIBUTING.md), agus gníomhaire agus treoir rannchuiditheora an stór. Aon acmhainneacht réamhtheachtach MUST a fhíorú i gcoinne an chlib íomhá bheacht, chlib foinse, nó tiomantas roghnaithe ag an gcur chun feidhme; Ní doiciméadú reatha nó scaoileadh níos nuaí réamhtheachtach fianaise don bioráin imscaradh."

msgid "Before implementation, the agent MUST read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md), then [Compose Loop](../agents/action/iteration/compose.md), [Swarm Loop](../agents/action/iteration/swarm.md), [deployment-modes.md](../contributing/design/deployment-modes.md), the [Playwright contract](../contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md), and the IAM pages [common.md](../contributing/design/iam/common.md), [oidc.md](../contributing/design/iam/oidc.md) and [rbac.md](../contributing/design/iam/rbac.md)."
msgstr ""

