# libretranslate
msgid "Before modifying any file in this role, you MUST explain to the user why the change is necessary and ask for explicit confirmation."
msgstr "Sula ndéantar aon chomhad a mhodhnú sa ról seo, míníonn tú don úsáideoir cén fáth go bhfuil an t-athrú riachtanach agus iarr deimhniú sainráite."

# libretranslate
msgid "Before modifying any file under `roles/<role>/`, check for `roles/<role>/AGENTS.md`. If present, read and follow it (including any file-scoped subsections) before any change."
msgstr "Sula ndéantar aon chomhad a mhodhnú faoi `roles/<role>/`, seiceáil le haghaidh `roles/<role>/AGENTS.md`. Má tá sé i láthair, é a léamh agus a leanúint (lena n-áirítear aon fho-ailt chomhadcóipthe) roimh aon athrú."

# libretranslate
msgid "Before reporting the task complete, you MUST verify the spec against a running stack, not against file contents alone. Static file review misses navigation and auth bugs that only surface in the browser."
msgstr "Roimh tuairisciú an tasc iomlán, MUST tú a fhíorú an spec i gcoinne Stack ag rith, ní i gcoinne ábhar comhaid ina n-aonar. Cailleann athbhreithniú comhad statach nascleanúint agus bugs auth go dromchla ach amháin sa bhrabhsálaí."

# libretranslate
msgid "Before running workflows you MUST configure the required secrets and credentials for the repository. This includes GHCR authentication for pushing and publishing container images. See [authentication.md](tools/ghcr/authentication.md) for the full setup guide."
msgstr "Sula sreabhadh oibre ag rith tú MUST chumrú na rúin agus dintiúir is gá don stór. Áirítear leis seo fíordheimhnithe GHCR chun íomhánna coimeádán a bhrú agus a fhoilsiú. Féach ar [authentication.md](tools/ghcr/authentication.md) don treoir thus iomlán."

# libretranslate
msgid "Before starting any implementation work, the agent MUST read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and follow all instructions in it."
msgstr "Sula dtosaíonn tú ar aon obair chur i bhfeidhm, léigh an gníomhaire MUST [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) agus lean na treoracha go léir ann."

# libretranslate
msgid "Before starting implementation work, the agent MUST read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and follow all instructions in it."
msgstr "Sula dtosaíonn tú ar obair chur i bhfeidhm, léigh an gníomhaire MUST [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) agus lean na treoracha go léir ann."

# libretranslate
msgid "Before starting the loop, you MUST propose disabling all non-necessary services via the `disable=` make arg to reduce resource usage. In the typical case, this means keeping only the database and disabling everything else. Only proceed without this proposal if the user has already confirmed a full-stack setup."
msgstr "Sula dtosaíonn tú ar an lúb, moltar duit gach seirbhís neamhriachtanach a dhíchumasú tríd an lúb `disable=` a dhéanamh arg a laghdú úsáid acmhainní. Sa chás tipiciúil, ciallaíonn sé seo a choinneáil ach an bunachar sonraí agus gach rud eile a dhíchumasú. Ní rachaidh sé ar aghaidh gan an togra seo ach amháin má dhearbhaigh an t-úsáideoir tacar lánchéime cheana féin."

# libretranslate
msgid "Before the full pipeline runs, CI detects the scope of the PR based on the changed files and the branch prefix (see [branch.md](branch.md))."
msgstr "Sula ritheann an píblíne iomlán, CI bhrath raon feidhme an PR bunaithe ar na comhaid athraithe agus an réimír brainse (féach ar [branch.md](branch.md))."

# libretranslate
msgid "Before touching the tree"
msgstr "Roimh touching an crann"

# libretranslate
msgid "Before triggering, capture the currently latest run id for this workflow+branch as `<prev-run-id>` (empty string if none exists). This is required so the post-trigger resolve can distinguish the new run from any stale completed run on the same branch:"
