# libretranslate
msgid "Best-effort: the puppeteer browser is not downloaded here (``PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD``) so ``install-lint`` stays sandbox-safe. mmdc only needs a browser to RENDER, which ``scripts/lint/mermaid.sh`` provisions on demand (``npx puppeteer browsers install chrome-headless-shell``) right before it renders. That browser ships as a zip, so ``unzip`` is ensured here (puppeteer's extractor needs it, else it leaves an empty version dir and mmdc reports the browser missing). A failed install warns instead of aborting ``install-lint``, so sandboxes without npm/browser access still get the rest of the lint toolchain."
msgstr "Fearr-ffort: nach bhfuil an bhrabhsálaí puipéad íoslódáil anseo (``PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD``) amhlaidh ``install-lint`` fanacht bosca gainimh-sábháilte. mmdc riachtanais ach brabhsálaí go RENDER, a ``scripts/lint/mermaid.sh`` forálacha maidir le héileamh (``npx puppeteer browsers install chrome-headless-shell``) ceart sula ndéanann sé. Go longa bhrabhsálaí mar zip, mar sin ``unzip`` a chinntiú anseo (Éilíonn sliocht puipéadóra é, eile fágann sé dir leagan folamh agus tuarascálacha mmdc an bhrabhsálaí ar iarraidh). A theip ar shuiteáil warns in ionad aborting ``install-lint``, mar sin sandboxes gan rochtain npm / bhrabhsálaí a fháil fós ar an gcuid eile den toolchain lint."

