# libretranslate
msgid "Biber is blocked by `$wgPluggableAuth_EnableAutoLogin`, which this role sets to true in `vars/main.yml`: every anonymous request is bounced straight back into the identity provider, so the verified unauthenticated landing after in-app logout that the persona contract demands can never be observed here. The path back to the generic personas is either auto-login off, or a deploy step that promotes the OIDC-provisioned administrator account to sysop."
msgstr "Tá Biber blocáilte ag `$wgPluggableAuth_EnableAutoLogin`, a leagann an ról seo chun fíor i `vars/main.yml`: Tá gach iarratas gan ainm Preabd díreach ar ais isteach sa soláthraí aitheantais, mar sin an tuirlingt fíordheimhnithe unauthenticated tar éis logáil isteach i bhfeidhm nach féidir éilimh an chonartha persona a urramú anseo. Is é an cosán ar ais go dtí an personas cineálach ceachtar auto-login amach, nó céim imscaradh a chuireann an cuntas riarthóir OIDC-provisioned chuig sysop."

# libretranslate
