# libretranslate
msgid "By default — for an **untrusted** fork PR — the privileged `pull_request_target` build checks out the **base merge ref** (`refs/pull/<N>/merge`) from the base repository: the PR's changes merged onto base, with all workflow and build-orchestration scripts coming from base, never from the fork. Because `actions/checkout` otherwise refuses to fetch a PR ref under `pull_request_target`, the source checkout sets `allow-unsafe-pr-checkout: true`. The untrusted build runs **without organization secrets** — `secrets: inherit` is not passed and it authenticates to GHCR with the per-job `GITHUB_TOKEN` only, so a malicious fork cannot read repository/organization secrets. (The `pull_request_target` token still carries `packages: write`, so the `🛡️ Trusted` label remains the real trust boundary for anything beyond image publication.)"
msgstr "De réir réamhshocraithe — le haghaidh **taiseachas aeir: fliuch** forc PR — an phribhléid `pull_request_target` seiceálacha a thógáil amach **bonn merge ref** (`refs/pull/<N>/merge`) ón stór bonn: na hathruithe PR chumasc isteach bonn, le gach sreabhadh oibre agus a thógáil-orchestration scripteanna ag teacht ó bonn, riamh as an forc. Mar gheall ar `actions/checkout` ar shlí eile a dhiúltóidh a rachadh athshocrú PR faoi `pull_request_target`, Leagann an Seiceáil foinse `allow-unsafe-pr-checkout: true`. Ritheann an tógáil untrusted **gan rúin eagraíochta** — — — — `secrets: inherit` nach bhfuil a rith agus fíordheimhnithe sé GHCR leis an in aghaidh an-job `GITHUB_TOKEN` ach, mar sin ní féidir le forc mailíseach léamh rúin stór / eagrúcháin. (An bhfuil `pull_request_target` chomhartha iompar go fóill `packages: write`, mar sin an `🛡️ Trusted` Tá lipéad fós an teorainn fíor-iontaoibh le haghaidh aon rud níos faide ná foilsiú íomhá.)"

