# libretranslate
msgid "CA-trust and OIDC-over-self-signed-TLS hardening: the internal CA is installed into the OS bundle for PHP libcurl OIDC (*web-app-pixelfed*, *web-app-joomla*, plus a WordPress must-use plugin), the CA-trust wrapper is kept on probe timeout instead of degrading to env-only, and the CA injection is bounded so it cannot hang the handler. HSTS is now emitted on every response including non-2xx, *ansible-vault encrypt_string* reads plaintext from stdin so leading-dash values encrypt, and Mastodon allows inline *script-src-elem* for its server-rendered SPA."
msgstr "CA-iontaobhas agus OIDC-thar-féin-sínithe-TLS hardening: Tá an CA inmheánach suiteáilte isteach i bundle OS do PHP libcurl OIDC (*web-app-pixelfed*, *web development*, móide WordPress Ní mór-úsáid breiseán), coimeádtar an fillteán CA-iontaobhas ar probe timeout in ionad táireach go env-amháin, agus tá an t-instealladh CA faoi cheangal mar sin ní féidir leis an láimhseálaí a chrochadh. Tá HSTS astaítear anois ar gach freagra lena n-áirítear neamh-2xx, *ansible-vault encrypt_string* léann plaintext ó stdin mar sin le rá-dash luachanna criptithe, agus ceadaíonn Mastodon inlíne *scripteanna agus aincheist* as a fhreastalaí-rendered SPA."

