# libretranslate
msgid "Checkmk Raw bundles its own monitoring core (Nagios), RRD storage, and an Apache-served web GUI, so it needs no external database. All state lives on one persistent volume mounted at `/omd/sites`, and the GUI is served under the OMD site path (`/cmk/check_mk/`). The image is pinned to `checkmk/check-mk-raw:2.4.0p32` in `meta/services.yml`; Checkmk renamed the Raw image to `check-mk-community` from 2.5, so bump the tag only after reviewing the upstream [version notes](https://docs.checkmk.com/latest/en/cmk_versions.html)."
msgstr "Seiceáil bundles amh a chroí monatóireachta féin (Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí), stóráil RRD, agus GUI gréasáin Apache tuillte, mar sin ní mór é aon bhunachar sonraí seachtrach. Gach saol stáit ar aon toirt leanúnach suite ag `/omd/sites`, agus tá an GUI sheirbheáil faoi cosán láithreán OMD (`/cmk/check_mk/`). Tá an íomhá pinned go `checkmk/check-mk-raw:2.4.0p32` i `meta/services.yml`; Seiceáil athainmníodh an íomhá Raw a `check-mk-community` ó 2.5, mar sin bump an chlib ach amháin tar éis athbhreithniú a dhéanamh ar an sruth [nótaí leagan](https://docs.checkmk.com/latest/en/cmk_versions.html)."

