# libretranslate
msgid "Cleanup 🗑️"
msgstr "Glanadh an leathanaigh"

# libretranslate
msgid "Cleanup-workflow fixes (follow-up to the 11.1.0 cleanup automation): the *crs-k/stale-branches* action is pinned to *v9.0.1* (the previous *@v8* was unresolvable and failed the job) and its non-existent *protected-branches* input is replaced with the action's real *branches-filter-regex*; the GHCR CI-image cleanup script now reports what it scans, keeps and deletes with a per-package summary and a *DRY_RUN* mode, so a no-op run is no longer indistinguishable from a broken one."
msgstr "Glanadh-sreabhadh oibre (lean-suas go dtí an 11.1.0 uathoibriú glanta): an *crs-k / brainse* Tá gníomh pinned *v v v v v v9.0.1* (roimhe seo *Cuntas deimhnithe8* Bhí inréitithe agus theip ar an bpost) agus a neamh-ann *brainse cosanta* ionchur in ionad an gníomh ar fíor *brainsí-scagaire-regex*; an GHCR CI-image cleanup script tuarascálacha anois cad scans sé, Coinníonn agus a scriosadh le achoimre per-pacáiste agus a *DRY_RUN* modh, mar sin níl aon-op reáchtáil a thuilleadh indistinguishably ó cheann briste."

