# libretranslate
msgid "Consumers that must name a model (`web-app-moodle`, `web-app-matrix`) read `LITELLM_CHAT_MODEL`, which picks the first non-embedding preload model of `svc-ai-ollama` and mirrors the branch order of the gateway's own `config.yaml.j2`. The consumer resolves that branch from `lookup('deployment').inventory`, every group the round's inventory populates, read from the play-wide `groups` magic var. `.running` is wrong here: a targeted `apps=` round sets it to the whitelist, and `svc-ai-ollama` is pulled in as a dependency rather than named on the command line, so both backend branches fall through to the `openrouter/auto` vendor default. The gateway then answers `Invalid model name passed in model=openrouter/auto` with HTTP 400 and no consumer can complete a prompt. `.groups` is wrong for the mirror-image reason: it carries `group_names`, which is host-scoped, so on a multi-host round a worker that hosts neither the gateway nor a backend resolves an empty model while the manager resolves the right one."
msgstr "Tomhaltóirí nach mór a ainm samhail (`web-app-moodle`, `web-app-matrix`) léamh `LITELLM_CHAT_MODEL`, a picks an chéad samhail réamhluchtaithe neamh-críochnaithe de `svc-ai-ollama` agus déanann sé an t-ordú brainse den gheata féin `config.yaml.j2`. Réitíonn an tomhaltóir an brainse sin ó `lookup('deployment').inventory`, gach grúpa populates fardal an bhabhta, a léamh ó na play-wide `groups` var draíochta. `.running` Is mícheart anseo: a spriocdhírithe `apps=` Leagann bhabhta é go dtí an whitelist, agus `svc-ai-ollama` ceirteacha tarraingthe i mar spleáchas seachas ainmnithe ar an líne ordú, mar sin titim an dá craobhacha cúl tríd go dtí an `openrouter/auto` réamhshocraithe díoltóir. Freagraíonn an geata ansin `Invalid model name passed in model=openrouter/auto` le HTTP 400 agus ní féidir aon tomhaltóir a chur i gcrích go pras. `.groups` mícheart ar an gcúis scáthán-íomhá: déanann sé `group_names`, atá óstach-scóipthe, mar sin ar bhabhta il-óstach oibrí a óstáil nach réitíonn an geata ná cúlú samhail folamh agus réitíonn an bainisteoir an ceann ceart."

# libretranslate
