# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Cross-service probes (biber denied at prometheus, biber denied at matomo, dashboard tile reachability) are NOT part of the per-role biber persona. They live in the provider's own spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parameterised once over the provider's `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. For the dashboard, the parameterised scenario delegates to `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, which owns the tile visibility / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" pop-out assertions in one SPOT."
msgstr "Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí (biber dhiúltú ag prometheus, biber Shéan ag matomo, reachability tíl Painéal na nIonstraimí) NACH cuid den biber per-role persona. Tá cónaí orthu i spec an tsoláthraí féin (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), paraiméadaraithe uair amháin thar an soláthraí `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` a léiriú. Maidir leis an Painéal na nIonstraimí, na toscairí scéal paraiméadaraithe chuig `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, a bhfuil an infheictheacht tíl / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" dearbhuithe pop-amach i amháin."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service probes are NOT part of the per-role administrator persona. Dashboard tile reachability is owned by `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, which delegates the per-target body to the `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tile visible → click loads in `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" button pops the embed into a fresh browser tab). That helper is the SPOT for dashboard-tile mechanics; consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any of those assertions. Prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity are owned by `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach and tracker presence are owned by `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."
msgstr "Tá probes Cross-seirbhíse NACH mar chuid de na persona riarthóir per-role. Tá sroichteacht tíl Dashboard faoi úinéireacht ag `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, a thoscairí an comhlacht per-target don `runDashboardCardScenario` cúntóir i `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tíl le feiceáil → cliceáil ualaí i `#main iframe` ceannaire → \"Tab\" pops cnaipe an leabú isteach cluaisín bhrabhsálaí úr). Is é sin an cúntóir an t-iomlán do Meicnic tíl Painéal na nIonstraimí; specs tomhaltóirí NACH MUST a chur i bhfeidhm aon cheann de na dearbhuithe. Prometheus admin-reach agus parity scrape úinéireacht ag `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo Tá láithreacht admin-rochtana agus rianaithe úinéireacht ag `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Gach soláthraí paraiméadar an dearbhú thar a `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` a léiriú."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service surface assertions (dashboard tile reachability, prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity, matomo admin-reach and tracker presence, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) are owned by the provider's own spec. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, rendered via `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Consumer roles' personas MUST NOT duplicate these probes."
msgstr "dearbhuithe dromchla Cross-seirbhíse (reachability tíl Painéal na nIonstraimí, prometheus admin-rochtana agus parity scrape, láithreacht admin-rochtana agus rianaithe, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) atá faoi úinéireacht ag spec an tsoláthraí féin. Gach soláthraí paraiméadar an dearbhú thar a `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` léiriú, a rinneadh trí `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Róil Tomhaltóirí 'mar MUST NACH dúblach na probes."

