# libretranslate
msgid "Deploys one chunk of the sweep. Every matrix row is a single `role#variant` carrying the deploy mode, onion state, distro and filesystem the rotation assigned it: `swarm` rows get a simulated 3-node DinD cluster with an NFS server plus a drain/reschedule state-survival assertion, `compose` and `host` rows run the single-node drill. When `whitelist` is empty, the discover job derives one from the branch's diff vs `origin/main`; see the \"Diff-driven app selection\" subsection in [pipeline.md](../../../artefact/git/pipeline.md). A row marked 📖 -- the role's smallest variant, see [instructions.md](instructions.md) -- replays the role README's `### Production` block on the same runner once the deploy has released it."
msgstr "Déan iniúchadh ar shmután amháin den scuab. Tá gach sraith maitrís amháin `role#variant` iompar an modh imscaradh, stát oinniún, distro agus córas comhaid an uainíocht shanntar é: `swarm` sraitheanna a fháil insamhladh 3-node braisle DinD le freastalaí NFS móide draein / rechedule stát-survival dearbhú, `compose` agus `host` sraitheanna reáchtáil an druil aon-nód. Nuair a bheidh `whitelist` Tá folamh, díorthaíonn an post a fháil amach ar cheann ó diff an bhrainse vs `origin/main`; féach ar an \"Roghnú app Diff-tiomáinte\" fo-alt i [pipeline.md](../../../artefact/git/pipeline.md). A ndiaidh a chéile marcáilte paiste -- an ról ar leagan is lú, féach [instructions.md](instructions.md) - replays an ról README ar `### Production` bloc ar an dara háit chéanna nuair a bheidh an imscaradh scaoileadh é."

