msgid "Disable/prune path: `provides: litellm_ui` makes `expand_service_tokens('web-app-litellm')` expand to `services.litellm_ui.*`, so disabling the UI role does not clear its `services.litellm` consumer contract; the gateway stays force-loaded until that flag is flipped manually or the expander learns about redirected consumer contracts."
msgstr "Conair idirscartha/prímh: `provides: litellm_ui` Déanann `expand_service_tokens('web-app-litellm')` a leathnú chun `services.litellm_ui.*`, mar sin disabling an ról Chomhéadain nach soiléir a `services.litellm` conradh tomhaltóirí; fanann an geata fórsa-luchtaithe go dtí go bhfuil an bhratach sracadh de láimh nó foghlaimíonn an leathnaitheoir faoi chonarthaí tomhaltóirí atreorú."

# libretranslate
msgid "Disabled the *email* service in the *web-app-pihole* role by pinning *services.email* to a static *enabled: false* / *shared: false* with the matching *dynamic-flag* and *email* nocheck suppressions, removing the now-static email overrides from *meta/variants.yml*, and adding *javascript* true/false variant pins to keep the dynamic-flag matrix-coverage guard green."
msgstr "Daoine faoi Mhíchumas an *duille dath: glas* seirbhís sa *riachtanais uisce: measartha* ról ag pinning *services.email* go statach *cumasaithe: bréagach* / Baile *roinnte: bréagach* leis an meaitseáil *dinimiciúil - brada* agus *duille dath: glas* cosc nocheck, deireadh a chur leis an overrides ríomhphost anois statach ó *meta/variants.yml*, agus cur *cineál gas: in airde* fíor / bioráin malairt bradaíl a choinneáil ar an dinimiciúil maitrís-clúdach garda glas."

