msgstr "Dropped an próifíl ci chumadh agus a --próifíl ci arg, an garda reáchtáil-amháin ar gréasáin-rogha-rdr-domains, an leagan íomhá bonn caol pkgmgr, tagairtí ceanglas-comhaid ó cód runtime, agus an inlíne XML payload duplication i gréasáin-app-xwiki"

# libretranslate
msgid "Dropping the axes does not mean forgiving them. A row is proven only when *every* job it had was green: one red or aborted combination un-proves it, however many green siblings it has. Only a priority row can have several, since it deploys its whole cross-product at once while a regular row gets one combination per sweep -- and letting a green compose job carry a red swarm one would walk the regular line past a combination nobody fixed."
msgstr "Ní chiallaíonn Dropping na haiseanna a thabhairt dóibh. Tá a chéile cruthaithe ach amháin nuair a *gach rud* post a bhí sé glas: meascán dearg nó aborted un-proves sé, áfach, deartháireacha glasa go leor go bhfuil sé. Ní féidir ach sraith tosaíochta a bheith roinnt, ós rud é go n-imíonn sé a tras-tháirge ar fad ag an am céanna agus faigheann sraith rialta meascán amháin in aghaidh an scuab - agus a ligean ar cíos post glas chumadh a dhéanamh swarm dearg bheadh duine ag siúl ar an líne rialta anuas meascán aon duine seasta."

# libretranslate
msgid "Drops or truncates the backing database."
msgstr "Drops nó teascann an bunachar sonraí cúltaca."

# libretranslate
msgid "Drops the per-entity default Docker network when `compose.sh` left it behind with the wrong / empty `com.docker.compose.network` label (typical between matrix-deploy rounds). Skips removal when the network still has active container endpoints, so shared-service networks (svc-db-mariadb, svc-db-postgres, …) stay in place while their provider container is up. The global `docker network prune -f` sweep that catches orphans whose names do NOT match the entity is run once by the orchestrator [apps.sh](../apps.sh) after the entity loop. Idempotent."
msgstr "Drops an líonra réamhshocraithe per-entity Docker nuair `compose.sh` d'fhág sé taobh thiar leis an mícheart / folamh `com.docker.compose.network` lipéad lipéad (tipiciúil idir babhtaí maitrís-imlonnaithe). Scipeáil a bhaint nuair a bheidh an líonra fós endpoints coimeádán gníomhach, mar sin gréasáin comhroinnt-seirbhíse (svc-db-mariadb, svc-db-postgres,...) fanacht i bhfeidhm agus a n-coimeádán soláthraí suas. An domhan domhanda `docker network prune -f` sweep go gabhálacha dílleachtaí a bhfuil a n-ainmneacha NACH mheaitseáil leis an eintiteas a reáchtáil uair amháin ag an orchestrator [apps.sh](../apps.sh) tar éis an lúb eintitis. Idempotent."

