# libretranslate
msgid "ERPNext is exposed as a consumable shared service and renders the Keycloak SSO button on */login* under gunicorn *--preload*. Nextcloud is provisioned on the SeaweedFS S3 object store with a dedicated consumer end-to-end test and has its OIDC plugins gated as mandatory; the upgrade to version 34 is deliberately not carried out because of plugin incompatibilities, so it stays pinned at 33."
msgstr "Tá ERPNext nochta mar sheirbhís chomhroinnte inchaite agus déanann sé an cnaipe Keycloak SSO ar *taiseachas aeir: fliuch* faoi gunnán *-- réamhlódáil*Tá Nextcloud ar fáil ar an S Séipéal3 siopa réad le tástáil deiridh do thomhaltóirí tiomanta agus tá a plugins OIDC gated mar éigeantach; an t-uasghrádú go leagan 34 nach bhfuil déanta d'aon ghnó mar gheall ar neamhluí plugin, mar sin fanann sé pinned ag 33."

