# libretranslate
msgid "Elevate your collaboration with Nextcloud, a vibrant self-hosted cloud solution designed for dynamic file sharing, seamless communication, and effortless teamwork. Nextcloud offers a full suite of integrated tools (including LDAP and OIDC authentication, Redis caching, and automated plugin management via OCC) to empower a secure, extensible, and production-ready cloud environment."
msgstr "Elevate do chomhoibriú le Nextcloud, réiteach scamall bríomhar féin-óstach atá deartha le haghaidh comhroinnt comhad dinimiciúil, cumarsáid gan uaim, agus obair foirne effortless. Nextcloud cuireann sraith iomlán uirlisí comhtháite (lena n-áirítear fíordheimhniú LDAP agus OIDC, caching Redis, agus bainistíocht breiseán uathoibrithe trí OCC) a chumhachtú timpeallacht scamall slán, extensible, agus a tháirgeadh-réidh."

# libretranslate
msgid "Elevate your email marketing with Listmonk, a high-performance, self-hosted newsletter and mailing list manager featuring a modern, intuitive dashboard. Listmonk empowers you with advanced analytics, efficient subscriber segmentation, and streamlined campaign management, all configurable via a flexible TOML configuration file."
msgstr "Elevate do margaíochta r-phost le Listmonk, ard-fheidhmíocht, nuachtlitir féin-óstáil agus bainisteoir liosta postála featuring nua-aimseartha, Painéal na nIonstraimí iomasach. Listmonk cumhachtaíonn tú le Analytics chun cinn, deighilt síntiúsóir éifeachtach, agus bainistíocht feachtas sruthlínithe, gach configurable trí chomhad cumraíochta solúbtha TOML."

# libretranslate
