# libretranslate
msgid "Email integration in v1: **outbound SMTP only**. When `web-app-mailu` is in `group_names`, Frappe's outbound Email Account is auto-configured against the central SMTP endpoint so notification / password-reset emails leave the box. **IMAP inbound (mail-to-Communication) is deferred to a follow-up requirement.** Rationale: the survey found no precedent in this repo for auto-provisioning role-owned mailboxes in Mailu, so the inbound side requires a new generic Mailu mechanism that is out of scope for this PR."
msgstr "Comhtháthú ríomhphoist i v1: **SMTP outbound amháin**. Nuair a `web-app-mailu` Tá sé i `group_names`, Frappe's outbound Cuntas R-phost uathoibríoch-chumraithe i gcoinne an deiridh SMTP lárnach mar sin fógra / r-phoist phasfhocal-athshocraigh fhágáil ar an mbosca. **IMAP isteach (post-go-Cumarsáid) a chur siar go dtí riachtanas leantach.** Rationale: fuair an suirbhé aon fasach sa repo le haghaidh uathoibríoch-sholáthar ról-úinéireacht mailboxes atá faoi úinéireacht i Mailu, mar sin éilíonn an taobh inbound meicníocht Mailu cineálach nua atá as raon feidhme don PR."

