msgstr "Ritheann gach bhrú an geata céanna is féidir leat a reáchtáil go háitiúil:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Every reason the tokens of one input cannot deploy on this branch."
msgstr "Gach chúis ní féidir leis na comharthaí ionchur amháin a imscaradh ar an brainse seo."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every rejected entry carries a stable `reason`: `consumer_not_allowed`, `transport_unsupported`, `auth_unsupported`, `credential_missing` or `endpoint_unreachable`."
msgstr "Déanann gach iontráil diúltaithe cobhsaí `reason`: `consumer_not_allowed`, `transport_unsupported`, `auth_unsupported`, `credential_missing` nó `endpoint_unreachable`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every replica serves from the shared ``docs_sites`` volume. The replica holding ``builder.lock`` in that volume fetches and builds; the queue (``queue/``) and the build states (``states/``) are files beside the sites, so a new lock holder resumes the queue when the builder dies. Cross-node locking relies on NFSv4, the default of ``svc-storage-nfs-client``."
msgstr "Feidhmíonn gach macasamhail ó na roinnte ``docs_sites`` toirt. An bhfuil macasamhail ``builder.lock`` sa toirt sin fetches agus tógálacha; an scuaine (``queue/``) agus na stáit a thógáil (``states/``) Tá comhaid in aice leis na láithreáin, mar sin atosaíonn sealbhóir glas nua an scuaine nuair a fhaigheann an tógálaí bás. Tras-nód Glasáil ag brath ar NFSv4, an mainneachtain ``svc-storage-nfs-client``."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every replica serves from the shared `docs_sites` volume. The replica holding `builder.lock` in that volume fetches and builds; the queue (`queue/`) and the build states (`states/`) are files beside the sites, so a new lock holder resumes the queue when the builder dies. Cross-node locking relies on NFSv4, the default of `svc-storage-nfs-client`."
msgstr "Feidhmíonn gach macasamhail ó na roinnte `docs_sites` toirt. An bhfuil macasamhail `builder.lock` sa toirt sin fetches agus tógálacha; an scuaine (`queue/`) agus na stáit a thógáil (`states/`) Tá comhaid in aice leis na láithreáin, mar sin atosaíonn sealbhóir glas nua an scuaine nuair a fhaigheann an tógálaí bás. Tras-nód Glasáil ag brath ar NFSv4, an mainneachtain `svc-storage-nfs-client`."

