# libretranslate
msgid "Every role that declares RBAC at the file root of its `meta/rbac.yml` MUST be provisioned with a per-application namespace under the container named by `RBAC.GROUP.NAME` (default `roles`). Each LDAP group entry is a direct child of that container; the application identifier (and the tenant identifier, if any) is encoded into the CN with hyphen separators:"
msgstr "Gach ról a dhearbhaíonn RBAC ag fréamh comhaid a `meta/rbac.yml` MUST a chur ar fáil le ainmspás in aghaidh an iarratais faoin gcoimeádán ainmnithe ag `RBAC.GROUP.NAME` (cineál gas: in airde `roles`). Is leanbh díreach den choimeádán sin é gach iontráil ghrúpa LDAP; an t-aitheantóir iarratais (agus aitheantóir an tionónta, más ann dó) ionchódaithe isteach sa CN le deighilteoirí hyphen:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Every role that ships role-level extensions MUST declare them under `roles/<role>/meta/addons/`, one file per addon at `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml`. The file root IS the addon spec; there is NO wrapping `<addon_id>:` key (the filename stem supplies the addon id)."
msgstr "Gach ról a longa síneadh ról-leibhéal MUST dhearbhú iad faoi `roles/<role>/meta/addons/`, comhad amháin in aghaidh an addon ag `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml`. IS an fhréamh comhad an spec addon; níl NÍL timfhilleadh `<addon_id>:` eochair eochair (Soláthraíonn an gas ainm comhaid id addon)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every role type with the files it MAY or MUST ship."
msgstr "Gach cineál ról leis na comhaid MAY nó MUST long."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every role with an ``application_id`` declares exactly one ``mcp:`` entry. The block is an audit disposition first and a deployable surface second: ``classification`` states what the role is, and only a deployable classification may also carry ``enabled``/``shared`` and a served contract."
msgstr "Gach ról le ``application_id`` Dearbhaíonn go díreach ceann ``mcp:`` iontráil. Is é an bloc diúscairt iniúchóireachta ar dtús agus dromchla in-inúsáidte dara: ``classification`` deir cad é an ról, agus ní féidir ach aicmiú in-imscartha a dhéanamh freisin ``enabled``/ Baile``shared`` agus conradh seirbhíse."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every role with an `application_id` MUST contain one role-local `mcp:` audit mapping in `meta/services.yml`. This requirement supersedes requirement 025's rule that absence means no upstream path, because absence cannot distinguish a reviewed refusal from a role that nobody examined. Discovery MUST select only a deployable classification with explicit `enabled: true` and `shared: true`; audit-only mappings MUST never become endpoints."
msgstr "Gach ról le `application_id` MUST bhfuil ról-áitiúil amháin `mcp:` mapáil iniúchóireachta in `meta/services.yml`. An riachtanas seo supersedes riachtanas 025's riail go gciallaíonn neamhláithreacht aon chosán srutha, toisc nach féidir le neamhláithreacht idirdhealú a dhéanamh ar dhiúltú athbhreithnithe ó ról nár scrúdaigh aon duine. Discovery MUST roghnú ach aicmiú in-inúsáidte le sainráite `enabled: true` agus `shared: true`; mapaí iniúchta-amháin MUST riamh bheith endpoints."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every row is assigned its deploy mode, tor state, distro, filesystem and CPU architecture by its position in that list (:mod:`utils.github.variant.axes`)."
msgstr "Tá gach sraith sannadh a mód imscaradh, stát tor, distro, córas comhaid agus ailtireacht LAP ag a seasamh sa liosta sin (:mod:`utils.github.variant.axes`)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every row of the CI matrix is one ``role#variant`` selection. Five axes are decided here, all as a deterministic rotation over the row's position in the *global* discovery order and the sweep number -- never at random, so a red job can be reproduced by re-running the same sweep, and so consecutive sweeps cover the combinations instead of sampling them:"
msgstr "Tá gach sraith den maitrís CI amháin ``role#variant`` roghnú. Déantar cúig aiseanna a chinneadh anseo, go léir mar rothlú cinntitheach thar sheasamh an tsraith sa *domhanda domhanda domhanda* ordú fionnachtana agus an uimhir sweep - riamh ag randamach, mar sin is féidir le post dearg a atáirgeadh ag ath-reáchtáil an scuab céanna, agus mar sin sweeps as a chéile a chlúdach an teaglaim in ionad samplála iad:"

# libretranslate
msgid "Every rule in `permissions.ask` assumes the operator reads the prompt and confirms the action matches intent. Rules in `ask` are NOT a hard barrier. They are a speed-bump that converts automatic execution into a deliberate decision."
msgstr "Gach riail i `permissions.ask` Glacann an t-oibreoir léann an pras agus deimhníonn an gníomh oireann intinn. Rialacha i `ask` NACH bac crua. Tá siad luas-bump a athraíonn forghníomhú uathoibríoch i gcinneadh d'aon ghnó."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every runner instance is an ephemeral container that mounts its host's docker socket (DooD). For each CI job it starts a fresh Infinito DinD container with a unique subnet and volume, runs the job inside it, and tears it down; the runner then re-registers with GitHub as a fresh ephemeral runner."
msgstr "Is é gach cás rádala coimeádán ephemeral go mounts a óstach soicéad docker (Déan teagmháil linn). I gcás gach post CI Tosaíonn sé coimeádán Infinito DinD úr le subnet uathúil agus toirt, ritheann an post taobh istigh de, agus deora sé síos; an dara háit ansin ath-chláir le GitHub mar dara háit ephemeral úr."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every runner instance is an ephemeral container that mounts its host’s docker socket (DooD). For each CI job it starts a fresh Infinito DinD container with a unique subnet and volume, runs the job inside it, and tears it down; the runner then re-registers with GitHub as a fresh ephemeral runner."
msgstr "Is é gach cás rádala coimeádán ephemeral go mounts a óstach soicéad docker (Déan teagmháil linn). I gcás gach post CI Tosaíonn sé coimeádán Infinito DinD úr le subnet uathúil agus toirt, ritheann an post taobh istigh de, agus deora sé síos; an dara háit ansin ath-chláir le GitHub mar dara háit ephemeral úr."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every scenario MUST end with the browser in a clearly logged-out state."
msgstr "Gach cás MUST deireadh leis an bhrabhsálaí i stát go soiléir logáilte amach."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every selected run is attempted before anything is reported; abandoning the rest on the first rejection would leave them burning runners. `HTTP 409` means the run already finished and is not a rejection at all. Any other rejection is logged as an `ERROR` line, but only a denied token fails the job — a rate limit or a run that vanished between listing and cancel is transient, and a red check for those is a red check nobody reads."
msgstr "Tá gach reáchtáil roghnaithe iarracht roimh aon rud a thuairisciú; a thréigean an chuid eile ar an chéad diúltú a bheadh iad a fhágáil dara háit a dhó. `HTTP 409` ciallaíonn an rith críochnaithe cheana féin agus nach bhfuil diúltú ar chor ar bith. Tá aon diúltú eile logáilte mar `ERROR` líne, ach ní theipeann ach chomhartha denied an post - teorainn ráta nó a reáchtáil go bhfuil vanished idir liostú agus a chealú neamhbhuan, agus seiceáil dearg dóibh siúd is seiceáil dearg léann aon duine."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every service-dependent step uses `skipUnlessServiceEnabled(...)`. Direct `process.env` reads of `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED` are forbidden."
msgstr "Úsáideann gach céim seirbhíse-spleách `skipUnlessServiceEnabled(...)`. Díreach `process.env` léamha ar `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED` Tá cosc."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every shell invocation the agent makes: `make` targets, `git`/`gh`/`docker` calls, `grep`/`head`/`tail`/`wc`, Python test runners, log-capture pipelines, etc."
msgstr "Déanann gach sonrasc bhlaosc an gníomhaire: `make` spriocanna, `git`/ Baile`gh`/ Baile`docker` glaonna, `grep`/ Baile`head`/ Baile`tail`/ Baile`wc`, rádala tástála Python, píblínte log-chothú, etc."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every spec MUST include the three persona scenarios below as its baseline. Additional scenarios (RBAC loops, peer-to-peer messaging, federation round-trips, CSP-deep-checks, …) MAY be added on top. Three personas exist in the deploy fixture: `guest` (no Keycloak account), `biber` (regular end-user), and `administrator` (operator/admin). The flow shape is identical across roles. Only the role-specific selectors and the post-login assertion change. Service-dependent steps MUST be guarded with [`skipUnlessServiceEnabled('<svc>')`](../../../../../roles/test-e2e-playwright/files/service-gating.js) so a deploy with `disable=<svc>` reports the affected step as `skipped: <NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=false`, never `failed`."
msgstr "I measc gach MUST spec na trí cásanna persona thíos mar a bonnlíne. Cásanna breise (lúba RBAC, teachtaireachtaí piaraí go piaraí, turais bhabhta-chothaithe, seiceálaithe CSP-domhain,...) MAY a chur leis ar bharr. Trí personas ann sa daingneán imscaradh: `guest` (aon chuntas Keycloak), `biber` (úsáideoir deiridh rialta), agus `administrator` (oibreoir / admin). Tá an cruth sreabhadh comhionann ar fud róil. Níl ach na roghnóirí ról-shonrach agus an t-athrú i ndiaidh-login dearbhaithe. Seirbhís-spleách céimeanna MUST a chosaint le [`skipUnlessServiceEnabled('<svc>')`](../../../../../roles/test-e2e-playwright/files/service-gating.js) mar sin imscaradh le `disable=<svc>` tuarascálacha an chéim difear mar `skipped: <NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=false`, riamh, `failed`."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Every spec MUST set `test.use({ ignoreHTTPSErrors: true })` at the top of the file because the test environment uses self-signed certificates. The central `playwright.config.js` does NOT set this globally. Per-spec opt-in is the contract."
msgstr "Gach sraith MUST spec `test.use({ ignoreHTTPSErrors: true })` ag barr an chomhaid toisc go n-úsáideann an timpeallacht tástála deimhnithe féin-sínithe. An lárnach `playwright.config.js` NACH leagtar seo ar fud an domhain. Is é an rogha Per-spec sa chonradh."

# libretranslate
msgid "Every stack has its own domain below it (`INFINITO_DOMAIN`): the primary checkout is `main.infinito.test`, a worktree from `make worktree-up` is its branch lowercased with every character outside `a-z0-9_-` replaced by `-` (`feature/store-i18n` → `feature-store-i18n.infinito.test`). `linux.sh` routes each stack's domain to that checkout's `INFINITO_BIND_IP`, read from the `.env` of every `git worktree list` entry. Re-run `make network-dns-setup` after creating or removing a worktree."
msgstr "Tá gach Stack a bhfearann féin thíos sé (`INFINITO_DOMAIN`): Is é an tseiceáil bunscoile `main.infinito.test`, crann oibre ó `make worktree-up` Is é a brainse ísliú le gach carachtar taobh amuigh `a-z0-9_-` in ionad `-` (`feature/store-i18n` → → `feature-store-i18n.infinito.test`). `linux.sh` bealaí gach Stack bhfearann go checkout ar `INFINITO_BIND_IP`, léamh as an `.env` de gach `git worktree list` iontráil. Athchúrsáil `make network-dns-setup` tar éis crann oibre a chruthú nó a bhaint."

