msgid "Execute autonomously after the Open Questions are resolved. Scaffold using [`roles/web-app-openproject/`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/) as the structural template (oauth2 flavor + header SSO + LDAP). Verify all Checkmk env names, the `auth_by_http_header` config mechanism, site-path routing, and the GUI selectors against the pinned upstream version before claiming done."
