# libretranslate
msgid "Extensive deploy and end-to-end hardening, much of it reproduced in Docker-in-Docker: native username and password login fallbacks for the no-SSO admin persona across Akaunting, Snipe-IT, YOURLS and OpenProject; OpenProject linked to the LDAP auth source for header SSO to fix a trusted-header 401, with all rails-runner Ruby extracted to dedicated files under *files/ruby/*; Shopware retries asset and theme builds against a restarting SeaweedFS; Mailu retries user creation and waits for antispam readiness before DKIM keygen; YOURLS creates its database schema on deploy; and OpenProject boots db:migrate under Ruby 4.0."
msgstr "Extensive imscaradh agus deireadh-le-deireadh hardening, i bhfad de sé atáirgeadh i Docker-i-Docker: ainm úsáideora dúchais agus focal faire logála i fallbacks do na persona admin aon-SSO ar fud Akaunting, Snipe-IT, DORLS agus OpenProject; OpenProject nasctha leis an LDAP foinse auth do header SSO a shocrú iontaofa-ceannaire 401, leis na ráillí-runner Ruby a bhaintear chun comhaid tiomnaithe faoi *comhaid / ruby /*; Tógann sócmhainn retries Shopware agus téama i gcoinne SeaweedFS atosú; Déanann Mailu retries chruthú úsáideora agus Waits le haghaidh ullmhacht antispam roimh keygen DKIM; Cruthaíonn DORLS a scéimre bunachar sonraí ar imscaradh; agus buataisí OpenProject db:migrate faoi Ruby 4.0."

