msgstr "Lean na treoracha ó AGENTS.md, ansin reáchtáil `make quality` (an gníomh réamhshocraithe an scil seo). Sruthú an t-aschur chuig logáil faoi `/tmp` agus iterate: léigh an tábla toraidh per-target, ní an cód imeachta píopa (atá neamhiontaofa), shocrú gach teip ag a fhréamh, agus ath-reáchtáil go dtí `make quality` Tá deireadh glas go deireadh."

# libretranslate
msgid "Follow the instructions from AGENTS.md, then run `make worktree-down branch=<branch>` (the default action of this skill). Pass the same `base=<dir>` that `make worktree-up` was given, otherwise the target looks in the default parent directory and reports no worktree at that path."
msgstr "Lean na treoracha ó AGENTS.md, ansin reáchtáil `make worktree-down branch=<branch>` (an gníomh réamhshocraithe an scil seo). Pas an gcéanna `base=<dir>` go bhfuil `make worktree-up` tugadh, ar shlí eile Breathnaíonn an sprioc sa eolaire tuismitheoir réamhshocraithe agus tuarascálacha aon worktree ag an cosán."

# libretranslate
msgid "Follow the instructions from AGENTS.md, then run `make worktree-up branch=<branch>` (the default action of this skill). The worktree lands under `~/.local/share/worktrees/<domain>/<account>/<repo>/<branch>` and joins the primary checkout's cache stack instead of starting its own."
msgstr "Lean na treoracha ó AGENTS.md, ansin reáchtáil `make worktree-up branch=<branch>` (an gníomh réamhshocraithe an scil seo). Na tailte crainn oibre faoi `~/.local/share/worktrees/<domain>/<account>/<repo>/<branch>` agus téann an seic amach bunscoile ar chairn taisce in ionad tosú a chuid féin."

