# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "GraphQL mutations bypass the REST-path-based deny rules entirely. A `mutation { … }` can achieve write effects (label manipulation, project-item creation, issue transfers, etc.) whose REST equivalents are denied by path. The whole endpoint is asked regardless of query direction because `gh api` cannot distinguish a read query from a mutation at the command line; body-flag ask rules also fire for graphql invocations that pass `-f query=…`, providing defence in depth."
msgstr "Seachnaíonn sócháin GraphQL na rialacha deny REST-path-bhunaithe go hiomlán. Amharc ar gach eolas `mutation { … }` is féidir a bhaint amach éifeachtaí scríobh (ionramháil lipéad, cruthú an tionscadail, aistrithe a eisiúint, etc.) a bhfuil a coibhéisí REST dhiúltú ag cosán. Iarrtar ar an gcríochphointe iomlán beag beann ar threoir cheist mar gheall ar `gh api` Ní féidir idirdhealú a dhéanamh ceist a léamh ó mutation ag an líne ordú; comhlacht- brada iarraidh ar rialacha freisin tine do invocations graifql a théann `-f query=…`, cosaint a sholáthar go domhain."

