# libretranslate
msgid "Hermes exposes no administrator-visible list of configured MCP servers, so the configured set is proven at deploy time instead: the deploy runs ``hermes mcp test <server>`` for every configured server and fails when one does not answer. A successful run reports the negotiated connection and the discovered tool count. The Playwright spec covers the complementary case, that the agent API holding the MCP credentials refuses an unauthenticated caller."
msgstr "Hermes nochtann aon liosta riarthóir-visible de freastalaithe MCP cumraithe, mar sin tá an sraith cumraithe cruthaithe ag am in ionad: Ritheann an imscaradh ``hermes mcp test <server>`` do gach freastalaí cumraithe agus go mainneoidh nuair nach bhfuil duine a fhreagairt. Tuairiscíonn reáchtáil rathúil an nasc idirbheartaíochta agus an líon uirlis amach. Clúdaíonn an spec Playwright an cás comhlántach, go bhfuil an gníomhaire API a bhfuil na dintiúir MCP diúltaíonn glaoiteoir unauthenticated."

# libretranslate
msgid "Hermes exposes no administrator-visible list of configured MCP servers, so the configured set is proven at deploy time instead: the deploy runs `hermes mcp test <server>` for every configured server and fails when one does not answer. A successful run reports the negotiated connection and the discovered tool count. The Playwright spec covers the complementary case, that the agent API holding the MCP credentials refuses an unauthenticated caller."
msgstr "Hermes nochtann aon liosta riarthóir-visible de freastalaithe MCP cumraithe, mar sin tá an sraith cumraithe cruthaithe ag am in ionad: Ritheann an imscaradh `hermes mcp test <server>` do gach freastalaí cumraithe agus go mainneoidh nuair nach bhfuil duine a fhreagairt. Tuairiscíonn reáchtáil rathúil an nasc idirbheartaíochta agus an líon uirlis amach. Clúdaíonn an spec Playwright an cás comhlántach, go bhfuil an gníomhaire API a bhfuil na dintiúir MCP diúltaíonn glaoiteoir unauthenticated."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Hermes renders its agent config and its env from the same discovery list within one pass, and they disagree. Measured on compose: `config/config.yaml` written at 17:07:54 carries `web_app_prometheus` with `Authorization: \"Bearer ${env:WEB_APP_PROMETHEUS_MCP_TOKEN}\"`, while `.env/env` written at 17:07:51 defines no `*_MCP_TOKEN` at all, although [`templates/env.j2`](../../roles/web-app-hermes/templates/env.j2) loops over the same `HERMES_MCP_SERVERS` unconditionally. The client therefore presents an empty bearer and the adapter answers `401`, which is correct behaviour on its side: probed from inside, `prometheusmcp` returns `200` for its own bearer and `401` for a wrong one. Any fix has to make the env and the config provably render from one evaluation of the list rather than two."
msgstr "Déanann Hermes a ghníomhaire config agus a env ón liosta fionnachtana céanna laistigh de pas amháin, agus easaontaíonn siad. Tomhaiste ar chumadh: `config/config.yaml` scríofa ag 17:07:54 Déanann `web_app_prometheus` le `Authorization: \"Bearer ${env:WEB_APP_PROMETHEUS_MCP_TOKEN}\"`, cé `.env/env` scríofa ag 17:07:51 Sainmhíníonn aon `*_MCP_TOKEN` ag gach, cé go [`templates/env.j2`](../../roles/web-app-hermes/templates/env.j2) lúba thar an gcéanna `HERMES_MCP_SERVERS` gan choinníoll. Mar sin, cuireann an cliant iompróir folamh agus na freagraí adapter `401`, a bhfuil iompar ceart ar a thaobh: probed ó taobh istigh, `prometheusmcp` data recovery `200` as a settings féin agus `401` ar cheann mícheart. Tá aon shocrú a dhéanamh ar an env agus an config a dhéanamh go provably ó meastóireacht amháin ar an liosta seachas dhá."

