# libretranslate
msgid "If container or security setup behaves differently than on Linux, the WSL2 guide covers the usual [Docker Buildx](https://docs.docker.com/reference/cli/docker/buildx/), [DNS](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Domain_Name_System), and [AppArmor](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AppArmor)-related workarounds."
msgstr "Má iompar coimeádán nó thus slándála difriúil ná ar Linux, an WSL2 Clúdaíonn an treoir is gnách [Tógáil Docker](https://docs.docker.com/reference/cli/docker/buildx/), [DNS](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Domain_Name_System), agus [Amharc ar gach eolas](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AppArmor)-related workarounds."

# libretranslate
msgid "If disk space is tight, you SHOULD move Docker data, caches, and your working directory to the SSD."
msgstr "Má tá spás diosca daingean, tú SHOULD bogadh Sonraí Docker, caches, agus do eolaire ag obair leis an SSD."

