# libretranslate
msgid "Inside a play the process boundary is the task: Ansible forks a fresh worker per task, so `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE` starts empty in every worker. `get_merged_applications` therefore also accepts the play-scoped carrier fact `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED` (payload plus cache key, parked once by the constructor stage) and serves it when the key matches. See [applications.md](../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/plugins/lookup/applications.md) for the contract."
msgstr "Taobh istigh de spraoi is é teorainn an phróisis an tasc: forks Ansible oibrí úr in aghaidh an tasc, mar sin `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE` Tosaíonn folamh i ngach oibrí. `get_merged_applications` dá bhrí sin, Glacann freisin ar an bhfíric iompróir play-scoped `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED` (pálasta móide eochair taisce, páirceáilte uair amháin ag an gcéim tógálaí) agus feidhmíonn sé nuair a oireann an eochair. Féach ar [applications.md](../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/plugins/lookup/applications.md) don chonradh."

