# libretranslate
msgid "Key under which the pre-created ``<entity>`` network appears in the rendered compose file, which is what docker compose stores in the ``com.docker.compose.network`` label. An app that provides its own ``shared_net`` gets that network under its entity key and renders a separate unnamed ``default``; every other app renders ``default`` with the entity as its name. :func:`render_compose_networks` derives its own branch from this same call, so the label a caller stamps cannot drift from what is rendered."
msgstr "Príomh faoina bhfuil an réamhchruthaithe ``<entity>`` Is cosúil líonra sa chomhad a rinneadh chumadh, a bhfuil an méid docker chum siopaí sa ``com.docker.compose.network`` lipéad. app a sholáthraíonn a chuid féin ``shared_net`` faigheann an líonra sin faoina eochair eintiteas agus déanann sé unnamed ar leith ``default``; déanann gach app eile ``default`` leis an eintiteas mar a ainm. :func:`render_compose_networks` Tagann a brainse féin as an glaoch céanna, mar sin ní féidir leis an lipéad stampaí glaoiteora sruth ó cad atá déanta."

# libretranslate
