# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "LAM's entry point is not `${APP_BASE_URL}/`. That path answers with a redirect to `/lam/`, whose body is nothing but `<meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" content=\"0; URL=templates/login.php\">`. The shared persona helper samples the DOM for a password field the moment its navigation settles, which is on that empty interstitial, and its fallback paths `/login`, `/admin/` and `/admin` all return 404 at the vhost root — so the login form is never reached. CI traces for the SSO-disabled variants confirm the helper issues no form submission at all, and LAM's own access log records no POST."
msgstr "Níl pointe iontrála LAM `${APP_BASE_URL}/`. Go freagraí cosán le atreorú chuig `/lam/`, a bhfuil a chorp aon rud ach `<meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" content=\"0; URL=templates/login.php\">`. samplaí an cúntóir persona roinnte an DOM le haghaidh réimse phasfhocal i láthair na huaire réitíonn a nascleanúint, atá ar an interstitial folamh, agus a cosáin fallback `/login`, `/admin/` agus `/admin` gach tuairisceán 404 ag an fhréamh vhost - mar sin tá an fhoirm logáil isteach riamh shroich. Deimhníonn rianta CI do na leaganacha SSO-faoi dhíchumasú na saincheisteanna cúntóir aon fhoirm aighneacht ar chor ar bith, agus taifid logála rochtana LAM féin gan POST."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "LAM’s entry point is not ``${APP_BASE_URL}/``. That path answers with a redirect to ``/lam/``, whose body is nothing but ``<meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" content=\"0; URL=templates/login.php\">``. The shared persona helper samples the DOM for a password field the moment its navigation settles, which is on that empty interstitial, and its fallback paths ``/login``, ``/admin/`` and ``/admin`` all return 404 at the vhost root — so the login form is never reached. CI traces for the SSO-disabled variants confirm the helper issues no form submission at all, and LAM’s own access log records no POST."
msgstr "Níl pointe iontrála LAM ``${APP_BASE_URL}/``. Go freagraí cosán le atreorú chuig ``/lam/``, a bhfuil a chorp aon rud ach ``<meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" content=\"0; URL=templates/login.php\">``. samplaí an cúntóir persona roinnte an DOM le haghaidh réimse phasfhocal i láthair na huaire réitíonn a nascleanúint, atá ar an interstitial folamh, agus a cosáin fallback ``/login``, ``/admin/`` agus ``/admin`` gach tuairisceán 404 ag an fhréamh vhost - mar sin tá an fhoirm logáil isteach riamh shroich. rianta CI do na leaganacha SSO-faoi dhíchumasú deimhníonn na saincheisteanna cúntóir aon fhoirm aighneacht ar chor ar bith, agus taifid log rochtain LAM féin aon POST."

