msgid "Leave `KEEP_NEWEST_PER` and `INCLUDE_PATHS` unset to cancel every matching run, as the lifecycle events do — a closed PR and a deleted branch have no run left that deserves to survive. A fallback also mirrors whatever gates its group: `global-ci-*` cancels on every ref except `main`, so the push job carries the same `github.ref_name != 'main'` guard, while `pr-ci-*` is declared `cancel-in-progress: true` unconditionally, so the pull request job is ungated too."
msgstr "Plandaí faoi dhíon `KEEP_NEWEST_PER` agus `INCLUDE_PATHS` unset a chur ar ceal gach reáchtáil meaitseála, mar a dhéanann na himeachtaí saolré - tá PR dúnta agus brainse a scriosadh ar chlé go tuillte chun maireachtáil. A fallback freisin scátháin cuma cad geataí a ghrúpa: `global-ci-*` ceal ar gach ref ach amháin `main`, mar sin déanann an post a bhrú mar an gcéanna `github.ref_name != 'main'` garda, agus `pr-ci-*` a dhearbhú `cancel-in-progress: true` gan choinníoll, mar sin tá an post a iarraidh tarraingt ungated freisin."

