# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Matrix-deploy variant transitions can leave per-domain nginx vhost configs behind: when a service drops out of a round's include set, ``sys-svc-compose``'s aggressive docker prune removes the container, but the vhost file under ``<NGINX_DIR>/conf.d/servers/{http,https}/<domain>.conf`` survives. The next round's probe then gets HTTP 502 (nginx serves the vhost with no upstream) instead of the expected TLS-error 000."
msgstr "Is féidir le trasdul Maitrís-deploy a fhágáil in aghaidh an-domain nginx vhost configs taobh thiar: nuair a titeann seirbhís amach as bhabhta ar áireamh sraith, ``sys-svc-compose``'s prune docker ionsaitheach Cuireann an coimeádán, ach an comhad vhost faoi ``<NGINX_DIR>/conf.d/servers/{http,https}/<domain>.conf`` maireachtáil. An chéad bhabhta eile probe faigheann ansin HTTP 502 (nginx feidhmíonn an vhost gan aon sruth) in ionad an TLS-error ag súil 000."

