# libretranslate
msgid "New *web-app-n8n* role: n8n workflow automation (Community Edition). SSO is wired through a trusted-header edge hook that is copied and mounted only when SSO is enabled (native SSO is enterprise-only in CE), LDAP sign-in is supported, and per-scenario Playwright coverage exercises the CE edge-SSO model. Ships at lifecycle *alpha*; subnet and port collisions with the new *web-app-semaphore* role were resolved on the way in. See the [web-app-n8n README](roles/web-app-n8n/README.md)."
msgstr "Nuashonraithe go deireanach *web development8n* ról: n8n uathoibriú sreabhadh oibre (Clár na dToghthóirí). SSO sreangaithe trí Hook imeall iontaofa atá chóipeáil agus suite ach amháin nuair a SSO cumasaithe (Is SSO dúchais fiontar-amháin i CE), LDAP comhartha-i tacaíocht, agus per-scenario cleachtaí clúdach Playwright an tsamhail CE imeall-SSO. Longa ag saolré *alfa-uimhriúla*; folíon agus imbhualadh calafoirt leis an nua *web-app-semaphore* réitíodh ról ar an mbealach. Féach an [web development8Níl an Tweet seo ar fáil](roles/web-app-n8n/README.md)."

# libretranslate
msgid "New Apps"
msgstr "Naisc ábhartha eile"

# libretranslate
msgid "New ERPNext role that ships the upstream Frappe Framework v15 stack as a web-app-erpnext role — backend, frontend, websocket, scheduler and two queue workers — wired into the central Keycloak via a built-in Keycloak Social Login Key and into the central OpenLDAP via the LDAP Settings doctype. The three-variant matrix (SSO plus LDAP, no auth, LDAP only) is exercised end-to-end and a repo-wide lint caps Ansible task names at 120 characters."
msgstr "Ról nua ERPNext go longa an creat Frappe upstream v15 Stack mar ról gréasáin-app-erpnext - Leaschraolacháin, tosaigh, websocket, sceidealóir agus dhá oibrithe scuaine - sreangaithe isteach sa Keycloak lárnach trí Keycloak tógtha i Keycloak Social Logáil isteach agus isteach sa OpenLDAP lárnach tríd an doctype Socruithe LDAP. An maitrís trí athrú (SSO móide LDAP, gan auth, LDAP amháin) a fheidhmiú deiridh-le-deireadh agus caipíní lint repo-leathan ainmneacha tasc Ansible ag 120 carachtair."

# libretranslate
msgid "New Jitsi Meet role that adds an oauth2-proxy gated meeting surface plus matching LDAP-variant Playwright coverage. The spec layout is reorganised into a shared module and per-scenario test files so future scenarios can be added without touching the monolith."
msgstr "Déan Teagmháil Linn Ról biatais a chuireann oauth2-proxy dromchla cruinniú gated móide meaitseáil clúdach LDAP-éagsúlacht Playwright. Tá an leagan amach spec atheagrú i modúl roinnte agus in aghaidh an-scenario comhaid tástála ionas gur féidir cásanna sa todhchaí a chur leis gan teagmháil a dhéanamh leis an monolith."

# libretranslate
msgid "New OUs SHOULD NOT be invented. Place users under `OU.USERS`, RBAC roles under `OU.ROLES`, and organizational groups under `OU.GROUPS`."
msgstr "NÍ MÓR FÓGRA nua a chumadh. Úsáideoirí áit faoi `OU.USERS`, Róil RBAC faoi `OU.ROLES`, agus grúpaí eagrúcháin faoi `OU.GROUPS`."

# libretranslate
msgid "New Penpot role (web-app-penpot, requirement 235) that ships the upstream Penpot design platform comprising frontend, backend, exporter and Redis at image version 2.5.4, wired into the central Keycloak via OIDC and into the central OpenLDAP. Native local-password login is available as a toggle that is disabled automatically under OIDC, with the native-login and registration flags derived from the SSO flag. A custom JVM truststore imports the Infinito self-signed CA so OIDC over TLS succeeds, and the role is exercised end-to-end with Playwright covering OIDC login, logout and project creation. The local subnet was moved to 192.168.105.192/28 to avoid a collision with the ERPNext range."
msgstr "Ról nua Penpot (web-app-penpot, ceanglas 235) go longa an t-ardán dearadh Upstream Penpot chuimsíonn tosaigh, cúlú, onnmhaireoir agus Redis ag leagan íomhá 2.5.4, sreangaithe isteach sa Keycloak lárnach trí OIDC agus isteach sa OpenLDAP lárnach. Tá login áitiúil áitiúil-password Dúchasach ar fáil mar scoránaigh atá faoi mhíchumas go huathoibríoch faoi OIDC, leis an logála dúchais agus bratacha clárúcháin a dhíorthaítear ó bhratach SSO. A saincheaptha JVM truststore allmhairí an féin-sínithe Infinito CA mar sin OIDC thar TLS éiríonn, agus tá an ról a fheidhmiú deireadh-le-deireadh le Playwright clúdach logáil isteach OIDC, logáil amach agus a chruthú tionscadal. Aistríodh an folíon áitiúil go dtí 192.168.105.192/ Baile28 a sheachaint imbhualadh leis an raon ERPNext."

# libretranslate
msgid "New Pi-hole role (*web-app-pihole*) that ships the upstream Pi-hole DNS sinkhole and network-wide ad blocker, with its admin web interface gated behind *oauth2-proxy* and Keycloak RBAC and a native admin-password login (the *FTLCONF* web API password) available as a fallback variant. The upstream resolver and timezone are configurable, the role waits on the Pi-hole HTTP endpoint during deploy, and it is exercised end-to-end with Playwright covering the OAuth2, native-login and guest-access scenarios. The role ships at lifecycle beta."
msgstr "Ról nua Pi-poll (*riachtanais uisce: measartha*) go longa an upstream Pi-poll DNS doirtealhole agus líonra-leathan ad blocker, lena comhéadan gréasáin admin gated taobh thiar de *riachtanais uisce: measartha2-proxy* agus Keycloak RBAC agus logála féin admin-password (an *FTLCONF* web API pasfhocal) ar fáil mar leagan fallback. Tá an réiteoir réamhtheachtach agus amchrios configurable, fanann an ról ar an gcríochphointe HTTP Pi-poll le linn imscaradh, agus feidhmítear é deireadh-le-deireadh le Playwright a chlúdaíonn an OAuth2, dúchais-login agus cásanna aoi-rochtain. Na longa ról ag beta saolré."

# libretranslate
msgid "New `--mirror` support for inventory generation"
msgstr "Nuashonraithe go deireanach `--mirror` tacaíocht do ghiniúint fardal"

# libretranslate
msgid "New addon suggestions MUST include enough data for review: role id, addon id, upstream id, mechanism, source, catalog URL, and why the addon is considered relevant."
msgstr "I measc na moltaí nua addon MUST sonraí go leor le haghaidh athbhreithnithe: ról id, addon id, id sruth, meicníocht, foinse, URL chatalóg, agus cén fáth go bhfuil an addon mheas ábhartha."

# libretranslate
msgid "New centralized API single-point-of-truth: an *api* lookup plugin plus a global API dict so API tokens and endpoints (Cloudflare, the Nextcloud proprietary OAuth integrations) resolve from one place instead of scattered role lookups."
msgstr "Nua lárnach API aon-phointe-de-fhírinne: *taiseachas aeir: fliuch* breiseán Lookup móide deach API domhanda mar sin comharthaí API agus endpoints (Cloudflare, an Nextcloud dílseánaigh Comhtháthú OAuth) réiteach ó áit amháin in ionad lookups ról scaipthe."

# libretranslate
msgid "New engine-agnostic object-store service (*web-app-seaweedfs*, backed by either *SeaweedFS* or *MinIO*) that exposes a shared S3 endpoint, now consumed across 14 web-app roles for media and asset storage. Nextcloud, Decidim, Shopware, PeerTube, Pixelfed, Taiga, Fider, Akaunting, Mobilizon and Matrix route their uploads to the central bucket, each exercised end-to-end with a SeaweedFS consumer check that requires a fresh object key per upload."
msgstr "Seirbhís nua inneall-agnostic réad-stór (*riachtanais uisce: measartha*, tacaíocht ag ceachtar *Uisce agus Séarachas* nó *cineál gas: in airde*) a nochtann S roinnte3 endpoint, caite anois ar fud 14 róil gréasáin-iarratas le haghaidh stórála meán agus sócmhainní. Nextcloud, Decidim, Siopaearraí, PeerTube, picteilíní, Taiga, Fider, Akaunting, Mobilizon agus Maitrís bealach a n-uaslódáil chuig an buicéad lárnach, gach fheidhmigh deireadh-le-deireadh le seiceáil tomhaltóra SeaweedFS a éilíonn eochair réad úr in aghaidh an uaslódáil."

