# libretranslate
msgid "On Windows, use [WSL2](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/about) as the development environment and run the repository commands inside WSL2, not directly in [PowerShell](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/). Use Ubuntu 24.04 with [Docker Desktop WSL2 integration](https://docs.docker.com/desktop/features/wsl/), enable [`systemd`](https://systemd.io/), and expect a few Windows-specific follow-up steps around [certificate authority (CA)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Certificate_authority) trust and local name resolution."
msgstr "Ar Windows, úsáid [Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí2](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/about) mar an timpeallacht forbartha agus a reáchtáil na orduithe stór taobh istigh WSL2, ní go díreach i [Cumhacht a dhíol](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/). Úsáid Ubuntu 24.04 le [Docker Deasc WSL2 comhtháthú](https://docs.docker.com/desktop/features/wsl/), chumasú [`systemd`](https://systemd.io/), agus ag súil le roinnt céimeanna leantacha Windows-shonrach timpeall [údarás deimhniúcháin (foirm duille: líneach)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Certificate_authority) muinín agus rún ainm áitiúil."

