# libretranslate
msgid "On first run it self-installs `iputils-ping` + `iproute2` via the container's package manager (Debian / Ubuntu apt, Arch pacman, Fedora / CentOS / RHEL dnf). The installer waits up to two minutes for an apt-lock if a parallel deploy is running. IPv6 probes are auto-skipped when the bridge has no usable IPv6 default route."
msgstr "Ar an gcéad á reáchtáil sé féin-shuiteálacha `iputils-ping` + + + + `iproute2` tríd an coimeádán bainisteoir pacáiste (Foinse do bhfianaise Lawn leithead voltage). Fanann an suiteálaí suas le dhá nóiméad le haghaidh apt-ghlasáil má tá imscaradh comhthreomhar ag rith. IPv6 Tá probes auto-skipped nuair nach bhfuil an droichead IPv inúsáidte6 bealach réamhshocraithe."

