# libretranslate
msgid "On macOS, use [Lima](https://lima-vm.io/) so the project runs inside a Linux environment instead of directly on the host system. Use [Homebrew](https://brew.sh/) on macOS to install and manage Lima, then run the normal [Linux-oriented project setup](../setup.md) inside the Lima environment. This keeps the development workflow closer to the Linux-first setup used by this repository."
msgstr "Ar macOS, úsáid [Amharc ar gach eolas](https://lima-vm.io/) mar sin ritheann an tionscadal taobh istigh de thimpeallacht Linux in ionad go díreach ar an gcóras óstach. Úsáid Úsáid Úsáidte [Baile Breosla](https://brew.sh/) ar macOS a shuiteáil agus a bhainistiú Lima, ansin reáchtáil an gnáth [Socrú tionscadail Linux-dhírithe](../setup.md) taobh istigh den timpeallacht Lima. Coinníonn sé seo an sreabhadh oibre forbartha níos gaire don chéad thus Linux a úsáideann an stór seo."

