# libretranslate
msgid "On the **first deployment**, or after a factory reset, the token does not yet exist because the bootstrap has not run yet. A second common cause is that [`roles/sys-service-loader/tasks/load_service.yml`](../../../roles/sys-service-loader/tasks/load_service.yml) skips `load/app.yml` when the Matomo container is already reachable. In that case the container is healthy but the token file is still absent from the token store, so the variable arrives empty."
msgstr "Ar an **an chéad imscaradh**, nó tar éis athshocrú mhonarcha, nach bhfuil an chomhartha ann fós toisc nach bhfuil an boottrap reáchtáil go fóill. Is é an dara cúis coitianta go [`roles/sys-service-loader/tasks/load_service.yml`](../../../roles/sys-service-loader/tasks/load_service.yml) Seirbhís do Chustaiméirí `load/app.yml` nuair a bhíonn an coimeádán Matomo insroichte cheana féin. Sa chás sin tá an coimeádán sláintiúil ach tá an comhad chomhartha fós as láthair ón siopa chomhartha, mar sin tagann an athróg folamh."

