# libretranslate
msgid "Once all branch-caused failures are addressed, you MUST `git push` the branch on which you iterated to the operator's fork. For any root cause you could not resolve, you MUST file a separate issue per [External Failures](#external-failures) describing what was attempted and why it remains unresolved."
msgstr "Nuair a bhíonn gach teip brainse-caused aghaidh, MUST tú `git push` an brainse ar a d'éiligh tú le forc an oibreora. Chun aon chúis fhréamh nach bhféadfaí tú a réiteach, MUST tú comhad ceist ar leith in aghaidh [Teipeanna Seachtracha](#external-failures) cur síos ar cad a bhí iarracht agus cén fáth go bhfuil sé gan réiteach."

