# libretranslate
msgid "Once the Matomo bootstrap has run, either later in the same play or on the next Ansible invocation, `sys-token-store` writes the token to disk. On the **next play run** the token is resolved from the store, the condition evaluates to false, and `inject.yml` executes normally: registering the site at Matomo and injecting the tracking code into the target application."
msgstr "Nuair a bheidh an buataisí Matomo reáchtáil, ina dhiaidh sin sa spraoi céanna nó ar an invocation Ansible eile, `sys-token-store` scríobhann an chomhartha go diosca. Ar an **reáchtáil spraoi seo chugainn** go réitítear an dearbhán ón siopa, déantar meastóireacht ar an riocht go bréagach, agus `inject.yml` fhorghníomhú de ghnáth: clárú ar an suíomh ag Matomo agus instealladh an cód rianú isteach san iarratas sprioc."

# libretranslate
msgid "Once the failing mode is green in its focused loop, you MUST resume the roundtrip over the failed app plus the apps that have not run yet (`apps=\"<failed-app> <still-untested apps in complexity order>\"`), and you MUST NOT restart the full sweep from the top. Apps that already went green earlier in the same run stay green; re-running them wastes one swarm rebuild each."
msgstr "Nuair a bheidh an modh ag teip glas ina lúb dírithe, MUST tú atosú ar an roundtrip thar an app theip móide na apps nach bhfuil ar siúl go fóill (`apps=\"<failed-app> <still-untested apps in complexity order>\"`), agus MUST tú NACH atosú an scuab iomlán as an mbarr. Apps a chuaigh cheana glas níos luaithe sa rith chéanna fanacht glas; ath-reáchtáil iad dramhaíolaí swarm amháin atógáil gach."

# libretranslate
msgid "Once the root cause is understood, you MUST apply the real fix in the repository files and then continue the redeploy loop with the usual commands from this page. In-container fixes are only for diagnosis or short validation and MUST NOT replace the repo change."
msgstr "Chomh luath agus a thuigtear an chúis fhréamh, MUST tú iarratas a dhéanamh ar an shocrú fíor sna comhaid stór agus ansin leanúint ar aghaidh leis an lúb ath-imlonnaithe leis na horduithe is gnách ón leathanach seo. Ní hamháin go bhfuil socrúcháin neamhchoinneálach le haghaidh diagnóis nó bailíochtaithe gearr agus NACH MUST in ionad an athraithe repo."

