# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Only Open WebUI carries a per-server user boundary, through the `mcp` RBAC group it grants per provider. Flowise and OpenClaw instead declare an `mcp` role their auth proxy admits alongside `administrator`, which is the documented trust domain the criterion allows: holding it reaches every provider that client is admitted to. n8n's MCP block is disabled. Hermes has neither: `meta/rbac.yml` declares `roles: {}` and `services.sso.enabled` is false, so its whole MCP surface is bounded by the shared `API_SERVER_KEY` alone. Whether that counts as an isolated trust domain is an operator decision, not something the declarations settle."
msgstr "Ní dhéanann ach WebUI Oscailte teorainn úsáideora per-freastalaí, tríd an `mcp` Grúpa RBAC deontais sé in aghaidh an tsoláthraí. Flowise agus OpenClaw dhearbhú ina ionad sin `mcp` ról a ligeann a n-vótálaí auth taobh `administrator`, a bhfuil an bhfearann muinín doiciméadaithe ceadaíonn an critéar: a bhfuil sroicheann sé gach soláthraí go bhfuil cliant a ligean isteach. n8n Tá bloc MCP faoi mhíchumas. Tá Hermes ceachtar: `meta/rbac.yml` a dhearbhú `roles: {}` agus `services.sso.enabled` bréagach, mar sin tá a dhromchla iomlán MCP faoi cheangal ag an roinnte `API_SERVER_KEY` amháin. Cibé an bhfuil comhaireamh mar réimse iontaobhais iargúlta cinneadh oibreoir, ní rud éigin a réiteach na dearbhuithe."

# libretranslate
msgid "Only a clean sweep of successes retires the suite. A shard that failed, was cancelled, timed out or skipped did not run through, and a run that holds no job for the suite at all never started it -- none of those is evidence the suite is good, so the retrigger keeps asking for it."
msgstr "Ní théann ach scuab glan de rath ar an seomra. A shard gur theip air, Cuireadh ar ceal, amaithe amach nó nach raibh skipped rith tríd, agus a reáchtáil go bhfuil aon phost don seomra riamh thosaigh sé - aon cheann de na fianaise go bhfuil an seomra go maith, mar sin coimeádann an retrigger iarraidh air."

# libretranslate
msgid "Only delete packages whose name starts with `<prefix>/`"
msgstr "Ach pacáistí a bhfuil a n-ainm a thosaíonn le `<prefix>/`"

# libretranslate
