# libretranslate
msgid "Open WebUI access tests MUST cover a user with one of several MCP groups, a user with no MCP group, a user in the wrong application's group, and removal of the user's last group. The known empty-group synchronization behavior MUST be fixed upstream, patched in the pinned image, or compensated by an explicit reconciliation/session-invalidation mechanism before strict revocation is claimed."
msgstr "Open WebUI tástálacha rochtana MUST chlúdach úsáideoir le ceann de roinnt grúpaí MCP, úsáideoir gan aon ghrúpa MCP, úsáideoir i ngrúpa an iarratais mícheart, agus a bhaint de ghrúpa deiridh an úsáideora. MUST an t-iompar sioncrónaithe folamh-ghrúpa ar a dtugtar a shocrú sruth, patched san íomhá pinned, nó a chúiteamh trí athmhuintearas follasach / seisiún-luacháil meicníocht sula ndéantar ceiliúradh dian a éileamh."

