msgstr "Tógann WebUI Oscailte MCP trína thacaíocht uirlis-freastalaí dúchais. Déantar gach ról freastalaí MCP roinnte a imscaradh ``TOOL_SERVER_CONNECTIONS`` mar a ``type: mcp`` iontráil."

# libretranslate
msgid "Open WebUI has environment-backed configuration with persistence disabled. The reconciler MUST reapply the complete desired connection and access grant after every process start, then verify it through the API. Restarting only the Open WebUI container MUST converge to the same enabled connections and grants as a full deployment."
msgstr "Open WebUI Tá cumraíocht timpeallacht-tacaíocht le mharthanacht faoi mhíchumas. Déanann an MUST réiteoir an ceangal iomlán atá ag teastáil agus an deontas rochtana a athchur i bhfeidhm tar éis gach próiseas a thosú, ansin é a fhíorú tríd an API. Atosú ach an coimeádán WebUI Oscailte MUST converge leis na naisc agus deontais cumasaithe céanna mar imscaradh iomlán."

# libretranslate
msgid "Open WebUI stores its tool servers in its own configuration, so a deployment that already holds connections answers every later read with them. A client MUST reconcile that answer against the declared set instead of adopting it: reading it as the desired state leaves a newly declared provider registered nowhere and a rotated bearer registered stale, in both cases without a failure. Clients that render their whole configuration each run, such as Hermes and OpenClaw, do not carry this class."
msgstr "Open WebUI siopaí a freastalaithe uirlis ina chumraíocht féin, mar sin imscaradh go bhfuil cheana féin naisc freagraí gach níos déanaí a léamh leo. A MUST cliant réiteach go freagra i gcoinne an tsraith dhearbhaithe in ionad é a ghlacadh: léamh mar a fhágann an stát atá ag teastáil soláthraí nua-fhógair cláraithe áit ar bith agus iompróir rothlaithe cláraithe stale, sa dá chás gan teip. Cliaint a fhágann a n-cumraíocht iomlán gach reáchtáil, mar shampla Hermes agus OpenClaw, nach bhfuil a dhéanamh ar an rang seo."

# libretranslate
msgid "Open WebUI's `ToolServerConnection` accepts bearer, session, system_oauth and oauth_2.1. A server whose scheme it cannot present is skipped rather than registered with an unusable credential, so a basic-auth server such as Jenkins does not appear here."
msgstr "Oscail WebUI ar `ToolServerConnection` Glacann bearer, seisiún, system_oauth agus oauth_2.1. Tá freastalaí a bhfuil a scéim nach féidir é a chur i láthair skipped seachas cláraithe le dintiúir unusable, mar sin ní freastalaí bunúsach-auth ar nós Jenkins le feiceáil anseo."

