# libretranslate
msgid "Operating-system package managers such as [apt](https://wiki.debian.org/Apt), [pacman](https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/pacman) and [dnf](https://dnf.readthedocs.io/) keep installed software in sync with their upstream distribution repositories. Each one ships with a different command surface but they all serve the same goal: refresh the index and upgrade every installed package on the host."
msgstr "BainisteoirÃ pacáiste oibriúcháin ar nós [apt apt](https://wiki.debian.org/Apt), [pacman](https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/pacman) agus [taiseachas aeir: fliuch](https://dnf.readthedocs.io/) a choinneáil bogearraí suiteáilte i sync lena stórtha dáilte sruth. Gach long amháin le dromchla ordú éagsúla ach freastal siad go léir ar an sprioc chéanna: athnuachan an t-innéacs agus uasghrádú gach pacáiste suiteáilte ar an óstach."

