# libretranslate
msgid "Outbound mail health checks no longer fail silently on minimal container images: the heartbeat-email script copes with images that ship without the hostname binary, and the SSL trust file path is detected automatically across Red Hat, Debian, Ubuntu, Alpine and NixOS layouts."
msgstr "Seiceálacha sláinte poist outbound theipeann a thuilleadh go ciúin ar íomhánna coimeádán íosta: an croí-email cóipeáil script le híomhánna a long gan an dénártha Hostname, agus tá an cosán comhad muinín SSL bhrath go huathoibríoch ar fud Red Hat, Debian, Ubuntu, leagan amach Alpach agus NixOS."

# libretranslate
